<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Mbembe Osopong [MFNOs]</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samwẹl</para>
  <para style="toc1">Icheden-nwẹr s'Samwẹl</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samwẹl</para>
  <para style="mt1">Icheden-nwẹr s'Samwẹl</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ẹmmaana ch'Samwẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Wa ọkhaam ujunung mạnna wạnọ kw'okpen Ẹlkana, kw'ubin Rama, k'ukhubha kw'Zuph, k'okpecho kw'Ephraim. Ẹma wa ode nnwa kw'Jeroham. Jeroham wa ode nnwa kw'Elihu, Elihu ode nnwa kw'Tohu, kw'Zuph kw'ubin Ephraim ofhonu. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Ẹlkana wa ọtạk ipanạng afa p'akpen Hana ọttạra Pẹnina. Wa Pẹnina ọmaanẹ iva, okhenka, Hana nnwa nọ́maana.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Wa cho kwidede, Ẹlkana n'ubina kakhẹ k'ofhon ofona k'Shilo bẹ, ọta okpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa phyibh, ọbạra ọfọhnọ ẹja ọnạng-ẹ. Wa iva afa p'Ẹli p'ade Hophini ọttạra Phinẹhas ade afọhnẹja p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />De ukpir k'okpe kw'Ẹlkana m'ọta ọfọhnọ ẹja, m'okhebh nten ọnạng Pẹnina, ọttạra iva pẹ phyibh, ajunung ọttạra ipanạng. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Okhenkha, wa n'ọnạng Hana okhebh f'ode ibyi ifa oche kw'ọnạngẹ oyok, ukwuru idạdaakha s'ọkhaam Hana abẹ, ọttạra bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi Hana ọmaan nọ́nạnga. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Wa ọfhạbha kw'Hana n'unnukh-ẹ ọfha osenga ma, ettem ipyibh-ẹ, ukwuru s'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nạn Hana ọmaan nọ́nạnga. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Wa innukhu njọ efon ororo k'icho kwidede. K'okpe kwidede kw'Hana ofon k'ọchọhm kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, oyok-ọfhạbha m'unnukh-ẹ tạrr Hana bạra ọgạma, ọbạra ufhum uchiattọhk. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Ẹlkana kw'ode udim kwẹ bạra ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Hana, n'agạma mbạng o? Asi yạn afhum uchiattọhk chichi o? Imạmạna sọ ide yạn? Tọttọ amma oyeni khọ udik nạ́mbạra nyọhnga ajunungva jobh?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Wa iwu jạnẹ k'Shilo ma sabẹ kk'uchiattọhk achia phyibh, abẹ akkera atwuk agwo, Hana ubina obe. Ma okpe ngwọ, Ẹli kw'ode ọfọhnẹja uning ẹyạr k'ogbera kw'n'uninga k'ẹkpọmmachi ch'ọchọhm kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />K'imạmạna s'ining-ẹ k'ẹttem, Hana ọgạm, ose njọhm ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />N'ọtạk echekha bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa phyibh, ode nạngka ase imạmạna s'amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ, abạra ajim-m, akhenka anạng-m ujunungnwa, amma m'ntạkh-ẹ nnạng-ọ k'akpen pẹ phyibh, ẹgọbha jạnẹ-jạnẹ isisira sẹ mítwu mesese.”<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Oche ngwọ kw'Hana ofon ororo n'ose njọhm ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, Ẹli n'ogẹ-ẹ utum k'ẹmma. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Wa Hana n'ose njọhm k'ettem ẹtaanga, mmakpa sẹ rọ n'iyebh, okhenka, ọtọhnga k'iyaan núyina. Ma wọ, Ẹli n'ọkkẹ bẹ, Hana kk'atwuk ubuma. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />N'oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Okpe m'ubhir ukpira yạn kw'm'aninga k'itwuk-buma o? Kuma itwuk-gwua khadẹ.”<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Ma wọ, Hana n'ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Attitte kwaam, oche ngwọ núdia e. Amma nde ikwanạng kw'imạmạna ifu-ẹ k'ettem. Atwuk nạ́ngwua a, amma n'mkpaak Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi imạmạna s'ining-m k'ettem. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ masẹ ikwạnạng-tạma kátạkha. Amma n'nse njọhm ukwuru ọmmaphyaangẹ kwididen ọttạra ottempyibh kw'uning-m maa e.”<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Ma wọ, Ẹli ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Sọhng k'idira. Tte Ubinọkpaabyi kw'anạng p'Israẹl n'akpobha, ọnạng-ọ fidede f'kk-ẹ aphyema.”<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Hana ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Tte amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ nkhaama ọphyaam k'akhọ k'ititikha.” Ma wọ n'ofon ọta uchi uchiattọhk, ititikha ikpira.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Pạmpạmạm k'ekpebha, abẹ abina ata akpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, brasẹ abẹ n'akpa nnạm k'abẹ k'ofhon k'Rama. Ma o, Ẹlkana uyima Hana abẹ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhaanga njọhm s'Hana. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Ukwu ukpir k'okpe ma, Hana utima ifhạr ọmaan ujunungnwa, ukpuẹ-ẹ Samwẹl<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Samwẹl, k'eHibru iyini oche kw'wạra ọnạng m'oben bẹ́, “Eche chẹ ede Ubinọkpaabyi.” Hana ọnạngẹ nnwa kwẹ eche njọ ọfha utima ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl ikpukpobha, s'ọbhaang njọhm sẹ, ọnạng-ẹ f'ororu ọbạbh-ẹ.</char></note>, oben bẹ́, “Mphyem-ẹ k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hana otte Samwẹl ọbọhk ọnạng Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Masẹ Ẹlkana utim ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ phyibh ofona k'ọchọhm kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ọfha ọta ọfọhnọ ẹja ch'cho, ọbạra utwuk echekha chẹ, <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Hana nọ́ta. Obeni udim bẹ́, “Ode kk'nnwa ẹba nkuma, m'ntạkh-ẹ nkkena Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'ọchọhm kwẹ, m'uruk ma k'akpen pẹ phyibh.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Ma wọ Ẹlkana ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Si oche kw'abeni, ninga ma tạrr akum-ẹ ẹba. Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi okhenka ochok echekha ch'atim pọ.” Ma wọ, ikwanạng nwọ uning ọrạk nnwa kwẹ tạrr ukum-ẹ ẹba.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Masẹ kk'nnwa ẹba ukuma, ọtạkh-ẹ s'utim ọsạkh-ọsạkha, ọttạra ọbhaam-nwa kw'icho ittaan, ọttạra ẹgbangbang-dim ch'agwu-akhokh'apẹ, ọttạra itwuk-gbạre utima ofona k'ọchọhm kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Masẹ abẹ kk'ọbhaam-nwa nwọ afha atima afọhnọ ẹja, abẹ atạkha nnwa nwọ akkena Ẹli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Hana n'obeni Ẹli bẹ́, “O attitte kwaam, totokhạn, k'oche kw'aruk akpen afona ororo, amma nchekhi k'akpen pọ bẹ́, amma wọ nde ikwanạng nwọ kw'uwa obe ma ose njọhm ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi e. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Amma wa nse njọhm mphyẹm Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nnwa nwa, ma o, kk'ephyema chaam ọbhaanga e. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Ma wọ, amma n'ntạk nnwa nwa nnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi e. Ẹma n'ode kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'akpen pẹ phyibh.” Abẹ atwunga anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ikpukpobha ma.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Hana ọtọhng Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Ma wọ, Hana ose njọhm oben bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">“Amma nkhaam ottennebh kwididen k'ettem chaam k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'aam ẹfa ch'ekhema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">K'eHibru, abẹ akkẹrẹ bẹ́, “Ubhik kwaam kk'udira k'ẹrạng k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.” Mama uyini bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kaam ẹfa ch'ekhema ọnạnga.” </char></note> ọnạnga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Amma n'nsi awawunanạng paam ẹmma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">ukwuru s'nkhaam ottennebh k'ẹnnaanga chọ.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />“Ọnạng kw'uwuru masẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kòde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">ọnạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk kòde, oyonga ọma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">Ẹtakpa kède ch'ẹkpọhkhọ masẹ Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />“Abạnga nnyang kási k'ọkpaakha-dik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">Abạnga ẹmma kási,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">ukwuru bẹ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'esonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">ẹma wọ n'usi aponga p'usisi kw'anạng.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />“Ayuk p'akke-kkamankkam kk'aphyạkha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:4">okhenka, anạng p'asir atto, kk'ẹfa abạra akhaama.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Anạng mbọ p'uwa n'achi adọhbh, n'ayin ayok abẹ, brasẹ abẹ n'ase uchiattọhk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">okhenka, anạng mbọ p'uwa n'ayima okwo, n'achi uchiattọhk adọhbh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Ikwanạng kw'uwa ode ujidim, kk'iva asenọfa ọmaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">okhenka, oyok kw'uwa ọmaanẹ iva k'ọsaabh, mantọhmma n'oworu wong.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />“Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ utim obo, ọbạra utima akpen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">ẹma wọ n'utima apfura ofona k'ipfura-fhon, ọbạra utima bạnọ ọkpa nnạm.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'ọtọhm upyibhada, ọbạra ọtọhm ujibhada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">Ẹma wọ n'ọsạkha anạng bạnọ ininga, ọbạra udira ayok bạnọ k'ẹrạng.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Ẹma wọ n'udira akpukpora k'idọhngọ, ọbạra udira anạng p'oworu bẹ owor k'ẹsạmma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">ọnạng bẹ ininga k'ibyi s'avạvaara, ọbạra usi bẹ aninga ẹyạr k'mvaarchi s'ikpukpobha.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:8" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ utim agbaarẹ p'avạk ọyagbin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">ma agbaarẹ mbọ bọ ọnạn ọyagbin.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Ẹma wọ n'okkeri osenga kw'anạng p'n'aphye nnạm k'akhẹ-ẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">okhenka, m'udimi abyibyanạng k'urungubạnga.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">“Ẹfa ch'ọnạng irima mékke ekhema,<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'udimi anạng p'arim abẹ udimi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Ẹma oyeni m'uninga k'ẹrạng ọtta bẹ itum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'ọkpaara aponga p'iyagbin phyibh.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">“Ẹma oyeni m'ọnạng ọvaarnạng kwẹ akpọkhọhdọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">ọbạra ọnạng ọnạng kw'kk'ana obyenga k'echo ẹfa ch'ekhema.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Ma wọ Ẹlkana ubin ọbhạna kha Rama, okhenka, udikobh-nwa nwọ uning k'isekhisek kw'Ẹli kw'ode ọfọhnẹja, n'usi ọtọhm k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abyibyia-va p'Ẹli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Wa ajunungva p'Ẹli ade abyibyiava; abẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi masẹ ọttọhk nátạkha. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Wa ode ẹmmaana ch'afọhnẹja k'ngekha s'anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, okpe kwidede kw'ọnạng ọfọhnọ ẹja, masẹ eten ch'abẹ atim afọhnọ ẹja itim ẹnnọhn k'ekpon, ọtọhmnạng kw'ọfọhnẹja m'utima ijum ch'ẹkhaam asa attaan, <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />ukwu ukhum k'isọhkha-khira sidede sabẹ atim awọhn eten njọ. Eten chidede ch'ijum njọ ewong, ẹjọ ch'ọfọhnẹja m'ọtạkha. Ukhira ngwọ gwọ kw'uwa abẹ n'asi anạng anạng p'Israẹl phyi-phyibh p'ata k'Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Brasẹ abẹ n'akkạmọ iyaak s'ẹjaten njọ, atọhmnạng p'ọfọhnẹja m'ata akhebha ọnạng kw'n'ọfọhnọ ẹja aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Khiri kha, nạng ọfọhnẹja nten rạnẹ ọbhaabh, deja móchera ọtạkha eten ẹwọhnachẹ e, oyonga ikhikhebhi.”<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Ode ọnạng kw'n'oben bẹ ọfọhnọ ẹja nạn ochera, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Mma e, tte abẹ abhaabh chẹ ọbhaabh bạra, fha atạkha okhebh f'ọdaakh-ọ,” ọtọhmnạng kw'ọfọhnẹja bạra ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Mesese, nemeden nạng-m chẹ mantọhmma, deja, m'ntạkha chẹ k'ẹfa.”<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Wa usisi kw'adikkobh mbọ p'Ẹli ode ẹkhọngkwuru chididen k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ukwuru s'uwa abẹ n'atạkha nnạnga s'anạng m'anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi asi oche kw'ọdaakhẹ bẹ.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Wa Samwẹl kw'n'usi ọtọhm k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, n'oge ọnọhma-khira kw'okpen ẹphọd. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Cho kwidede, Hana n'ọbọhra ọnọhma wuraam okkena Samwẹl okpe kw'ẹma ọttạra udim n'ata afọhnọ ẹja. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Ẹli bạra odo Ẹlkana ọttạra ikwanạng kwẹ, oben Ẹlkana bẹ, “Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udi-ọ ọttạra iva adwạkh-ọdwạk p'm'afhon ma ikwanạng nwa, pa m'atera echo ch'oyok kw'ophyemi, bạra ọtạkh-ẹ ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.” Abẹ abina abhạna. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi Hana ọphyaam. Hana ọbạra ọmaan ajunung attaan, ọttạra ipanạng afa. Ma okpe ngwọ, Samwẹl ọbạrẹ k'ọgbọ, k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Ma okpe ngwọ, Ẹli kw'kk'ọtạma kidaam-kidaam ọbhaang idik sidede s'iva pẹ n'asi anạng p'Israẹl phyibh, ọttạra oche kw'abẹ n'ayima ipanạng p'n'asi ọtọhm k'ẹbakhamma ch'ukkira kw'etobha abẹ. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Ma wọ, obeni bẹ bẹ́, “Amma kk'ibyibyia-mmaana chabạnga mmaanga k'anạng p'Israẹl phyibh e. Abạnga asi yạn asi idik demasẹ nnọ o? <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Mma e, iva paam. Idik s'n'mmaanga otena bạnga, s'n'inyaamẹ k'ikhaana s'anạng p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi níjibha a. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Ode ọnạng ọkhaam ipina k'ititikha s'oyokhanạng, Ubinọkpaabyi m'okkokke uchini k'echo ch'ọnạng nwọ. Okhenkha, de ọnạng n'otto k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, anẹ wọ n'abạra uchini k'echo ch'ọnạng nwọma o?” Tạrr oseng mạma, iva mbọ ẹtọhng-twạra ch'otte nátạkha masẹ ọttọhk, ukwuru s'ode nttọhna s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ, ọtạkha akpen p'iva mbọ.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Wa Samwẹl ofon ororo ọbạr k'ebe, ọttạra k'ọphyaam f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ọttạra f'ayokhanạng.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ẹyaakha-pyibha etena ẹchọhmfhạr ch'Ẹli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Iwu jạnẹ, usi-ẹyaakha kw'Ubinọkpaabyi ukwu okhebha Ẹli, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ma wọ ode udik kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni, ‘Amma wọ wa nyaakhẹ ifor saam nnạng ẹchọhmfhạr ch'atte, Aarọn, k'okpe kw'uwa abẹ aning k'isekhisek kw'Phero k'Ijip. <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Amma wa ntek atte k'nnạmma s'Israẹl bẹ, ode ọfọhnẹja kwaam, ọfha n'ofona k'ijabyi saam, n'ọkkạmọ ekpo py'erebhi iruk, ọbạra oge ẹphọd k'ititikha saam. Amma wa ntạk nnạnga ibhaabh-bhaabhsẹ s'anạng p'Israẹl anạngẹ, sabẹ nnạng ẹchọhmfhạr ch'atte. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Abạnga n'asi yạn atạkha njafọhna saam, ọttạra nnạnga saam, ch'ntek k'ọchọhm kwaam abyạrẹ mfhokh o? Ọma Ẹli, iva pọ n'asi yạn abạr ọma udik ọtạm ayọhnga amma, bạra n'atte bẹ ọbọhk, abạnga atekha nten ikkasẹ k'ẹja ch'anạng paam Israẹl achi o?’<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />“Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl usi ẹyaakha bẹ́, ‘Amma kk'nchekha bẹ́, anạng p'ẹchọhmfhạr chọ, ọttạra ch'atte kwọ m'asi ọtọhm k'ititikha saam tạrr ipimmanitor.’ Okhenkha, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'obeni bẹ, ‘Akwẹ dạkhẹ oche ngwọ mode mesese! Anạng mbọ p'akpobh-m, ẹbọ m'mkpobha, mbọ p'annukh-m, ẹbọ mkpạr m'isi. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Okpe ukwuma, kwa m'mkpaara akpen p'anạng p'ẹnạmma chọ. Ọnạng kwa m'ọbạra uruk ọtạm-ọtạm k'ẹnạmma chọ kòde. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />M'atima ottemma ase ujibhada kw'm'ọnạng Israẹl. Ọtạmanạng k'ẹnạmma chọ dạk múninga. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Ọnạng kwidede kw'nchokhu akpen k'ijabyi saam, m'uruk akpen pẹ k'ikwosi ọttạra imạmạna k'ettem chẹ. Iva pọ, ọttạra iva p'iva pọ phyibh m'ape k'idikobh ch'akpen pabẹ.<verse eid="1SA 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />“ ‘Udik kwa m'otto okhebha ajunungva pọ afa, p'ade Hophini ọttạra Phinẹhas, m'ode ẹkhọhkha ọnạng-ọ. Abẹma anạng afa m'ape k'iwu jạnẹ. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Amma m'ntekha ọfọhnẹja nnạng ammoyeni, kw'm'ọsạkha echo ọnạng-m, kw'm'ọbạra usi udik kwidede otor k'ẹkka chaam. Amma m'nttima ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ ebe <char style="it">bẹ gwuk,</char> ẹma m'ọbạra usi ọtọhm k'okpe kwidede k'ititikha s'ọnạng kwaam kw'm'ntekha. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Ma wọ ọnạng kwidede k'ẹnạmma chọ m'ọsạkha echo onạng-ẹ, k'silva ọbạra ọnạng-ẹ uchiattọhk, ọbạra uchin-ẹ bẹ, “Totokhạn, rạbh-m mgba nde ọnạng kw'n'usi ọtọhm kw'ofohnẹja, ọfha nse uchiattọhk f'm'nchi.” ’ ”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oyeri Samwẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Wa udikkobh-nwa kw'ode Samwẹl n'usi ọtọhm k'isekhisek kw'Ẹli, k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ma okpe ngwọ, ọkhar-ọkhaarẹ bẹ́ ọnạng ọbhaanga ẹyaakha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, anạng p'n'ase iyaan nábạra asaabha.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />K'irunguwu jạnẹ, Ẹli kw'uwa nạn adạkhẹ iyaan mororo kạnóse, uyim k'ibyiyimasẹ sẹ. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Okpe kw'utukkạng kw'Ubinọkpaabyi nạn tạm núdima, wa Samwẹl uyim k'ibyirukhasẹ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, k'ibyi s'ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi ining. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oyeri Samwẹl.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:4">Samwẹl ochera bẹ́, “Attitte, kkeri amma ma.”<verse eid="1SA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Ọrạbh okhebha Ẹli, ọben bẹ́, “Kkeri amma ma, ọma wọ ayer-m.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Okhenkha, Ẹli ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Amma khọ nạ́nyera, kpa nnạm ata ayima.” Ma wọ Samwẹl ọta uyima.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbạra oyer-ẹ, “Samwẹl.” Samwẹl ọbạra ubina okhebha Ẹli, ọbẹ́, “Kkeri amma ma e, ọma wọ ayer-m.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Ẹli ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, amma kọ nạ́nyera, kpa nnạm ata ayima.”<verse eid="1SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Wa Samwẹl Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi tạma nósonga, abẹ ẹyaakha ch'ọtọhnga kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi tạma násia anạng-ẹ.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oyeri Samwẹl ottong nden nttaan, Samwẹl ubina ọta okhebha Ẹli, ọbẹ́, “Kkeri amma ma, ọma wọ ayer-m.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Ma wọ Ẹli n'utini bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ n'oyeri udikobh-nwa nwọ. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Ma wọ, Ẹli n'obeni Samwẹl bẹ, “Ọma sọhng ata ayima. De oyer-ọ dạkhẹ, ben bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kpaak, khiri amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ n'nka nkhọhmọ itọhng.’ ’’ Ma wọ, Samwẹl ofon ọta uyima k'ibyi sẹ.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ukwu obe ma, oyeri oche kwa wạra n'oyeri, ọbẹ́, “Samwẹl, Samwẹl o!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Ma wọ Samwẹl ubhin bẹ́, “Kpaak, khiri amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ n'nka nkhọmọ itọhng.”<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'obeni Samwẹl bẹ́, “Kker e, amma n'mben bẹ́ nsi udik k'Israẹl, kwa m'okkona ọnạng kwidede kw'ọbhaang kwẹ. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Ma iwu njọ ma, amma m'nsi udik kwidede kwa kk'nchekha nnạng ẹchọhmfhạr ch'Ẹli, gwạnọ-gwạnọ múrik. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Amma m'nsi oche ngwọ ukwuru bẹ, amma mkpaakh-ẹ bẹ́, m'mkpaara iponga s'ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ k'ipimmanitor, ukwuru ipyibha ch'ẹma oyeni osong. Chibhi s'ajunungva pẹ annukhu Ubinọkpaabyi, bẹ eden nọ́kpa a. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Ma wọ, nchekhi nnạng ẹchọhmfhạr ch'Ẹli bẹ́, ‘Ẹjafọhnọ kède, ẹnạnga kẹ́bra ede ch'm'ekpobhu iponga-pyibha s'ẹchọhmfhạr ch'Ẹli.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Wa Samwẹl uyim tạrr iwu echobha, ubina ugwunga ammakhubh p'ọchọhm kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Wa ojor-ẹ bẹ́, ọkpaak Ẹli udik kw'ose, <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />okhenka, wa Ẹli oyer-ẹ, ọbẹ, “Nnwa kwaam, Samwẹl.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Samwẹl ochera bẹ, “Oo! Kkeri amma ma e.”<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Ẹli ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Ẹma ọkpaakh-ọ yạn o? Khaam udik kádubh o. Tte Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạng-ọ irem s'ibaan-ọ, ode adubh-m udik kwidede kw'ọkpaakh-ọ.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Ma wọ, Samwẹl ọkpaakh-ẹ udik kwidede, gwạnọ-gwạnọ khẹ núdubha. Ma o, Ẹli n'obeni bẹ́, “Ẹma wọ ode Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi e, tte usi oche kw'ọdaakh-ẹ.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Masẹ Samwẹl n'ọbạr, wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uning abẹ, ọbạra usi udik kwidede kw'Samwẹl ọkpaakhẹ, ọkhaama ẹyaakha. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl phyi-phyibh, tạma k'Dan tạrr ukpira k'Beershẹba, acher k'udik ọkka bẹ́, Samwẹl ode usi-ẹyaakha kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ofon ororo n'usi ẹyaakha ch'ifor sẹ k'Shilo, ma Shilo wọ n'usi ẹyaakha ch'ifor sẹ ọnạng Samwẹl.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Wa ọkpaakhadik kw'Samwẹl ọnyaamẹ ọbaabha Israẹl.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1SA 4:1">APhilistiya avạk Ikwukwur s'echekha</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Ma okpe ngwọ, wa anạng p'Israẹl afon bẹ́ ata arima aPhilistiya abẹ. Anạng p'Israẹl abhingi k'Ẹbẹneza, aPhilistiya abhing k'Aphẹk. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />APhilistiya atọhmọ ikhaana s'akpongnạng pabẹ bẹ́ abẹ ata attạma anạng p'Israẹl abẹ. Masẹ ekpong ẹnyaamẹ, wa aPhilistiya akhem anạng p'Israẹl, abẹ afhọ anạng nnọhna jobh k'akpongchen. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />K'okpe akpongnạng p'anaang k'ekpong n'akwun k'ibyibhingasẹ, adecho p'Israẹl n'abạbhọ ayok bẹ́, “Oseng yạn kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'otte aPhilistiya ọbọhk abẹ akhema mạna chemma o? Tte anta andira ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'Shilo, ọfha itwạn mạna abẹ, ibạra ikkaana mạna k'mbọhk s'awawunanạng pamạna.”<verse eid="1SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Ma wọ, abẹ atọhmọ akpongnạng kha Shilo, abẹ ata adira ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa phyibh, kw'uning k'ngekha s'achẹrubim, atima akwu. Wa ajunungva afa p'Ẹli, p'ade Hophini ọttạra Phinẹhas aning ma ọttạra ikwukwur nnọ s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Masẹ ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ikpir k'ibyibhingasẹ, anạng p'Israẹl phyibh awur ẹmạng ch'enyengi isisek. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Masẹ aPhilistiya abhaang ẹkhọr njọ, abẹ abạbh bẹ́, “Bạng ẹmạng khira jọ abẹ n'awur k'ibyibhingasẹ s'aHiburu o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:6">Masẹ abẹ abhaang bẹ́, ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ikpira k'ibyibhingasẹ s'aHiburu, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />aPhilistiya ojoru bẹ, abẹ aben bẹ́, “Ọkha mạnna vunọ kk'ukpira k'ibyibhingasẹ e. Kk'andima e. Udik demakwẹ ngwa tạma núyina bạra o. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Akwẹ k'upyibh ọnạng mạna! Mbẹ, anẹ wọ m'ọrạbha mạna k'mbọhk s'ikha nna s'ikhaam ẹfa mạnna o? Ikha nnọ rọ wa isi bạra ọkhạnkhạmọ k'ukhira-k'ukhira otto okhebha anạng p'Ijip k'uminkpa e! <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Abạr ettem, aPhilistiya! Asi ijunung-ijunung, deja, abạnga m'abhạkhẹ ade abira p'aHiburu, oche kw'uwa abẹ kk'adia anạng bạnga. Akpọkhọ ifor mas'ajunung arima irima!”<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Ma wọ aPhilistiya arim irima, abẹ akhema anạng p'Israẹl, ọnạng-ọnạng ọrạbh ọta uttubha k'ukkira kwẹ. Wa ẹnạngfha ẹbạrẹ tạrr, akpongnạng p'aseng k'mfhok p'Israẹl adimi akpira nnọhna arạbh attaan ukuma chi. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Wa aPhilistiya avạk anạng p'Israẹl ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi ana. Ajunungva afa p'Ẹli p'ade Hophini ọttạra Phinẹhas abạra ape.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obo kw'Ẹli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Ma iwu njọ jạnẹ, ọnạng mạnna wạnọ kw'ubin k'efona ch'Bẹnjamin ọrạbhọ k'akpongchen ofona k'Shilo, ọvạra f'ifor k'ọyaakha, adọngọ abẹ kha echo. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Masẹ ukwu ukpira, okhebha Ẹli kw'uning ẹyạr k'ogbera kwẹ n'okkeri k'eden, ojora awẹ kha ettem, ukwuru ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi. Masẹ ujunung nwọ ọnwa k'ofhon, ọbạra ọkpaak anạng idik s'kk'ittia, ẹmạng etto k'ofhon ubungukwẹ.<verse eid="1SA 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Ẹli ọbhaang ẹgạma njọ, n'ọbạbhọ bẹ́, “Ẹgạma nja iyini yạn o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:14">Ọnạng nwọ udwukha ofona okhebha Ẹli, <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />kw'ode icho arạbh annebung ukuma chikhanttaan, ọbạra ọkpa achen. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Ọnạng nwọ ọkpaakhẹ Ẹli bẹ́ “Napra mbina k'akpongchen ma. Nnạbhọ kha chemma nwama e.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Ẹli n'ọbạbhọ bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, bạng udik gwọ otto o?”<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Ujunung nwọ kw'utim ẹkkaabha njọ ukwu n'ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Anạng p'Israẹl arạbhọ k'ititikha s'aPhilistiya, akpongnạng kk'mạna apua k'ọsaabh. Ajunungva pọ afa p'ade Hophini ọttạra Phinẹhas kk'abạra apua, ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ifona a.”<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Masẹ ujunung nwọ ọkpaakhẹ udik opye ẹmma k'ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi o, Ẹli ọbạng-ọbạnga k'ogbera kw'uning ẹyạr k'ẹbaakhamma, otto nnạm-nnạm <char style="it">bẹ gwuroong,</char> ọphyạkhẹ ikhukhora, okhebha ma, ope, ukwuru s'kk'ọtạma, ọttạra k'adọbh p'ọkhaam. Wa Ẹli kk'Israẹl ọdạbha k'icho arạbh-afa.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Wa ọnyẹ kwẹ, kw'ode ikwanạng kw'Phinẹhas, utim k'ifhạr s'okpe kk'ofora kw'm'ọmaan. Masẹ ọbhaang ẹkkaabha njọ bẹ́, abẹ kk'ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi avạkha atima afona, ọttạra bẹ́, otte-ofon-udim ọttạra udim kwẹ kk'apua, ọmaan onnemeden ọtạm-ẹ sisi, okhebha ma, ọmaan. Okhenkha, wa ọmaan ọnẹ-ẹ ẹfa. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Masẹ n'abạra ope, ipanạng p'n'atikh-ẹ ọmaan aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tte nạng-ọ ojor khiri kk'ujunungnwa amaana.” Okhenkha, bẹ ẹmma nọ́tọhbha, bẹ itọhng nọ́bra ọkhọma.<verse eid="1SA 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Wa okpe nnwa nwọ Ikabọd, ọbẹ́, “Abrada p'Israẹl kk'adima,” ukwuru ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi s'aPhilistiya avạk atima afona, ọttạra obo kw'otte-ofon-udim, ọttạra udim kwẹ. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Ukwu oben bẹ́, “Abrada p'Israẹl kk'adima, ukwuru bẹ́ abẹ kk'ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi avạkha atima afona.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi k'ifhon s'aPhilistiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Masẹ aPhilistiya kk'Ikwukwur s'Echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi avạkha atima afona. Wa abẹ avạk bẹ sẹ ana k'Ẹbẹneza, abẹ atima sẹ afona k'ofhon kwabẹ kw'okpen Ashdọd. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Abẹ atạkha Ikwukwur s'Echekha ata achok k'ọkhapa kw'abẹ achokhu ọkha f'okpen Dagọn, abẹ achok sẹ abaanga ọkpatanwa kw'Dagọn. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Masẹ anạng p'Ashdọd n'aphyạbh k'ekpekpebha, abẹ n'ase bẹ́, Dagọn kk'uttia ukhubha ititikha k'isisek, ma ititikha s'ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi! Abẹ abina Dagọn abe k'ibyi sẹ. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Okhenkha, masẹ iwu ẹbạra echobha o, abẹ aphyạbh ase adạkhẹ bẹ́, Dagọn kk'adạkhẹ uttia ukhubha ititikha k'isisek, ma ititikha s'ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi! Echo kk'ẹkpaara, mbọhk kk'iphyạkha iyima ma esemachi ch'ẹchọhmma; ibukhu sẹ mạnkkeni rọ n'irikhi. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Ẹgwọ usi, tạrr ukpira chemma k'ofhon kw'Ashdọd, ode afọhnẹja p'Dagọn o, ọbạra ode anạng adwạkh-ọdwạk o, ọnạng kw'm'ọnwa k'ọkhapa kw'Dagọn kw'm'ọbhyạrẹ k'esemachi ch'ẹchọhmma kòde.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạng anạng p'Ashdọd ọkhạnkhạmọ kwididen; ọbạra usi ikhạmana s'ibirakpo imma bẹ. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Masẹ anạng p'Ashdọd ase idik s'itto ikhebha bẹ, abẹ aben bẹ́, “Ikwukwur s'echekha ch'ọkha f'Israẹl níbaana bẹ́, ininga dạkhẹ ittra mạna e, ukwuru bẹ́, asẹ kk'mạna, ọttạra Dagọn kw'ode ọkha famạna ọkhạnkhạmọ ọnạnga.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Ma wọ, abẹ ayeri adecho p'ẹkhạma ch'aPhilistiya phyibh atobha, abạbh bẹ bẹ́, “M'ansi yạn ọttạra ikwukwur nna s'echekha ch'ọkha f'Israẹl o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Wa abẹ abhin bẹ́, “Adira ikwukwur nnọ s'echekha ch'ọkha f'Israẹl atima afona k'ukhubha kw'Gat.” Ma wọ abẹ adir ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl abina. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Okhenkha, masẹ abẹ kk'sẹ adira, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbạra ọnạng anạng p'Gat ikhạmana s'ibirakpo, ọbạra oge ofhon ngwọ k'ojora fididen. Usi ikhạmana s'ibirakpo imma anạng p'ofhon ngwọ, tạma k'ọgbọsẹkhẹ kpira k'adennạng. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Ma wọ abẹ atọhmọ ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi afona kha Ẹkrọn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:10">Masẹ abẹ kk'ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl atima anwa k'Ẹkrọn, anạng p'Ẹkrọn atạma ẹmạng k'ẹrạng-k'ẹrạng gạgạma aben bẹ́, “Abẹ kk'ikwukwur s'echekha ch'ọkha f'Israẹl atima akwu bẹ́, abẹ akwu afhọ mạna ọttạra anạng pamạna e!” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Wa abẹ ayeri adecho p'aPhilistiya phyibh aben bẹ́, “Tte ikwukwur s'echekha ch'ọkha f'Israẹl ibina kamạna k'ofhon, ikpa nnạm k'ofhon kw'anạng p'akhaam sẹ, ọfha nạngẹ mạna ọttạra anạng pamạna ifhọ e.” Ukwuru bẹ, wa ojora kw'obo kk'ọnyaamma k'efhonfhạr phyi-phyibh. Wa Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ anạng mbọ ọkhạnkhạmọ kwididen. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Anạng p'uwa nạnápua aning k'ọkhạnkạmọ kw'ibirakpo, wa mmạng sabẹ agạm k'ofhon ikpir k'ẹrạng.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ikpa nnạm k'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Masẹ ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'aphye asenọfa ikkia k'APhilistiya k'mbọhk, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />abẹ ayeri afọhnẹja, ọttạra abọhnganạng p'Aphilistiya, abạbh bẹ́, “M'ansi yạn ọttạra ikwukwur nna s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi o? Akpaak mạna eden ch'm'ansenga antọhm sẹ ikpa nnạm k'ibyi s'asẹ ibin ikwu.”<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Abẹ abhina bẹ́, “Abạnga ikwukwur nna s'ọkha f'Israẹl mbọhk-mbọhk kátọhm ikpa nnạm o, ọkwọnọ upyibh, abạnga atọhm sẹ ọttạra ẹnạnga ch'ipongapyibha. Ma wọ abạnga m'abina k'ikhạmana, abạnga m'abạra asonga oche kw'usi bạra utim ọnạng bạnga irem ọnạng.” <verse eid="1SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />APhilistiya n'abạbhọ bẹ́, “Ma, bạng ẹnạnga ch'ipongapyibha khira jọ m'antọhm ankken-ẹ yeri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Abẹ abhina bẹ́, “Ibirakpo esen py'abẹ atim gold asi, ọttạra okpomma osen pf'abẹ atim gold asi, ator k'ubhik kw'avaar p'aPhilistiya, ukwuru bẹ́ ọkhạnkhạmọ nwọ wạnọ-wạnọ wọ otto okhebha bạnga ọttạra avaarnạng pabạnga. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Abạnga asi apyẹ ede masẹ aphyi ọttạra masẹ okpomma f'n'ukhibhi isisek nna, abạnga abạra anạng ọkha f'Israẹl ikpukpobha. Nạnudusi, ọkhạnkhạmọ nwọ m'otte bạnga ọbọhk otte, ọttạra ikha sabạnga, ọttạra isisek sabạnga. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Ukwuru yạn kw'abạnga abạrẹ nttem oche kw'uwa aJipnạng ọttạra Phero abạrẹ o? Okpe ngwọ kw'Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ bẹ irem sididen, wa abẹ anạng p'Israẹl nábena bẹ, abẹ abina ofhona o?<verse eid="1SA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />“Mantọhmma, abạnga okpe kákhibhi, ado ọkpaar ọbhakwẹ kw'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra mmaam mfa s'itim ẹrạkh iva, sabẹ nạn ọyaar tạm nágia. Kpạna mmaam nnọ mfa ma ọkpaar kw'nten n'itwạr, okhenka, tima iva p'mmaam nnọ kpa nnạm k'ọpa kwabẹ. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Dira Ikwukwur s'Echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi anạna k'ọkpaar ngwọ kw'nten n'itwạr, abạra atạkha ekpo py'abẹ atim gol asi, p'abạnga m'atọhm masẹ ẹnạnga ch'ipongapyibha, akken-ẹ, age k'ukwukwur--nwa kw'uning ọbaanga ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Abạnga atọhm sẹ ifona, <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />okhenka, abạnga age sẹ utum. De ivur ifona k'ibyi s'ibin, k'ukhubha kw'Bẹt-Shẹmẹsh, ma wọ uyini bẹ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ ọtọhmọ ọkhạnkhạmọ khira nwa okkena mạna. Okhenkha, de nạn k'ukhubha ngwọ nítena, ma wọ m'asonga bẹ́, ọbọhk kwẹ ma kòde, kw'uyini bẹ́, akwẹ ọkhankẹ ode oche ngwọ.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Ma wọ, abẹ asi oche ngwọ. Wa abẹ atạk mmaam mfa akpạna k'ọkpaar kw'nten n'itwạr, abẹ abạra atạkha abhaamva mbọ akpạkha k'ọbhaampa. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Abẹ atạkha ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi age k'ọkpaar ngwọ, ọttạra ikwukwur s'okpomma pf'abẹ atim gol asi, ọttạra ibirakpo p'gold. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Wa mmaam nnọ innemi <char style="it">bẹ gbẹẹng</char> itor k'eden ch'eten k'Bẹt-Shẹmẹsh, asẹ n'isenga immẹbhẹ k'eden; asẹ k'udimbọhk ọttạra k'ọkwabọhk níttena. Wa avaar p'aPhilistiya atwạnọ sẹ asẹ tạrr akpira k'erem ch'Bẹt-Shẹmẹsh.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Ma okpe ngwa, anạng p'Bẹt-Shẹmẹsh n'asi iphya s'awit k'ipekhuma. Masẹ abẹ adir achen ase ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ettem erebhi bẹ k'ọttọhk f'abẹ ase. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Masẹ ọkpaar ngwọ ukpir k'owonu kw'Joshua kw'ubin Bẹt-Shẹmẹsh, ukwu uphyikha k'ẹtakpa chididen. Anạng mba aphyaakhẹ ọkpaar ngwa, atima amuma ekpon, abẹ abạra atima mmaam nnọ afọhnọ ẹja ẹkkạmachẹ anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Anạng p'Lẹvi adir ikwukwur nnọ s'Echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ọttạra nnọkha s'ekpo p'gold iyik, atạkha anạna k'ẹtakpa njọ chididen. Ma iwu njọ, anạng p'Bẹt-Shẹmẹsh anạngẹ nnạnga ikkạmasẹ, abạra afọhnọ nja anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Wa avaarnạng mbọ asen p'ifhon s'Philistiya ase idik nnọ phyibh, brasẹ abẹ n'abin akpa nnạm k'Ẹkrọn ma iwu njọ-njọ.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Ma wọ ode ibirakpo p'gold p'uwa aPhilistiya atọhmọ anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi masẹ ẹnạnga ch'ipongapyibha. Wa ofhon kwidede kw'ode Ashdọd, ọttạra Gaza, ọttạra Ashkẹlọn, ọttạra Gat, ọttạra Ẹkrọn, utim ẹnạnga chẹ. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Wa ubhik f'okpomma pf'abẹ atim gol asi otoru k'ubhik kw'avaar mbọ asen, p'ifhon s'aPhilistiya s'ikpọkh-ọkpọkhọ, ọttạra ifhon sabẹ s'nạníkpọkha. Ẹtakpa njọ chididen ch'uwa abẹ anạn ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, itim ining k'owonu kw'Joshua, kw'ubin Bẹt-Shẹmẹsh, mas'ẹkhọhkha k'udik kw'uwa otto ma, tạrr ukpira k'iwu ch'chemma.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Okhenkha, Ubinọkpaabyi usi ajunung bạnọ p'Bẹt-Shẹmẹsh, p'akpir anạng nnạbh attaan ukuma jobh, ape, ukwuru sabẹ akkeri k'ẹtaanga kw'Ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Wa anạng aning k'ikwosi, ukwuru s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtạk akpen pabẹ k'ọsaabh. <verse eid="1SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Ma wọ anạng p'Bẹt-Shẹmẹsh n'abạbhọ bẹ́, “Anẹ wọ m'okke obe Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'ititikha, Ubinọkpaabyi nwa kw'awurada o? M'antọhm ikwukwur nna s'echekha anạng anẹ o?”<verse eid="1SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Ma wọ abẹ atọhmọ anạng kha Kiriyat-Jẹrim aben bẹ, “APhilistiya kk'ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi arikha e. Asạkha akwu adira sẹ avura afona k'abạnga k'ibyi e.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Ma wọ ajunung p'Kiriyat-Jẹrim ata atạkha ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, avura afona k'okpecho k'ibyi s'ọchọhm kw'Abinadab uning. Wa abẹ atạk Eleaza kw'ode ujunung-nwa kw'Abinadab anạna ọbọhk k'echo bẹ́, okkeri ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samwẹl okhem aPhilistiya k'Mizpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Wa ikwukwur nnọ s'echekha ining k'Kiriyat-Jẹrim k'okpe kw'ubhir-ubhir. Phyi-phyibh wa asẹ ining icho ẹrạbh. Ma wọ anạng p'Israẹl n'aning k'ikwosi, abẹ aror eden ch'abẹ m'asenga ator Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi dạkhẹ. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Wa Samwẹl obeni anạng p'Israẹl phyibh bẹ́, “Ode abạnga aben bẹ́, akpa nnạm ator Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọttạra nttem sabạnga phyibh, abạnga arengi ifor sabạnga k'ikha s'idifhon idwạkh-ọdwạk, ọttạra akpatava p'Ashtọrẹt, abạnga m'abạra atte ifor sabạnga ọbọhk anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, abạra akpobha ẹma mạnkkeni. M'ọnạng bạnga ẹkkaana k'irem s'abanga n'adọhbh k'aPhilistiya k'mbọhk.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Ma wọ anạng p'Israẹl atte ikha s'Baal ọttạra akpatava p'Ashtọrẹt ọbọhk, n'akpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi mạnkkeni.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Ma wọ Samwẹl obeni bẹ́, “Atobha anạng p'Israẹl phyibh k'Mizpa, amma m'nse njọhm nnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'abạnga k'ncho.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Masẹ abẹ kk'atobha k'Mizpa, abẹ atwạr asi abyenga ma ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ma iwu njọ, abẹ ayim okwo, abạra ayaakhẹ mpyibha sabẹ, aben bẹ, “Amạna mba kk'anttia k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.” Wa Samwẹl ode ọdạbhẹ kw'Israẹl k'Mizpa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Masẹ aPhilistiya abhaang bẹ́, anạng p'Israẹl kk'atobha k'Mizpa, avaar p'aPhilistiya ado ifor ọfha abẹ ata arima bẹ abẹ. Masẹ anạng p'Israẹl abhaang nttọhna nnọ, ojora ọvạkha bẹ, ukwuru aPhilistiya. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl n'abeni Samwẹl bẹ́, “Nạng-ọ obhemi k'atim jạjọhm khamạna k'ncho, anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna, ọfha ọkkaana orengi mạna k'ibira ch'aPhilistiya.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Osenga ma, Samwẹl ọtạkha ọrạkhạmaan-nwa kw'utim ọjaabh ẹba, ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'ubungu masẹ ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ. Wa ose njọhm ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'ncho s'anạng p'Israẹl, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhaang-ẹ.<verse eid="1SA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Masẹ Samwẹl n'ọfọhnọ ẹja ch'ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ njọ, aPhilistiya asenga afora anạng p'Israẹl, ọfha abẹ arima bẹ abẹ. Okhenkha, ma iwu njọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhmọ ẹbhaamkpon ẹtta itum k'ẹrạng-k'ẹrạng <char style="it">bẹ gbạraangng,</char> utima oge aPhilistiya ojora k'ifor. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Osenga ma, anạng p'Israẹl arạbh ayin k'iyaan k'Mizpa akhubh aPhilistiya tạrr abẹ avạkha bẹ afhọ k'eden-udumudum, tạrr abẹ akpira k'isekh-isek kw'Bẹt-Kar. <verse eid="1SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Wa Samwẹl udir ẹta ofo k'ottemkwẹ kw'Mizpa ọttạra Shen. Oyeri chẹ Ẹbẹneza, ọbẹ, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'mạna ọkkaana tạrr ukpira mantọmma.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Ma wọ anạng p'Israẹl akhem aPhilistiya, abẹ ofhon kw'Israẹl dạk nákke achi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 7:13">K'akpen p'Samwẹl phyibh, wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uwunu aPhilistiya.<verse eid="1SA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Ifhon s'uwa aPhilistiya kk'achia tạma k'Ẹkrọn tạrr ukpira k'Gat, anạng p'Israẹl abạra akpa nnạm atạkha sẹ bẹ́, phyibh. Abẹ abạra akkaana ayok-ọbaanga pabẹ k'mbọhk s'ibira s'aPhilistiya, osenga ma, wa anạng p'Israẹl ọttạra anạng p'Amọr n'arukhu k'ẹmẹm.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samwẹl ọdạbhẹ Israẹl k'akpen pẹ phyibh. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Cho kwidede, n'osenga k'ifhon k'ifhon, tạma k'Bẹtẹl akwu akpira k'Gilgal, tạrr ukpira k'Mizpa, usi aponga p'anạng p'Israẹl ma ọkpaarẹ ngwọ phyibh. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Okhenkha, wa okpe kwidede kw'Samwẹl ọkpa nnạn k'Rama, k'ibyi s'usi uruk kwẹ, n'usi adạkhẹ aponga p'anạng p'Israẹl ma. Ma wọ kw'uwa usi ijabyi ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Anạng p'Israẹl aroru ọvaarnạng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Masẹ Samwẹl kk'ọtạma, n'orengi ajunungva pẹ abẹ ade akpaar-aponga p'Israẹl. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Ocheden-nwa kwẹ wa okpen Joẹl, onyema okpena Abija, wa abẹ ade akpaar-aponga k'Beershẹba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Okhenkha, wa ajunungva pẹ ntwạkhọ sẹ nátora. Abẹ n'atima ẹfhạra-den abhạkhẹ aponga, ukwuru ngwu sabẹ n'achi.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Ma wọ adennạng p'Israẹl phyibh ayeri ayok atobha, abẹ afona akhebha Samwẹl k'Rama. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />Abẹ aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọma kk'atạma, ajunungva pọ ntwạkhọ sọ k'nátor, ma wọ, m'anạng mạna ọvaarnạng kw'm'ọdạbh mạna, oche kw'idifhon idwạkh-ọdwạk phyibh ikhaam.”<verse eid="1SA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Okhenkha, masẹ abẹ abeni bẹ́, “Nạng mạna ọvaarnạng kw'm'ọdạbh mạna,” wa udik ngwọ Samwẹl ettem nórebha. Ma wọ ose njọhm ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Samwẹl bẹ́, “Khọmọ bẹ itọhng k'udik kwidede kw'abẹ n'akpaakh-ọ. Ọma sạng kw'abẹ afhumu e, amma wọ kw'abẹ afhumu masẹ ọvaarnạng kwabẹ e. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Tạma s'ntim bẹ mbina k'Ijip tạrr ukpira ma, oche ngwọ kw'abẹ n'akpa nnạm avạr-m abạra akpobha ikha, mạnna wọ kw'abẹ n'asi-ọ mạma e. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Ọma Khọmọ bẹ itọhng, okhenka, twạr bẹ itọhng mororo, si abẹ asonga ukhira kw'ọvaarnạng kw'm'ọdạbh bẹ m'usi bẹ.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Wa Samwẹl ọtạk idik nnọ phyibh s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkpaakhẹ, ọkpaak anạng mbọ p'n'aror ọvaarnạng abạbh-ẹ. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Obeni bẹ bẹ́, “Ma wọ ode udik kw'ọvaarnạng kw'm'ọdạbh bạnga m'usi: m'ọtạkha ajunungva pabạnga k'ẹfa ade atọhmnạng p'ijaar s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra ayaar-nnyạnyaang. Abẹ mạna achi ijaar sẹ eden. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />M'usi ayok bạnọ adecho p'akpongnạng k'nnọhna k'nnọhna, bạnọ adecho p'akpongnạng arạbh afa ukuma jobh, arạbh afa ukuma jobh. M'otekha ayok bạnọ ade anạng p'm'atubh ekpo pyẹ, abẹ abạra asi iphya sẹ. Oyongu ma, m'otekha ayok bạnọ ade atepa p'm'adwuk ekpongkpo pyẹ, ọttạra ẹtọhmkpo p'ijaar sẹ. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />M'ọtạkha apanạngva pabạnga abẹ n'asi ana p'arebhi iruk anạng-ẹ, abạra awọhn-ichiakpo, abạra asi abrẹd anạng-ẹ. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Ẹma m'ọvạkha bạnga iwonu sabạnga ọna, ọttạra iwonu s'grep, ọttạra s'oliv ọna, ọtạkha ọnạng atọhmnạng pẹ. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Ẹma m'ọtạkha ukwung gwạnọ k'akwung jobh p'arasẹ pabạnga, ọttạra agbạroko pabạnga, ọnạng ayok-adennạng pẹ, ọttạra atọhmnạng pẹ. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />M'ọtạkha atọhmnạng pabạnga p'ajunung ọttạra p'ipanạng ọttạra mmaam sabạnga s'ijibhi ifor, ọttạra nnyạnyaang sabạnga phyibh utima usi itọhm sẹ. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />M'ọtạkha ibyi rạnẹ k'ibyi jobh k'arạkhạmaan pabạnga, ọbạra utima bạnga usi abira pẹ. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Okpe kw'kk'obenga, abạnga m'agạma aror ọnạng kw'm'ọkkaana bạnga k'mbọhk s'ọvaarnạng kw'abạnga kk'arenga e, okhenka, ma iwu njọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bạnga ẹmma m'ọtọhbh.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Okhenkha, anạng mbọ Samwẹl itọhng náchera akhọmọ. Abẹ aben bẹ́, “Mesesé! Amạna mba annoru ọvaarnạng kw'm'ọdạbh mạna e. <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />Ma wọ m'ande masẹ idifhon idwạkh-ọdwạk phyibh de ankhaam ọvaarnạng kw'm'uchi mạna eden, kw'm'ọbạra urima mkpong samạna.”<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Masẹ Samwẹl ọbhaang idik nnọ phyibh s'anạng mbọ akpaakhẹ, ọbạra ọtạkha sẹ ọkpaak Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhin bẹ́, “Chera oche kw'abẹ abeni, nạng bẹ ọvaarnạng.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 8:22">Ma wọ Samwẹl n'obeni ajunung p'Israẹl bẹ́, “Tte ọnạng ọnạng ọbhạna k'akhẹ k'ofhon.”<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Samwẹl obyeng Saul ana k'echo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Wa ọkhaam ujunung wạnọ kw'uyini eche, kw'ubin k'efonamma ch'Bẹnjamin, kw'okpen Kish. Ẹma ode nnwa kw'Abiyẹl. Abiyẹl ode nnwa kw'Zẹrọ, kw'ode nnwa kw'Bekorat, kw'ode nnwa kw'Aphiya kw'ubin Bẹnjamin. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Kish ofhonu nnwa kw'okpen Saul, kw'ujibhi idikkobh, ọbạra ufu k'ifor, ebe chẹ egoru ẹyọhnga ch'anạng phyibh. Ọnạng kw'obeng abẹ k'efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl kòde.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Wa nnyạnyaang s'Kish kw'ode otte kw'Saul ikwu idimi. Ma wọ Kish obeni nnwa kwẹ Saul bẹ́, “Tạkha ọtọhmnạng wạnọ, ata aror nnyạnyaang nnọ.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Ma wọ osengi k'akpedcho p'Ephraim, ọttạra k'ukhubha kw'Shalisha, okhenka, abẹ nnnyạnyaang nnọ násia. Abẹ n'afon k'ukhubha kw'Shaalim, okhenka, abẹ sẹ násia. Ma wọ abẹ n'asengi k'ukhubha kw'Bẹnjamin, okhenkha, abẹ sẹ nábạra asia.<verse eid="1SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Masẹ abẹ akpir k'ẹkhạma ch'Zuph, Saul oben ọtọhmnạng kwẹ kw'abẹ atwạnọ bẹ́, “Tte amkpa nnạm, deja otte kwaam m'ọyaanga udik kw'nnyạnyaang ọjẹ, oponga kwamạna e.”<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Okhenkha, ọtọhmnạng nwọ ubhina bẹ́, “Kkeri, ọkhaam usi-ẹyaakha mạnna wạnọ kw'Ubinọkpaabyi ma ofhon ngwa. Ẹma ode ọnạng kw'anạng n'anạng ikpukpobha sididen, ọttạra bẹ, udik kwidede kw'ọkpaakhẹ n'ọkhaama ẹyaakha. Tte amạna amfona kha, nudusi, m'ọkpaak mạna eden ch'm'ansenga.”<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Ma wọ Saul ubhin ọtọhmnạng kwẹ bẹ́, “Ode amfon ma, bạng ọttọhk vọ m'annạng ujunung nwọ s'ode bẹ́, uchiattọhk f'antim kk'ọsa o? Ọttọhk kànkhaam f'm'anta annạng usi-ẹyaakha nwọ kw'Ubinọkpaabyi. Mbạng vọ ankhaam o?”<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Ọtọhmnạng ọbạra ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Kker e, amma nkhaam shẹkẹl ibhaakha sa silva ma, p'm'nnạng ọtọhmnạng kw'Ubinọkpaabyi, ọfha ọkpaak mạna eden ch'm'ansenga.” <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />Wa k'Israẹl, de ọnạng ofon bẹ́ ọta ọdwạn udik kw'ọphyang-ẹ ẹmma k'Ubinọkpaabyi, m'oben bẹ́, “Tte amfona kha ose-iyaan e,” ukwuru bẹ, usi-ẹyaakha kw'chemma wọ kw'uwa abẹ n'ayeri ose-iyaan.<verse eid="1SA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Ma wọ, Saul ubhin ọtọhmnạng kwẹ bẹ́, “Ujibhi ma, kwu amfona.” Ma wọ, abẹ abin osenga afona k'ofhon ngwọ kw'usi-ẹyaakha kw'Ubinọkpaabyi uning.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Masẹ abẹ n'avura okpecho afona k'ofhon ngwọ, abẹ akhebha aminava bạnọ p'akwu bẹ, akwu atwạr asi k'isipe, abẹ abạbh bẹ bẹ́, “Ose-iyaan uning ma o?”<verse eid="1SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Aminava mbọ abhina bẹ́, “Uwee, ẹma uning k'ororo e, abạnga awa mfhok; kkeri chemma wọ ukwu kamạna k'ofhon, ukwuru bẹ, anạng mba akhaam ẹja ch'abẹ m'afọhnọ k'ijabyi. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Ode abạnga anwa k'ofhon <char style="it">bẹẹ</char> abạnga m'ase-ẹ ose brasẹ ọta uchi ọttọhk k'ijabyi. Anạng ọttọhk máchi tạrr ukpira, ukwuru bẹ́, oyonga m'ose njọhm ma ẹja njọ, de ọsa, brasẹ anạng p'abẹ abheri n'achi ọttọhk. Abạnga afona kha mantọmma khiri abạnga m'akhebh-ẹ okhebha ma okpe demakwẹ ngwa.”<verse eid="1SA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Ma wọ abẹ abin afona k'ofhon ibir-ibira, masẹ abẹ n'anwa k'ofhon, abẹ ase Samwẹl, n'osenga ọgbaara bẹ k'ifor bẹ́, ofona k'ijabyi.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Iwu ch'echobh njọ ch'Saul ukwu k'ofhon, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ẹyaakha ch'udik ngwọ usia ọnạng Samwẹl bẹ́, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Uphyini k'okpe demakwẹ ngwa, amma m'ntọhm ujunung wạnọ kw'ubin k'ẹnạmma ch'Bẹnjamin nkken-ọ. M'abyeng-ẹ ana k'echo, ọfha ode ọdạbhẹ kw'anạng paam p'Israẹl; ẹma wọ m'orengi anạng paam k'irem s'aPhilistiya n'anạng. Amma kk'irem s'anạng paam n'adọhbh nsia, kk'ẹmmạng ch'abẹ agạm mbạra mmaanga.”<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Masẹ Samwẹl ose Saul, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ujunung nwọ kw'mkpaakh-ọ udik nkwuru wọ ma; ẹma wọ m'ọdạbh anạng paam.”<verse eid="1SA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Ma wọ Saul osenga okhebha Samwẹl k'ẹbaakhama ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Totokhạn kpaakh-m, ọchọhm kw'ose-iyaan uning mạn yeri?”<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samwẹl ubhina Saul bẹ́, “Amma wọ nde ose-iyaan nwọ e. Ọma chi-m eden vura fona k'ijabyi, khiri chemma, m'achi uchiattọhk abamẹ, ode iwu echobh ma, m'mkpaakh-ọ udik kwidede kw'ọphyaang-ọ ẹmma kha k'ettem, brasẹ n'nte-ọ ọbọhk afona. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />De n'ode nnyạnyaang s'idim-ọ k'iwu ittaan s'kk'isenga, tte ettem nạng-ọ ẹmma ẹphyaangẹ, khiri abẹ kk'sẹ asia. Efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl <char style="it">bẹ́ phyibh</char> eroru anẹ o, de nạn ọma ọttạra efonamma chọ phyibh núdia?”<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Ma wọ, Saul ubhin bẹ́, “Amma mbin k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin, ch'ẹsạk ọtạm k'Israẹl, efonamma chaam sạng ẹsạk ọtam k'nkhạma s'Bẹnjamin o? N'oseng yạn kw'akpaakh-m udik demakwẹ ngwama o?”<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Ma wọ, Samwẹl utim Saul, ọttạra ọtọhmnạng kwẹ abẹ anwa k'ọchọhm, ọnạng bẹ iningabyi k'ibyi s'ibạrẹ ọtạm iyonga s'anạng p'abẹ abheri. Wa anạng p'aning ma akpir anạng ẹrạbh ukuma jobh. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Samwẹl oben ọnạng kw'ọwọhnọ uchiattọhk f'ininga njọ bẹ́, “Tima etenkhuma njọ ch'wạra nnạng-ọ kwu, njọ ch'wạra mben-ọ bẹ, akhạmọ achok.”<verse eid="1SA 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Ma wọ, ọwọhn-uchiattọhk nwọ ọta ọtạkha ọtaak kw'eten njọ, ọttạra ekpo p'ẹtạr ma, obera Saul ma ititikha. Samwẹl oben bẹ́, “Ma wọ ode ọttọhk pf'abẹ achokh-ọ. Chi, ukwuru bẹ́, abẹ aseng ọmabẹ achok pfẹ, tạma m'ogbe ngwọ kw'mbeni bẹ́, ‘Amma kk'anạng erobha m'mera.’” Mạna wọ ma iwu njọma, Saul uchi ọttọhk Samwẹl abẹ.<verse eid="1SA 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Masẹ abẹ abin k'ijabyi asạkha k'ofhon, Samwẹl ọttạra Saul akpaak ayok abẹ idik k'ẹrạng kw'ọchọhm, k'ibyi s'Saul uyim. <verse eid="1SA 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Masẹ abẹ aphyạbh k'ekpebha, Samwẹl oyeri Saul k'ọchọhm ẹrạng oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Do ifor oche kw'm'ntọhm-ọ akpa nnạm abhạna.” Saul odo ifor <char style="it">bẹ phyibh,</char> ẹma ọttạra Samwẹl atwạn ayin k'iyaan. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Masẹ abẹ n'asenga abaanga erem ch'ofhon, Samwẹl obeni Saul bẹ́, “Ben ọtọhmnạng kwọ uchi mạna eden.” Ọtọhmnạng o, oseng. Samwẹl oben adạkhẹ Saul bẹ́, “Ọma m'akhenka aninga ma k'okpe nwa, ọfha mkpaakh-ọ ẹkkaabha ch'ibin k'Ubinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Samwẹl obyeng Saul ana k'echo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Ma wọ Samwẹl ọtạk igbere ch'ana obyenga Saul ana k'echo, ọbaakh-ẹ, oben bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọ ana obyenga k'echo bẹ́, adabh anạng pẹ Israẹl p'ochokhu k'ettem. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Masẹ chemma m'atte-m ọbọhk ma abhạna, m'attạma ajunung afa abẹ ọbaanga epekwur ch'Rachẹl k'Zẹlza k'erem ch'Bẹnjamin. Abẹ m'akpaakh-ọ bẹ́, “Abẹ kk'nnyạnyaang s'ata ruror asia e. Ma wọ, atte dạkhẹ udik kw'nnyạnyaang nọ́kka e, n'oponga kwọ, ọbạbh bẹ́, ‘Ma m'nsi yạn k'nnwa kwaam o?’ ”<verse eid="1SA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Ma wọ m'asenga ma tạrr akpira k'ibyi s'ichi chididen ebe k'Tabọr. Ajunung attaan p'n'afona bẹ́, ata akpobha Ubinọkpaabyi k'Bẹtẹl m'akhebh-ọ ma. Oyok wạnọ m'utima avu-va attaan, nwọkha m'utima abrẹd attaan, nwọkha dạkhẹ m'utima itwuk-gbạre. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Abẹ m'asim-ọ, abạra anạng-ọ abrẹd afa, m'atạkha pyẹ kabẹ k'mbọhk.<verse eid="1SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />“Ayongu ma, m'afona k'Gibea kw'Ubinọkpaabyi, k'ibyibhingasẹ s'aPhilistiya. Masẹ m'asenga abaanga k'ofhon, m'attạma ikhaana s'asi-ẹyaakha p'abin k'ijabyi, p'n'akhir agaangang ọttạra mbin, ọttạra aprompo, ọttạra agimangim p'abẹ n'akhir achi bẹ eden, bạra abẹ n'asi ẹyaakha. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Ma wọ Iguguma s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'ẹsạkha ọttạra ẹfa ininga abọ, ọma m'abạra asi ẹyaakha, m'ẹbạra ẹbhạkh-ọ akhạmọ. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Okpe kw'nkhọkha nnama k'iyina, si udik kwidede kw'akhạmọ bẹ́, asi, khiri Ubinọkpaabyi uning abọ.<verse eid="1SA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />“Chi-m eden afona k'Gilgal. K'udik ọkka, amma m'nsạkha-ọsạkha nkwu nkhebhọ, ọfha mfọhnọ ẹja ch'nnạnga ikkạmasẹ, ọttạra ch'nnạnga s'ofor-gbạkha. Okhenkha, oyonga m'aninga iwu isenọfa atik tạrr nkwu nkhebh-ọ, ọfha mkpaakh-ọ udik kw'm'asi.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul ọdạbhẹ Ẹvaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Masẹ Saul ọbhạkhẹ nnạm bẹ́, ofona urik Samwẹl, Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhạkhẹ ẹkka ch'Saul, ọttạra bẹ, nkhọkha nna phyibh ikhaam ẹyaakha ma iwu njọma. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Masẹ abẹ akpir k'Gibea, ikhaana s'asi-ẹyaakha ikhebh-ẹ; ẹfa ch'Iguguma s'Ubinọkpaabyi ẹnwa Saul, ọttạra bẹ usi ẹyaakha. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Masẹ anạng mbọ phyibh p'kk-ẹ asonga ase s'n'usi ẹyaakha ọttạra asi-ẹyaakha, abẹ n'abhạkhẹ abạbh ayok bẹ́, “Mbẹ, bạng udik gwọ ma kw'okhebh nnwa kw'Kish o? Saul n'ọttạr adạkhẹ k'ikhaana s'asi-ẹyaakha o?”<verse eid="1SA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Ujunung wạnọ kw'urukhu ma ọbạra ọttạra bẹ́, “Ma, bạng anạng bọ afhonu bẹ yeri?” Ma wọ, akwẹ node ẹtạma bẹ́, “Saul n'ọttạr adạkhẹ k'ikhaana s'asi-ẹyaakha o?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Masẹ Saul ukkum ẹyaakha sisi, oseng ofona k'ijabyi.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Ma wọ, nnwotte kw'otte kw'Saul n'ọbạbhọ ẹma Saul ọttạra ọtọhmnạng kwẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga ata mạn o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Ubhin bẹ́, “Anta nnyạnyaang ruror e, okhenkha, masẹ nạn sẹ nánsia, n'ambin amfona k'Samwẹl.”<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Nnwọkka kw'otte oben-ẹ bẹ, “Kpaakh-m udik kw'Samwẹl ọkpaakh-ọ.”<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Saul ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Okpaakhẹ mạna ọyaakh-ọyaakhẹ bẹ́, abẹ kk'nnyạnyaang asia e.” Okhenkha, nnwọkka kw'otte udik gwạnọ-gwạnọ kw'oten k'ẹvaar, kw'Samwẹl kk'ẹ ọkpaakha, nọ́kpaakha.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Ma wọ, Samwẹl oyeri anạng p'Israẹl akwu abe k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'Mizpa <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />ọkpaak bẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'anạng p'Israẹl obeni bẹ́, ‘Amma wọ wa ntim anạng p'Israẹl mbina k'Ijip, mbạra nnạbha bạnga k'mbọhk s'anạng p'Ijip ọttạra idifhon idwạkh-ọdwạk phyibh, s'ichokhu bạnga k'ibira.’ <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Mantọhmma abạnga kk'Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga afhuma, kw'ọkkaan bạnga k'ọkhạnkạmọ phyi-phyibh ọttạra irem s'itto ikhebha bạnga. Abạnga kk'abena dạkhẹ bẹ́, ‘Mesese, nạng mạna ọvaarnạng!’ Mantọhmma, abạnga m'abe k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'mfonamma ọttạra k'nnạmma sabạnga.”<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Masẹ Samwẹl utim mfonamma s'Israẹl phyibh uyin ka, abẹ abhạrẹ ọsẹ, ukwu otto k'efonamma ch'Bẹnjamin. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Ma wọ, oyeri efonamma ch'Bẹnjamin iyin ka, k'ẹnạmma-k'ẹnạmma, ọsẹ ukwu otto k'ẹnạmma ch'Matri. K'ekpongannạm-kpe, wa abẹ n'arengi Saul kw'ode ujunungnwa kw'Kish ator k'ẹyaakha ch'ọsẹ. Okhenkha, mas'abẹ aror-ẹ, abẹ kẹ násia. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Ma o abẹ n'abạbhọ adạkhẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Ma, ujunung nwọ k'ukpira ma yeri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhina bẹ, “Uwe e, uttubh ma k'ibyi s'abạnga achokhu ekpo pyabạnga e.”<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Ma wọ, abẹ arạbhọ afona k'ibyi s'uttubh, ata atạkh-ẹ atima ayin k'iyaan. Masẹ ọta obe k'ngekha kw'ayok, wa ogoru ebe ọyọhnga bẹ phyibh. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Samwẹl oben anạng mbọ phyibh bẹ́, “Abạnga kk'ujunung asia kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'otekha o? Ọnạng kw'ode masẹ akhẹ ma ikhaana nna phyibh kóde.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Ma wọ anạng n'acher <char style="it">bẹ wạạm</char> aben bẹ́, “Tte ọvaarnạng uruk akpen p'adum-udum e!”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Ma wọ, Samwẹl n'ọtạk nnyina s'ẹvaar ọkpaak anạng mbọ. Ọkkẹrẹ sẹ k'nnwẹr ochok k'ibyi s'Ovaar Ubinọkpaabyi uning. Ma o, Samwẹl ubina ininga njọ, oben ọnạng-ọnạng ọbhạna k'akhẹ k'ọchọhm.<verse eid="1SA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Wa Saul ọbạra ọbhạna k'akhẹ k'ofhon k'Gibea, ọttạra afanạng p'atwạnọ abẹ, p'Ubinọkpaabyi kk'nttem sabẹ udia. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Okhenkha, akhọr-nạng bạnọ n'abạbhọ bẹ́, “Ujunung nwa m'osenga yạn ọkkaana mạna k'mbọhk s'awawuna-nạng pamạna o?” Osenga ma, abẹ annukh-ẹ, abẹ kẹ nnạnga nábạra anạnga. Saul okhenka umyi <char style="it">bẹ́ tạkkạbh.</char><verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Saul ọkkaan anạng p'Jabẹsh k'ekpong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Wa Nahash kw'ọdạbhẹ Ammọn utim akpongnạng pẹ ofona ọta ọbaabha ofhon kw'Jabẹsh-Gilead oge k'ngekha bẹ́, urima bẹ abẹ. Ma wọ, ajunung p'Jabẹsh phyibh aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Khaama ẹgbagba ọttạra mạna, ọfha amạna anninga isekhisek kwọ.”<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Okhenkha, Nahash kw'ubin Ammọn ubhin bẹ bẹ́, “Amma m'nkhaama ẹgbagba ọkhaama ọttạra bạnga abẹ, de abạnga acher bẹ́, nnạbha ichen s'udimbọhk s'ọnạng kw'idede ọfha osenga ma ẹsẹkha ede ch'Israẹl phyibh.”<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Ma wọ adecho p'Jabẹsh aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Nạng mạna iwu isenọfa ọfha antọhm ẹkkaabha annạng anạng p'Israẹl phyibh, de ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ nạn ukwua bẹ́, ọkkaana mạna, amạnamba m'antte ifor samạna ọbọhk annạng-ọ.”<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Masẹ atọhmọ mbọ akpir k'Gibea, kw'ode ofhon kw'Saul ubin, abẹ atạkha idik nnọ akpaak anạng mbọ, abẹma phyibh agạma ẹfhonmạng k'ẹrạng. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Okpe núbhira, Saul utima mmaam sẹ n'ukwuna, ukw'ukpira ma, ọbạbh bẹ, “Bạng udik gwọ uyini o? Ode yạn kw'abẹ n'agạma ẹmạng o?” Osenga ma, abẹ atạkha dạkhẹ udik kw'anạng p'Jabẹsh kk'bẹ akpaakha, akpaakh-ẹ.<verse eid="1SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Masẹ Saul ọbhaang ẹkkaabha njọ ch'abẹ atim akwu, ẹfa ch'Iguguma s'Ubinọkpaabyi ẹnwẹ-ẹ, ettem ipyibh-ẹ. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Ma wọ n'ọtạk mmaam mfa ọkpaara <char style="it">bẹ chẹkchẹkchẹk,</char> ọtakha ọnạng atọhmọ mbọ, ọtọhmọ bẹ, abẹ akhebh abaabha Israẹl, n'awon bẹ́, “Oche ngwa gwọ abẹ m'asi mmaam s'ọnạng kw'idede kw'nạn Saul ọttạra Samwẹl abẹ nọ́twạna.” Ma wọ, ojora f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnwa anạng mbọ, abẹma phyibh akhaama ẹkka jạnẹ. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Okpe kw'Saul oyeri bẹ ininga k'Bẹzẹk, ubhik kw'ajunung p'aning ma ode nnọhna nnọhna ukuma arạbh chi ukuma afa ukuma jobh p'abin k'efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl, p'abin k'efhonfhạr ch'Juda ade ajunung nnọhna ẹrạbh ukuma jobh.<verse eid="1SA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Abẹ aben atọhmọ p'atim ẹkkaabha njọ akwu bẹ́, “Abạnga akpaak ajunung p'Jabẹsh-Gilead bẹ́, ‘Uphyini okpe kw'ekkekhạra ẹkhạmọ, abạnga m'akhaama ẹnnaanga ọkhaama.’ ” Masẹ atọhmọ mbọ akpa nnạm ata akpaak ajunung p'Jabẹsh idik nna, ettem erebh bẹ. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Ma wọ, abẹ akpaak anạng p'Amọn bẹ́, “Uphyini m'antte ifor samạna ọbọhk annạng bạnga, ọfha abạnga asi mạna oche kw'ọdaakhẹ bạnga.”<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Mas'iwu echobh, Saul ọbhaangẹ akpongnạng k'ikhaana ittaan; ochengwọ iwu echobh, ab'anwa k'ibyibhingasẹ s'Ammọn, ab'afhọ bẹ tạrr ukpira okpe kw'ekkekhạra ẹkhạmọ. Ayok mbọ p'annạng-ọnnanga, ọnạng-ọnạng ọrạbhọ otor eden chẹ, ọnạng kw'ọkhaam oyokh-ikhaana kóde.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul ọdạbhẹ ẹvaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Ma wọ anạng n'abạbhọ Samwẹl bẹ́, “Anẹ wọ kw'uwa ọbạbhọ bẹ́, ‘Ma, Saul wọ m'ọdạbh mạna ẹvaar o?’ Abạnga atima ajunung mbọ akwu amfhọ bẹ echomajạnẹ!”<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Saul okhenka oben bẹ, “Mma e, ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'm'amfhọ chemma kode, ukwuru bẹ, k'iwu ch'chemma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Israẹl ọkkaana.”<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Ma wọ, Samwẹl obeni anạng mbọ bẹ́, “Akwu amạna amfona k'Gilgal anta anchera ọttạra ẹvaar nja.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Ma o, anạng mbọ phyibh abin afona k'Gilgal, abẹ achera k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ, Saul wọ ode ọvaarnạng. Mạma wọ abẹ afọhnọ ẹja ch'oforgbạkha anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Osenga ma, Saul ọttạra efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl phyibh asi erobha ch'ididen.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ikpongannạm-dik s'Samwẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Ma wọ, Samwẹl ọkpaakhẹ anạng p'Israẹl phyi-phyibh bẹ́, “Amma kk'itọhng nkhọma k'udik kwidede kw'abạnga akpaakh-m, kk'bạnga ọvaarnạng mbạra nnạnga kw'm'ọdạbh bạnga. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Mantọhmma abạnga kk'ọvaarnạng akhaama kw'm'utima bạnga eden. De n'ode amma kk'ntạma, mbạra mmen isọbh, ọttạra bẹ, ajunungva paam aning bạnga abẹ ma. Amma kk'bạnga ndạbha tạma k'idikobh chaam tạrr ukpira k'iwu ch'chemma. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Mbe ma bẹ́, abạnga akpaakh-m ipyibha chidede ch'nsi, ma ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọttạra nwọ kw'kk'ana obyenga k'echo. Anẹ wọ kw'kk'ẹbhaam chẹ ntạkha? Anẹ wọ kw'kk'ẹnnyạnyaang chẹ ntạkha? Anẹ wọ kw'kk'ntwukha? Anẹ wọ kw'kk'nchokha k'irem? K'mbọhk s'anẹ wọ kw'kk'ngwu ntạkha ọfha nsenga ma mbubha ipyibha? Ode kk'udik gwạnọ-gwạnọ nsia ma idik nna, atekh-m ọfha ntạma twutwuk.”<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Abẹ abhina bẹ́, “Mạna tạma nátwukha, mạna k'irem náchokha, s'akwẹ obobe ode, ọttọhk f'ọnạng nátạkha.”<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Samwẹl ubhina bẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ọttạra nwọ kw'kk'ana obyenga k'echo ade nttẹnsẹ chemma bẹ́, abạnga khaam udik násia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Abẹ aben bẹ́, “Uwe e, ẹma wọ ode nttẹnsẹ e.”<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Ma wọ, Samwẹl obeni anạng mbọ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ wa orengi Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn, ọbạra utima ab'atte pabạnga ubina k'Ijip. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Ma o, abạnga abe ma, ọfha mkpaak bạnga ma ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, mbạra njima bạnga idik s'itor-otor phyi-phyibh s'ẹma kk'usia ọnạng bạnga ọttạra abatte.<verse eid="1SA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />“Masẹ Jekọb ọnwa k'Ijip, abẹ agạm ẹkkaana anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhmọ Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn p'atim ab'atte pabạnga abina k'Ijip akwu achok ma ibyi nna.<verse eid="1SA 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />“Okhenkha, abẹ abonu Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kwabẹ; osenga ma, Ubinọkpaabyi otte bẹ ọbọhk ọnạng Sisẹra, kw'ode utim-eden kw'akpongnạng p'Hazọ, ọbạra otte bẹ ọbọhk ọnạng aPhilistiya, ọttạra ọvaarnạng kw'Moab, p'arim bẹ abẹ. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Abẹ agạm anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi aben bẹ́, ‘Amạna kk'ipyibha ansia; amạna kk'nnạm amkpa amvạra Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi amkpobha ikha s'Baal, ọttạra akpatava p'Ashtọrẹt. Okhenkha, mantọhmma, rạbha mạna k'mbọhk s'awawunanạng pamạna, ọfha amkpobh-ọ.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhmọ Jerubaal, ọttạra Barak, ọttạra Jẹphta, ọttạra Samwẹl, ọrạbha bạnga k'mbọhk s'awawunanạng pabạnga k'eden chidede, ọfha abạnga asenga ma aruk k'idira.<verse eid="1SA 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />“Okhenkha, masẹ abạnga ase bẹ ọvaar Nahash kw'ọdạbhẹ Ammọn n'osenga ukwu bẹ́ urima bạnga abẹ, abạnga afhum-m aben bẹ́, ‘Mma e, amạna mba annoru ọvaarnạng kw'm'ọdạbh mạna e,’ ọbạra ode bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga wọ ode bạnga ọvaarnạng o. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Mantọhmma, abạnga akkeri ọvaarnạng kw'abạnga kk'arenga ma, nwọ kw'abạnga abạbhọ. Kker e, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'bạnga ọvaarnạng ọnạnga e. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />De abạnga akhaam ojora f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, abạnga akpobh-ẹ, abạra asạkha echo anạng-ẹ, abạnga echọ nákpọhkha, ọttạra abẹ, de abạngama, ọttạra ọvaarnạng kw'ọdạbhẹ bạnga, acher k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga, m'ujibh-ujibh ọnạng bạnga. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Okhenkha, de abạnga nạn echo násạkha anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, abạnga afhum nnyina sẹ chuchok, m'ọnạng bạnga irem oche kw'uwa ọnạng ab'atte pabạnga.<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />“Mantọhmma, abạnga ado abe, abạnga m'ase udik-dim kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'oben bẹ́, usi ma abạnga k'ititikha. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Okpe kw'iphya s'awit sạng ma? Amma m'nyeri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhm ẹbhaamkpon ọttạra ọrạngkpang, ọfha abạnga asonga ipyibha khira ch'abạnga asi k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, s'abạnga aroru ọvaarnạng.”<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Ma o, Samwẹl oyeri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ma iwu njọ-njọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhm ẹbhaamkpon ọttạra ọrạngkpang. Osenga ma, anạng phyibh n'aning k'ojora f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ọttạra f'Samwẹl.<verse eid="1SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Anạng mbọ phyibh n'abeni Samwẹl bẹ́, “Se njọhm nạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwọ k'ncho s'atọhmnạng pọ, ọfha nạngẹ ampe, khiri amạna kk'ipyibha ansia anttạra k'mpyibha, k'igbaan s'annoru bẹ́, ankhaama ọvaarnạng.”<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samwẹl ubhin bẹ bẹ́, “Tte nạng bạnga ojor, abạnga kk'mpyibha asia; oseng mạma, abạnga Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nnạm kákpa avạra, akhenka akpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọttạra nttem sabạnga phyi-phyibh. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Abạnga akpatava kákpobha khiri apyẹ ede ekpo ajaakha, apyẹ bạnga ijibha jạnẹ-jạnẹ mẹ́nạng, bạnga mẹ́bạra ẹkkaana, ukwuru bẹ́, apyẹ ede ekpo ajaakha. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Ukwuru abạrada p'eche chẹ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bạnga múfhum, ukwuru bẹ́, ẹma oyeni ọdaakh-ẹ bẹ́, ọtạkha bạnga usi anạng pẹ. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />De n'ode amma, tte akw'ode ọdachendik bẹ, amma m'nsi ipyibha k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, bẹ, nkkuma njọhm sise nnạng bạnga. Amma m'mbạra mkpebhi bạnga udik ọkka ọttạra s'itor-otor. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Okhenkha, abạnga akhonga akhaama ojora f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, abạnga akpobh-ẹ ọttạra nttem sabạnga phyibh; abạnga abạra ajima idik-dim s'kk'usia ọnạng bạnga. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Okhenkha, de abạnga afon ororo asi ọgbaan, abạngama ọtạra ọvaarnạng m'adimi phyibh.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Saul urim aPhilistiya abẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Wa Saul ode icho ẹrạbh ukuma jobh k'okpe kw'ọdạbhẹ ẹvaar. Wa ọdạbhẹ Israẹl k'icho arạbh afa ukuma ifa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ocheden nwẹr f'abẹ atim Hiburu akkẹr ẹkhaam nkhạmọ k'ubhik f'abẹ atim m'ọkhaana kw'nnwẹr na, Mbẹmbẹ otoru k'NIV. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Saul otek ajunung p'Israẹl nnọhna arạbh asenọfa ukuma arạbh jobh; anạng nnọhna arạbh asen aning abẹ k'Mikmash, ọttạra k'okpecho k'ofhon kw'Bẹtẹl, ọtọhm anạng nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh jobh ọnạng Jonatan k'Gibea, k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin. N'obeni ajunung p'arikh'urik bẹ́, abẹ akpa nnạm k'ichọhm sabẹ.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Jonatan urim utim-eden kw'akpongnạng p'aPhilistiya p'abe k'ẹbaakhamma k'Geba abẹ, aPhilistiya akwu abhaanga udik ngwọ. Ma wọ, Saul n'obeni abẹ age ẹsa abaabha ofhon ngwọ phyibh oben bẹ́, “Tte aHiburu abhaanga o!” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Ma wọ, anạng p'Israẹl phyibh abhaang ẹkkaabha njọ bẹ́, “Saul kk'utim-eden kw'akpongnạng p'aPhilistiya abẹ urima, mantọhmma, anạng p'Israẹl n'abạkhọ aPhilistiya idik.” Saul n'oyeri akpongnạng pẹ bẹ́, abẹ akhebh-ẹ k'Gilgal.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />APhilistiya atobh bẹ́, abẹ arima anạng p'Israẹl abẹ, abẹ atim ijaar s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr nnọhna ẹrạbh ukuma nttaan ukuma chi, ọttạra akpongnạng p'n'ayaar ijaar s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr nnọhna chi, ọttạra akpongnạng adwạkh-ọdwạk nnọhna ibhikh-asong. Abẹ ata abhing k'Mikmash, k'ukhubha kw'okpebha-dudon n'uyin k'Bẹt-Avẹn. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Masẹ anạng p'Israẹl n'ase bẹ́, abẹ n'aning k'ọmmaphyaangẹ ọttạra bẹ́, ayok n'ayọhng bẹ ẹfa, abẹ arạbh ata attubha k'amma p'ntakpa ọttạra k'akpasạn, ọttạra k'apekhuma, ọttạra k'ape p'adong-odong. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Wa aHiburu bạnọ arạbhọ ajekha Jọrdan afona k'Gad, ọttạra k'Gilead.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Saul ọttạra ikhaana s'akpongnạng p'atwạnọ abẹ n'aning k'opoma k'Gilgal. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Saul uning iwu isenọfa utik okpe kw'Samwẹl oge bẹ́ m'ukwu, okhenka, wa Samwẹl k'Gilgal tạm núkwa. Ma wọ ajunung p'Saul atạm ny'nyaamẹ. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Ma o, Saul n'obeni bẹ́, “Kken-m ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ ọttạra nnạnga s'oforgbạkha.” Ma wọ Saul ọtạk ẹja ẹkkạmachẹ ọfọhnọ. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Masẹ okker ẹja njọ fạfọhnọ <char style="it">bẹ ẹ</char> kkeri Samwẹl ma, Saul uyin k'iyaan ọta usim-ẹ.<verse eid="1SA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Samwẹl ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Bạng udik gwọ asi ma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Saul ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Masẹ nse bẹ́, ajunung mbọ kk'atạma wạwena, ọttạra bẹ́, okpe kw'age nábạra akwua, ọttạra bẹ́, aPhilistiya n'kk'atobha k'Mikmash, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />nkwu nkkẹ bẹ́, ‘Mantọhmma, aPhilistiya bạra akwu arim-m abẹ k'Gilgal, abhaang, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi tạma nạ́mbẹna bẹ́, ọkkaana mạna.’ Ẹgwọ usi nkwa ammoyeni k'ẹfa bẹ́, mfọhnọ ẹja ẹkkạmachẹ nja e.”<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Samwẹl oben bẹ́, “Asi kwẹ k'idindingi-den e, inyina ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwọ, ọnạng-ọ, náchokha a, de wạra kk'achokha, wạra m'usi ẹvaar chọ ittima arạnga k'Israẹl tạrr ipimmanitor. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Okhenkha ode bẹ́, mantọhmma, ẹvaar chọ dạkhẹ ororo méfona; Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọnạng otekha kw'ubin-ẹ k'ettem, kw'm'ode ọdạbhẹ kw'anạng pẹ, ukwuru bẹ́, inyina chẹ náchokha.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Ma wọ, Samwẹl ubin k'Gilgal uvura ofona k'Gibea, k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin. Saul ọtạkha ubhik kw'ajunung p'aning abẹ. Abẹ akpir ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh.<verse eid="1SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Saul ọttạra nnwa kwẹ Jonatan, ọttạra akpongnạng p'atwạn bẹ abẹ, aning k'Gibea k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin, aPhilistiya n'abhingi k'Mikmash. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Akpongnạng p'irima abin k'ikhaana ittaan k'ibyibhingasẹ s'aPhilistiya. Ikhaana rạnẹ iten k'Ọphra k'ukhubha kw'Shual, <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />nnọkha itena k'Bẹt-Họrọn, s'ittong ittaan itena k'erem ch'ichọrạna k'ipekhuma s'Zeboyim, s'ikkeri ititikha k'uminkpa.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Wa otepa wạnọ-wạnọ k'efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl <char style="it">bẹ́ wạạmm</char> kòde, ukwuru s'aPhilistiya kk'abena bẹ́ akpa bẹ eden k'ekpongkpo sisi, ọbẹ́, “Deja, aHiburu m'adwuk akkangkkang-kro ọttạra akhọhn!” <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Ma wọ, anạng p'Israẹl phyibh n'asạk akhebha aPhilistiya bẹ́, abẹ ata abọhnga nkubh, ọttạra nkubh-sẹkhẹ, ọttạra mbạr-chi, ọmana f'ọkọbh-ẹma. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Ẹphya ch'nkubh ọttạra nkubh-sẹkhẹ bạbọhnga ede ibhaakha s'ishẹkẹl, ọmạna ọttọhk f'ukpir ishẹkẹl-bhaakha s'sọvẹl kw'ọkhaam asa, ọttạra mbạr, ọttạra ẹbọhnga kw'ẹmma chẹ, ashẹkẹl ibyi ittaan.<verse eid="1SA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Ma o, ma iwu ch'ekpong, okpongnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'uning Saul ọttạra Jonatan abẹ, kw'ọkhaam ọkkangkkang-kkro, ọbạra ode ọkhọhn kakhẹ ọbọhk, kòde, oyonga Saul ọttạra nnwa kwẹ Jonatan.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jonatan urim aPhilistiya abẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Ma wọ ikhaana rạnẹ s'akpongnạng p'aPhilistiya afon ata akpa eden k'Mikmash.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Iwu jạnẹ, Jonatan kw'ode nwa kw'Saul obeni udikobh kw'ode utim-ekpongkpo pyẹ bẹ́, “Kwu anjekha k'ukhubha kw'akpongnạng p'aPhilistiya p'n'akkeri ẹbaakhamma aning.” Okhenkha, wa Jonatan otte nótekha.<verse eid="1SA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Wa Saul uning k'ofhon ọkhaan-ọkhaan kw'Gibea k'ichirin ch'pomegranate k'Migrọn. Wa utim anạng p'akpir ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />K'ikhaana s'anạng p'aning abẹ wa ode Ahija kw'n'oge ẹphọd. Ahija nwọ wa ode nnwa kw'nnwọkka kw'Ikabọd, kw'okpen Ahitub. Ahitub ode nnwa kw'Phinẹhas kw'ode nnwa kw'Ẹli, kw'ode ọfọhnẹja kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'Shilo. Ọnạng kw'uwa osong bẹ Jonatan kk'ubina ofona kòde.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />K'ukhubha kwidede kw'Jonatan osengi bẹ́, ojekha okhebha akpongnạng p'aPhilistiya p'n'akkeri ẹbaakhamma, ọkhaam okpecho kw'ode ẹtakpa-ẹtakpa. Wạnọ ekpen Bozẹz, nwọkha ekpen Sẹnẹ. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Okpecho wạnọ kw'ode ẹtakpa-ẹtakpa, wạn ebe ekkeri k'ofhon ibir-ibira kw'Mikmash, njọkha ekkeri k'ofhon ẹrạkh-ẹrạkha kw'Geba.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Jonatan obeni utim-ekpongkpo pyẹ bẹ́, “Kwu amfona k'anạng mbọ p'n'akkeri ẹbaakhamma ch'aPhilistiya, p'nạn ọkpọkkrọkkọ násia. Nudusi, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'urima irima nja ọnạng mạna. Ọttọhk vạnọ-vạnọ f'm'ọkpa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi eden bẹ́ nạngẹ mạna ọkkaan kòde, ansaabh-ọsaabh nánsaabha.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Utim-ekpongkpo p'Jonatan oben bẹ́, “Ọbaan ma, si oche idede kw'ujibhi ọnạng-ọ, khiri amma mbe abọ k'nnạm k'eden chidede.”<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Ma wọ Jonatan obeni bẹ́, “Kwu anjekha ankhebha ajunung mbọ kha ukhubha, ọfha abẹ ase mạna. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />De abẹ abeni mạna bẹ́, ‘Abạnga abe ma ankhebha bạnga ma,’ m'anninga ma ibyi s'anning, bẹ mámvura ankhebha. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Okhenkha, de abẹ abeni mạna bẹ́, ‘Avura akhebha mạna kha e,’ m'amvura ankhebha bẹ kha, ukwuru bẹ́, ma wọ m'ode ẹkhọhkha ọnạng mạna bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'bẹ ọtạkha oge mạna k'mbọhk.”<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Ma o, abẹma anạng afa ata akhọhkha ifor sabẹ k'ẹbaakhamma ch'aPhilistiya. APhilistiya aben bẹ́, “Akker-e! AHiburu mba n'nkk'abẹk ayin k'ape p'wạra abẹ attubh-e.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Ma wọ, ajunung p'aning k'ẹbaakhamma atạbh-bhẹ Jonatan ọttạra utim-ekpongkpo pyẹ ẹmạng, aben bẹ́, “Avura akhebha mạna kha, ọfha ankọhkha bạnga nkwuru!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Ma o, Jonatan n'obeni utim-ekpongkpo pyẹ bẹ́, “Vura tor-m nnạm, khiri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'bẹ ọtạkha oge Israẹl k'ọbọhk.”<verse eid="1SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Jonatan utim mbọhk ọttạra mfhok sẹ uvura, utim-ekpongkpo pyẹ otor-ẹ nnạm. Wa Jonatan ọfhọ aPhilistiya, utim-ekpongkpo pyẹ ọbạra ọfhọ bẹ otor ẹ nnạm. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Ma echeden rima njọ, Jonatan ọttạra utim-ekpongkpo pyẹ afhọ anạng ẹrạbh k'ibyi s'ibạrẹ ikpira ntwạkhọ arạbh jobh.<verse eid="1SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Ma wọ opoma ọnwạ akpongnạng p'aPhilistiya phyibh p'aning k'ibyibhingasẹ, ọttạra p'aning k'akpongchen, ọttạra p'aning k'ẹbaakhama, ọttạra ikhaana s'n'irima irima, isek ibạra inyengi. Ubinọkpaabyi wọ wa ọtọhmọ opoma nwọ.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anạng p'Israẹl akhem aPhilistiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Akker-ibyi p'Saul p'aning k'Gibea k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin ase s'akpongnạng p'aPhilistiya n'arạbh agbongu ayok ncho. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Ma wọ, Saul obeni ajunung p'atwạnọ abẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga atạkha ubhik kw'akpongnạng ọfha ansonga ọnạng kw'nạ́n ma ode.” Masẹ abẹ abhikhi, abẹ ase bẹ́, Jonatan ọttạra utim-ekpongkpo pyẹ bọ nạ́n ma ade.<verse eid="1SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Saul n'obeni Ahija kw'ode ọfọhnẹja bẹ́, “Tima ikwukwur s'echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi kwu.” Ma okpe ngwọ, wa ikwukwur nnọ ining anạng p'Israẹl abẹ. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Masẹ Saul utim ọkpaakhẹ udik ọnạng ọfọhnẹja, dạmadạma kw'aPhilistiya n'ọbạrẹ osengeden k'ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ. Ma wọ Saul n'obeni ọfọhnẹja bẹ́, “Tte ọbọhk ma udik ngwọ bạra.”<verse eid="1SA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Ma wọ Saul ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ phyibh akwu atobha, abẹ abina ata ekpong. Abẹ n'akhebh aPhilistiya k'dạmadạma, abẹ n'atima akkangkkang-kro pabẹ abhạkhẹ afhọ ayok. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />AHiburu mbọ p'uwa acheden aninga attra aPhilistiya, p'atwạnọ bẹ abẹ afona k'ibyibhingasẹ, n'ajek ator anạng p'Israẹl p'abe atuma Saul ọttạra Jonatan.<verse eid="1SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Masẹ anạng p'Israẹl phyibh p'uwa atubh k'akpecho p'Ephraim abhaang bẹ́, aPhilistiya nạnka arạbh, abẹ anwa ekpong akhubh aPhilistiya ẹkhạm-ẹkhạma. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkkaan anạng p'Israẹl ma iwu njọ, ekpong ichi eyongu Bẹt-Avẹn.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jonatan uchi ọkhọhn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Ma iwu njọ, wa ajunung p'Israẹl aning k'ọmmaphyaangẹ, ukwuru s'Saul kk'echekha ọtạkha k'anạng mbọ k'echo ọben bẹ́, “M'upyibh ọnạng ujunung kwidede kw'uchi ọttọhk brasẹ n'ukpir k'ẹchọhkha, oyonga de kk'udik kw'awawunanạng paam asi ntwukha.” Oseng mạma ọnạng kw'uchi ọttọhk kòde.<verse eid="1SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Ma o, akpongnạng mbọ phyibh akwu anwa k'ẹkpa, abẹ n'ase ọkhọhn ma isisek. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Masẹ abẹ anwa k'ẹkpa, abẹ ase s'ọkhọhn n'ofhobh, okhenka, ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'oge ọbọhk ma ọttaakhẹ kòde, ukwuru ojora f'echekha ch'Saul kk'bẹ ugia. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Okhenkha, wa Jonatan tạma nọ́bhaanga bẹ́, otte kk'anạng mbọ ugia k'echekha. Ma o, n'ọtạk echo ch'uchikwura kw'utim, ọrạna ma akhọhnkpa, udira ọbọhk oge k'ẹmma ọtaakhẹ, ifor inyaan-ẹ. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Ma wọ okpongnạng wạnọ ọkpaakh-ẹ bẹ́, “Atte oge akpongnạng mba k'echekha ch'ẹkpọhkh-ọkpọhkhọ oben bẹ́, ‘M'upyibh ọnạng ọnạ́ng kwidede kw'uchi ọttọhk chemma!’ Akwẹma gwọ usi bạra ifor n'imạm ajunung mbama e.”<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Jonatan ubhina bẹ́, “Uwoo! Otte kwaam kk'anạng pamạna ugia k'dạmadạma e. Kkeri oche kw'ifor inyaan-m kha masẹ nsi ọkhọhn sạsạkhẹ nttaakhẹ. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Wạra m'ujibh ọtạm de ode bẹ ajunung mbọ kk'ọttọhk achia k'ekpo byạnọ py'abẹ avạk awawunanạng pabẹ ana. Ma wọ wạra ekhema ch'anạng mbọ akhem aPhilistiya m'ẹbạra ọtạm e.”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Ma iwu njọ, masẹ anạng p'Israẹl kk'aPhilistiya afha tạma k'Mikmash tạrr ukpira k'Aijalọn, wa kk'bẹ ọkhọhna. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Ma wọ abẹ atto akhubha ma ekpo py'abẹ atạk k'ekpong, abẹ atạkha arạkhạmaan ọttạra adamagbudu, ọttạra mmaamva, abẹ abhaak sẹ ma isisek achi asẹ apẹ. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Ma wọ ọnạng wạnọ obeni Saul bẹ́, “Kker e, ajunung mbọ n'asi ipyibha k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi sabẹ n'achi nten asẹ apẹ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Saul ọbẹ́, “Abạnga kk'ipina asia e! Abingi ẹta chididen ẹbhạr-ẹbhạrẹ atima akwu ma.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Ma wọ Saul obeni bẹ́, “Abạnga asọhng k'ikhaana s'ajunung mbọ aben bẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọnạng-ọnạng utima ẹbhaam chẹ, ọttạra ọrạkhạmaan kwẹ utima ukwu ma. Afhọ sẹ ma, achi. Abạnga ẹkhọngkwuru k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kási bẹ́, abạnga achi nten isẹ asẹ k'ẹtaanga.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:34">Ma wọ ọnạng-ọnạng utim ẹbhaam chẹ ukwu ma irungu njọ, ọfhọ chẹ mạma. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Ma wọ Saul usi ijabyi ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi; ma wọ ode ochedenkpe kw'usi oche ngwọ.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Ma o, Saul ọbẹ́, “Tte ansạkha ma irungu anta annima aPhilistiya abẹ, ọfha ambạra achi bẹ́ tạạr iwu echobha, tte nạngẹ ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ ọbọhk ante uruk akpen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Ma wọ abẹ abhin bẹ́, “Si oche kwidede kw'ujibh-ọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Okhenkha, ọfhọhnẹja ọbẹ́, “Tte ambạbh Ubinọkpaabyi ma.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Ma wọ Saul ọbạbhọ Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Ma, n'nsạk nta nnima aPhilistiya abẹ o? S'm'ananạng Israẹl ekhema o?” Okhenkha, wa Ubinọkpaabyi khẹ ibhina nọ́nạnga ma iwu njọ.<verse eid="1SA 14:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Saul n'obeni bẹ́, “Abạngama adecho p'akpongnạng phyibh, akwu ma, ọfha andwạn eden ch'ipyibha ch'chemma eseng ikwu. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />K'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'n'ọkkaana Israẹl urukhu akpen, ọbạra ode bẹ́, nnwa kwaam Jonatan wọ usi udik ngwa, oyonga m'ope.” Okhenkha, ujunung wạnọ-wạnọ kw'usi <char style="it">bẹ́ kọsọ</char> kòde.<verse eid="1SA 14:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Ma wọ Saul obeni anạng p'Israẹl phyibh bẹ́, “Abạngama abe kha, amma ọttạra nnwa kwaam Jonatan ambe ma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Ajunung mbọ abhina bẹ, “Si oche kwidede kw'ujibh-ọ.”<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Ma wọ Saul ose njọhm ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl oben bẹ́, “Totokhạn nạng-m ibhina ẹkkachẹ. De ọsẹ otto k'akhaam, ọbạra ode bẹ́, otto k'nnwa kwaam Jonatan, bhina ttạra Urim. Okhenkha, de otto k'ajunung p'Israẹl, bhina ttạra Thumim.” Ma wọ abẹ abhạrẹ ọsẹ, ọsẹ otto k'Jonatan ọttạra Saul. Ma wọ ajunung mbọ annaang udik ngwọ. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Saul ọbẹ́, “Abhạrẹ ọsẹ k'akhaam k'echo ọttạra k'echo ch'Jonatan.” Wa ọsẹ otto k'Jonatan.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Ma wọ Saul obeni Jonatan bẹ́, “Ọma kpaakh-m udik kw'kk'asia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Jonatan n'ọkpaakh-ẹ bẹ́, “Amma nkhenka nttaakhẹ ọkhọhn f'ntim uchikwura-cho chaam ntwu. Ma, s'n'mpe o?”<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Saul n'obeni bẹ́, “Tte Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạng-m irem, tte ọnạng-m ọttạra ọttạra, de ọma Jonatan nạnápua.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Okhenkha, ajunung mbọ n'abeni bẹ́, “Node bẹ́, Jonatan nwa kw'kk'Israẹl ẹkkaana chididen ọnạnga n'ope o? Mesese! Akwẹ oche ngwọ móde! K'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi urukhu akpen, isisira-naanga rạnẹ-rạnẹ s'Jonatan s'm'itto k'isisek k'ide, ukwuru bẹ́, oseng k'ẹkkaana ch'Ubinọkpaabyi bạra usi udik ngwa chemma.” Ma wọ ajunung mbọ akkaan Jonatan, abẹ dạk kẹ náfha.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Ma wọ Saul ukum aPhilistiya khukhubh, abẹ akpa nnạm abhạna kabẹ k'ibyi.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Masẹ Saul kk'ẹvaar ọdạbha k'Israẹl, urim ekpong ọbaabha idifhon s'awawunanạng pabẹ. Wa idifhon nnọ ide: Moab, ọttạra Ammọn, ọttạra Edom, ọttạra avaarnạng p'Zoba, ọttạra aPhilistiya. Wa ọnạngẹ anạng mbọ irem k'ibyi sidede s'okkeri ititikha. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Wa urim ekpong masẹ ujunung okhema abAmalẹk, ọbạra ọrạbha Israẹl k'mbọhk s'anạng p'uwa kk'bẹ achia k'ekpong.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ẹchọhmfhạr ch'Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Wa iva p'Saul ade Jonatan, ọttạra Ishvi ọttạra Malki-Shua. Ocheden-nwa kwẹ kw'ikwanạng okpen Mẹrab, kw'onyem-ẹ okpena Mikal. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Ikwanạng kw'Saul wa okpen Ahinoam, kw'ode nnwa kw'Ahimaz. Abnẹr wọ wa ode odennạng kw'akpongnạng p'Saul. Abnẹr wa ode ujunungnwa kw'Nẹr. Nẹr wa ode nnwotte kw'otte kw'Saul. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Abiyẹl wọ wa ofhonu Kish, kw'ode otte kw'Saul, ọbạra ofhon Nẹr, kw'ode otte kw'Abnẹr.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Wa okpe kw'Saul phyibh ode okpe kw'mkpong s'ikhạm-ọkhạm ọttạra aPhilistiya. Wa okpe kwidede kw'Saul ose ọfanạng kw'ọbạra ode okkemkpa, m'ọtạkh-ẹ ọttạra k'akpongnạng pẹ.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ufhumu Saul masẹ ọvaarnạng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samwẹl obeni Saul bẹ́, “Amma wọ kw'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhmọ bẹ́, mbyeng-ọ ana k'echo, ọfha ade ọvaarnạng kw'anạng pẹ, Israẹl; s'ode mạnna, m'akhọhmọ itọhng abhaanga ẹkkaabha ch'ibin k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa phyibh obeni bẹ́, ‘Amma m'nnạng anạng p'Amalẹk irem k'oche kw'uwa abẹ asi Israẹl, sabẹ akpa bẹ eden okpe kw'abẹ abin k'Ijip. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Ma o, sọhng ata arima abAmalẹk abẹ, abạra adimi fidede f'ode fabẹ. Vạnọ-vạnọ ọbọhk kátte uruk akpen; fhọ ajunung ọttạra ipanạng, ọttạra ọgbọsẹkhẹ, ọttạra iva p'abẹ atim k'mbọhk, ọttạra adamagbudu, ọttạra arạkhạmaan, ọttạra akamẹl, ọttạra nnyạnyaang.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Ma wọ Saul oyeri ajunung otobha, ọtạkha ubhik kwabẹ k'Telaim. Wa akpongnạng p'aseng k'mfhọhk ade nnọhna ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh asen, ọbạra ubhik anạng nnọhna ẹrạbh ukuma asen p'abin Juda. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Saul ubin ofona k'ofhon kw'Amalẹk, ọta uttubha k'epe utik bẹ. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Ma wọ Saul obeni abạKen bẹ́, “Asọhng afona, atte anạng p'Amalẹk ọbọhk ọfha nạngẹ bạnga mfhọ ọttạra bẹ; khiri wa abạnga asi ọphyaam anạng anạng p'Israẹl phyibh sabẹ abin k'Ijip.” Ma wọ anạng p'Ken abin arik Amalẹk.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Ma wọ Saul urim abAmalẹk abẹ, tạma k'Havila tạrr ukpira k'Shur, atena k'ukhubha kw'okpebha-dudon n'uyin k'Ijip. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Wa Saul ọvạk Agag kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Amalẹk ikhikhebhi, khẹ nọ́fha, okhenka utima ọkkangkkang-kkro ọfhọ anạng p'Agag phyibh. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Okhenkha, Saul ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ atte Agag ọbọhk, ọttạra arạkhạmaan pẹ p'ajibhi ifor, ọttạra adamagbudu, ọttạra abhaamva, ọttạra arạkhạmaan-va, ọttạra ọttọhk fidede f'ujibh-ujibh, aruk akpen. Wa ekpo mbyọ ẹmma bẹ ettem bẹ́ abẹ afhọ. Okhenkha, mbyọkha pyẹ nạn bẹ nẹ́daakha, ọttạra f'ọmạmọ ifor, abẹ annemeden akhibhi phyi-phyibh.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkpaakhẹ ọtọhnga ọnạng Samwẹl oben bẹ́, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Akwẹ ọmmaam k'ettem bẹ́, kk'Saul ọvaarnạng nsia, ukwuru bẹ kk'nnạm ọkpa ọvạr-m, ntọhna saam nọ́bra ọtạkha.” Wa udik ngwọ ọphyaangẹ Samwẹl ẹmma tạrr ọgạma, ose njọhm ma irungu njọ phyibh ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="1SA 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Samwẹl ubina k'ekpebha-rungu ọta ose Saul, okhenka, abẹ n'akpaakh-ẹ bẹ́, “Saul kk'ubina ofona k'Kaamẹl e. Mạma wọ usi ọkpata kw'abẹ m'atima ajim-ẹ, kk'adạkhẹ nnạm ọkpa ọsạkha ofona k'Gilgal.”<verse eid="1SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Masẹ Samwẹl n'okhebh-ẹ, Saul ọbẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udi-ọ, ukwuru bẹ́ kk'nsia oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhn-m.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Okhenkha, Samwẹl n'ọbạbhọ bẹ́, “Mbạng vọ f'arạkhạmaan n'ammẹbhẹ ma o? Mbạng vọ f'adamagbudu n'ammẹbhẹ ma o?”<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Saul ubhina bẹ́, “Akpongnạng bọ atim pyẹ k'Amalẹk akwu e; abẹ achokhu arạkhạmaan ọttạra adamagbudu p'ajibhi ifor, ọfha abẹ atima afọhnọ ẹja anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwọ, okhenka, kk'ekpo mbyọkha andima phyi-phyibh.”<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Samwẹl obeni Saul bẹ́, “Pyia dạk kákpaak! Kanse mkpaakh-ọ udik kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkpaakh-m chạnachẹ k'irungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Saul ubhina bẹ́, “Kpaakh-m.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samwẹl ọbẹ́, “Chibhi s'uwa asạk ifor sọ, ọma sạng kw'ade odecho kw'nkạma s'Israẹl o? Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obyeng-ọ ana k'echo ọfha adạbh Israẹl. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhm-ọ ọtọhm, oben bẹ́, ‘Sọhng ata adimi agbaan-nạng mbọ p'Amalẹk, rima bẹ abẹ tạrr ase bẹ́ kk'bẹ adima phyi-phyibh.’ <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Akwẹ n'oseng yạn kw'nạn Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nábhaanga o? Oseng yạn kw'atto akhubha k'ekpo p'anạng p'Amalẹk bạra asi ipyibha k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi o?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Saul okhenka ọpọhna Samwẹl bẹ́, “Amma kk'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ikpukpobha nnạnga e, kk'ọtọhm f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhm-m nta. Kk'anạng p'Amalẹk ndima <char style="it">bẹ́ phyibh,</char> mbạra mvạkha Agag kw'ode ọvaarnạng kwabẹ ntima nkwuna. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Akpongnạng mbọ atạk arạkhạmaan, ọttạra adamagbudu p'ẹkhaankẹ ijibh ifor, py'abẹ atim k'ekpong akwu, ọfha abẹ atima afọhnọ ẹja anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwọ k'Gilgal.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Ma wọ Samwẹl ọpọhn bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">“Ọma akkẹ bẹ́ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'ọtạkha ottennebh k'nnạnga ikkạmasẹ ọttạra nja ifọhnasẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">ọyọhnga bẹ́, ọnạng ọsạkha echo ọnạng k'ntọhna s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi o?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">Echo sạsạkha ijibhi ẹyọhnga ẹja-fạfọhnọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">ntọhna bhạbhaanga ibạra ijibh iyọhnga iyaak s'arạkhạmaan-dim.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Ukwuru bẹ́, ochokpọhkhọ ode masẹ ipyibha ch'ẹbọhk-sisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">nkkang-gạge ibạra ide masẹ ipyibha ch'akha-kpukpobha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">Masẹ ọma kk'ọtọhnga kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi afhuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">ẹma kk'ọma ufhuma masẹ ọvaarnạng.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Ma wọ Saul obeni Samwẹl bẹ́, “Amma kk'ipyibha nsia. Amma kk'inyina ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọttạra ntọhna sọ mfhuma. Akpongnạng mbọ bọ ajor-m e, ẹgwọ usi nkhọhmọ bẹ itọhng. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Totokhạn bina ma nạng-m k'ipyibha chaam, abạra akpa nnạm atạkh-m, ọfha mbạra mkpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Okhenkha, Samwẹl oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kọ abẹ mạ́ntwạn mkpa nnạm. Ọma kk'ọtọhnga kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi afhuma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'adạkhẹ ọma ufhuma masẹ ọvaarnạng kw'Israẹl!”<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Masẹ Samwẹl ọbhạkhẹ nnạm bẹ́, ofona, Saul ọkpạn-ẹ k'ammakpa p'ọnọhma-wuram, awẹ ọyaakhẹ. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Samwẹl n'oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Chemma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ẹvaar ch'Israẹl ọtạkha k'akhọ k'mbọhk, ọtạkha ọnạng oyok-ọbaanga kwọ wạnọ kw'ujibhi ọyọhng-ọ. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Ẹma nwọ kw'ode Abạrada p'Israẹl afhạra k'núsi, ẹkka chẹ k'nófona; ẹma masẹ oyokhanạng núdia kw'n'ofona ẹkka chẹ.”<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Saul ọpọhna bẹ́, “Amma kk'ipyibha nsia. Totokhạn, khenka nạng-m ikpukpobha k'ititikha s'adennạng p'anạng paam, ọttạra k'ititikha s'anạng p'Israẹl. Kwu antwạn amkpa nnạm, ọfha mkpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwọ.” <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Ma wọ Samwẹl utim Saul ọkpa nnạm, Saul okpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Ma wọ Samwẹl obeni bẹ́, “Akken-m Agag kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Amalẹk.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:32">Agag ubina ẹnyaan-ẹnyaana okhebha Samwẹl, ọkkẹ bẹ́, “K'udik ọkka, ojora f'obo kk'osenga.”<verse eid="1SA 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Okhenkha, Samwẹl ọbẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:33">“Oche kw'ọkkangkkang-kkro kwọ kk'ipanạng usia awor iva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:33">oche ngwọ gwọ kw'akka m'owor nnwa k'ikhaana s'ayok ipanạng.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1SA 15:33">Ma o, Samwẹl ọchẹk Agag k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'Gilgal.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Ma wọ Samwẹl ubin ọbhạna k'Rama, okhenka, Saul uvura ofona k'akhẹ k'ofhon k'Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Tạma ma, tạrr Samwẹl okhebha ma ope, Saul abẹ ayok dạk násia, oseng ma, wa Samwẹl kk'nkwuna s'Saul utima. Wa akwẹ ọbạra ọmma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'ettem s'usi Saul ọdạbh ẹvaar k'Israẹl.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Samwẹl obyeng Devid ana k'echo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Samwẹl bẹ́, “M'atima nkwuna s'Saul akpira k'abạng-okpe, s'kk-ẹ mfhuma masẹ ọvaarnạng kw'Israẹl o? Tạkha ana p'ẹbọhk-nạna ge k'ẹrạkhạmaansa chọ, abina osenga, m'ntọhm-ọ k'Jẹsẹ kw'ubin Bẹtẹlẹhẹm. Amma kk'ujunung-nwa kwẹ wạnọ nnenga bẹ́ ode ọvaarnạng.”<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Okhenkha, Samwẹl ọben bẹ́, “M'nsenga yạn nta o? De Saul ọbhaang kwẹ, khaam ọfha e.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbẹ́, “Tima ọbhaam-nwa kwa sọhng, de akpir ben bẹ́, ‘Kk'nkwa bẹ́ nkwu mfọhnọ ẹja nnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi e.’ <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Bher Jẹsẹ ma ẹjafọhnọ njọma, amma m'mbạra ntibh-ọ ọttọhk f'm'asi. M'abyenga nwọ kw'm'nkọhkh-ọ ana k'echo anạng-m.”<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samwẹl usi oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni. Masẹ ukpir k'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm, adecho p'ofhon ojora bẹ sabẹ ase-ẹ. Abẹ n'abạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Akwu k'ẹmẹm o?”<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samwẹl ọpọhna bẹ́, “Uwee, nkwu k'ẹmẹm bẹ́ nkwu mfọhnọ ẹja nnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ado ifor sabạnga iwur, akwu anta amfọhnọ ẹja.” Ma wọ Samwẹl usi Jẹsẹ ọttạra iva pẹ awur, obher bẹ ẹjafọhna.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Masẹ abẹ akpir kha, Samwẹl ose Eliyab, ukwu ọkkẹ bẹ́, “K'udik ọkka, kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'obyenga ana k'echo wọ obe ma ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="1SA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Okhenkha, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Samwẹl bẹ́, “Ifor sẹ, ọttạra ebe chẹ kásana, khiri ẹma sạng kw'nnoru. Oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'ose idik ikhạmọ k'oche kw'oyokhanạng n'ose. Oyokhanạng n'ose s'iyaan-iyaan, okhenkha, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'okkeri k'ettem.”<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Ma wọ Jẹsẹ oyeri Abinadab, utim-ẹ oseng Samwẹl k'ititikha. Okhenkha, Samwẹl ọbẹ, “Nnwama sạng kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi otek.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Jẹsẹ ọbạra utima Shama oseng, okhenka, Samwẹl ọbẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nnwama n'ọbạra otekha.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Wa Jẹsẹ utim ajunungva pẹ ncho nsenọfa ọkhọkha Samwẹl, okhenka, Samwẹl oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạng ma nótekha e.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Ma wọ Samwẹl n'ọbạbhọ Jẹsẹ bẹ́, “Ajunungva pọ p'akhaam phyibh bọ ma o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Jẹsẹ ọpọhna bẹ́, “Urikhi oyok kw'ọsạk ọtạm, kw'n'okkeri arạkhạmaan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Samwẹl ọbẹ, “Tọhm ọnạng oyer-ẹ ukwu; ẹyạr mạ́nninga tạrr ukpira.”<verse eid="1SA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Ma o, Jẹsẹ ọtọhm abẹ ata ayeri Devid ukwu. Wa Devid ujibhi kh'ifor ọttạra idikkobh ọttạra k'ikkikkeri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:12">Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́, “Bina byeng-ẹ ana k'echo, khiri ẹma wọ ma.”<verse eid="1SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Ma wọ Samwẹl ọtạk ana p'utim k'ẹrạkhạmaansa obyeng-ẹ k'echo ma ititikha s'ivotte pẹ. Tạma ma iwu njọ, Iguguma s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi isạkha ọttạra ẹfa, inwa Devid. Ma wọ Samwẹl ubin ọbhạna k'Rama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Devid uning k'isekhisek kw'Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Wa Iguguma s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ibina irik Saul, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbạra ọtọhm ọkpaakpa-tạma n'iphyaangẹ Saul ẹmma.<verse eid="1SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Atọhmnạng p'Saul oyeni aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kker e, ọkpaakpa-tạma s'Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhmọ ọnạng-ọ, rọ n'iphyaang-ọ ẹmma e. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Tte aro kwamạna ọtọhm amạnamba atọhmnạng pẹ anta annor ọnạng kw'n'ukhir ọgaang-gang. Okpe kw'ọkpaakpa-tạma nnọ m'inwọ-ọ, ukhir ọnạng-ọ, ifor ikpọhkh-ọ.”<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Ma wọ, Saul obeni atọhmnạng pẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga aror ọnạng kw'okke ọgaang-gang khikhir akken-m.”<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Ọtọhmnạng kwẹ wạnọ ọpọhna bẹ́, “Amma k'ujungnwa wạnọ kw'Jẹsẹ kw'ubin Bẹtẹlẹhẹm kw'okke ọgaang-gang khikhir nsia e. Ode okkedim, ọbạra ode okkemkpa, okke ọkpaakhadik, ọbạra ujibh idikkobh. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbạra uninga abẹ.”<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Ma wọ Saul ọtọhmọ atek-nkkaabha afona akhebha Jẹsẹ ọbẹ, “Tọhm nnwa kwọ Devid, kw'n'okkeri arạkhạmaan ken-m.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Ma wọ Jẹsẹ ọtạk ẹnyạnyaang ch'onạn brẹd, ọttạra itwuk-gbạre, ọttạra uvunwa, ọtọhm ọttạra nnwa kwẹ Devid, okkena Saul.<verse eid="1SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Devid ukwu uninga Saul abẹ, ọtạma ọtọhm sisi ọnạng-ẹ. Devid ọkhankẹ ọdaakhẹ Saul idik mororo, n'ukwu ode utim-ekpongkpo kwẹ. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Ma wọ Saul ọtọmọ ẹkkaabha ọnạng Jẹsẹ, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tte Devid ọbọhk uninga ma usi-m ọtọhm, ukwuru bẹ ọdaakh-m idik oseng eden.”<verse eid="1SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Okpe kwidede kw'ọkpaakpa-tạma nnwọ kw'Ubinọkpaabyi inwa Saul, Devid n'ọtạkha ọgaang-gang ukhir. Ma wọ ifor m'ikpọhkhọ Saul; ọkpaakpa-tạma nnọ bạra irikh-ẹ ẹbhaang.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Devid ọttạra Golayat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Ma okpe ngwọ, aPhilistiya ado ifor s'ekpong. Abẹ ayeri akpongnạng pabẹ atobha k'Soko k'ẹkhạma ch'Juda. Wa abẹ attim ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ k'Ẹphẹs-Damim, kw'uning k'erem ch'Soko ọttạra Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Wa Saul ọttạra anạng p'Israẹl attim ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ k'ipekhuma s'Ẹla, abẹ atwạr ẹgbagba chabẹ, ọfha abẹ arima aPhilistiya abẹ. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Wa aPhilistiya abe k'okpecho wạnọ, anạng p'Israẹl abe k'okpecho nwọkha, ipekhuma rọ n'ining bẹ k'ngekha.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Okkemkpa wạnọ kw'okpen Golayat kw'ubin Gat, ubin k'ibyibhingasẹ s'aPhilistiya uyin k'iyaan. Ẹma wa udumu ọyọhnga ntwạkhọ sọna-jobh k'ebe. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Wa ukhubh ikpo s'opo k'echo, ọbạra oge ekpong-nya ch'abẹ atim opo asi, ch'ikpir ashẹkẹl nnọhna jobh-kamfa ukuma arạbh jobh k'adọhbh. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />K'mfhok, oge ekpo-mfhok py'broze, k'nnạm, ọbạra orena ọkhọhn f'ode brons. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Ẹkhọhn-ma ch'uyuk kwẹ eronu masẹ ijum, achẹ ẹdọhbhọ ikpira ashẹkẹl ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh. Utim-ọkhọhnkpa kwẹ uchẹ-ẹ eden.<verse eid="1SA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Wa Golayat obe ọbạra ọttạbhẹ ikhaana s'akpongnạng p'Israẹl ẹmạng, ọbạbh bẹ́, “Ode yạn kw'abạnga ayini akwu abe k'ọkpakhaana bẹ́ abạnga arima ekpong? Amma sạng nde okkemkpa kw'aPhilistiya, abạngama ade atọhmnạng p'Saul? Arengi ujunung ọsạkha okhebh-m ma kadẹ o. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Ode ẹma m'okke urima abamẹ, ọbạra ọfhọ-m, amạnamba m'ande abira pabạnga, okhenka, ode amma nnyọhng-ẹ mkpam mbạra mfhẹ-ẹ, abạnga m'ade abira pamạna, abạra asi itọhm anạng mạna.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Ma wọ oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ obeni bẹ́, “Chemma, amma m'nnukhu akpongnạng p'Israẹl e! Anạng-m ujunung kw'm'annima ayok abẹ kadẹ.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Masẹ Saul ọttạra anạng p'Israẹl phyibh abhaang ọmmakkarẹ kw'oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ, ojora ọvạk bẹ, abẹ arạbh adwọ.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Ẹma Devid wa ode nnwa kw'Jẹsẹ, kw'ubin Ẹphrat k'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm k'ẹkhạma ch'Juda. Wa Jẹsẹ ọkhaam ajunungva asenọttaan, ọbạra ode ọnạng kw'kk'ọtạma okpe kw'Saul ọdạbhẹ ẹvaar.<verse eid="1SA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Wa achedenva attaan p'Jẹsẹ atwạnọ Saul abẹ ata ekpong. Ocheden okpen Eliyab; onyema okpena Abinadab; ottong attaan okpena Shama. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Devid wọ wa ode okpongannạm kw'ayok phyibh. Mbọkha anạng attaan p'kk'abạra atwạn Saul abẹ, <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />okhenka, Devid n'ọta k'Saul, ọkpa nnạm ọta okkeri arạkhạmaan p'otte k'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />K'iwu arạbh afa, oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ n'ubina k'ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ ukwu ọkkaarẹ ẹmma ọnạng anạng p'Israẹl k'ekpebha ọttạra k'ẹchọhkha.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Wa Jẹsẹ obeni nnwa kwẹ Devid bẹ́, “Yoma ẹgbangbang-dim ch'agwu abhaabha-pẹ ọttạra abrẹd jobh, atima akkena ivatte ẹbhạr-ẹbhạrẹ k'ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ aning. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Bạra tạkha abukpa k'ibyi jobh nạng utim-eden kwabẹ. Abạra ata ase ukhira kw'abẹ aning ka, akwu atekh-m. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Abẹ aning Saul abẹ, ọttạra akpongnạng p'Israẹl phyibh k'ipekhuma s'Ẹla, n'arima aPhilistiya abẹ.”<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />K'ekpekpebha Devid otte arạkhạmaan p'n'okkeri ọbọhk ọnạng ọnạng kw'n'okkeri itirakpo, ubin ọta usi oche kw'Jẹsẹ ọtọhm-ẹ. Wa ukpir k'ibyibhingasẹ s'akpongnạng n'ayin k'iyaan abe k'ọkpakhaana, n'awur ekpong-mạng. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl ọttạra aPhilistiya n'ado ifor s'ekpong akkeri ayok ititikha. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Devid ọtạkha ekpo p'utim ọkpaara ọnạng kw'n'okkeri ekpongkpo, ọrạbh ofona k'akpongchen ọta okhebha ivotte pẹ kha, usima bẹ. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Masẹ Devid utim ọkpaakh bẹ abẹ udik o, Golayat kw'ode okkemkpa kw'aPhilistiya kw'ubin Gat, uyin k'ọkpakhaana kwẹ, ukwu obe. Ọwumọ oche kw'n'ọwumọ, Devid obe kha ọbhaanga. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Masẹ anạng p'Israẹl ase ujunung nwọ, ojora f'ididen ọvạkh bẹ phyibh, abẹ atwạr nnạm-nnạm.<verse eid="1SA 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Ma wọ, anạng p'Israẹl n'aben bẹ́, “Abạnga nạnk'ase oche kw'ujunung nwa n'uyin k'iyaan okpe idede o? N'uyin bẹ́ ukwu unukhu Israẹl e. Ọnạng kw'ọfhọ ujunung nwa, ọvaarnạng m'ọnạng-ẹ ẹkhaama chididen, ọbạra ọnạng-ẹ uminanwa kwẹ k'ọbada, ọbạra ọrạbha ẹchọhmfhạr ch'otte kw'ọnạng nwọ k'atas nạnạng k'Israẹl.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Ma wọ Devid ọbạbhọ ajunung p'aning abaang-ẹ bẹ́, “Mbạng vọ pf'abẹ m'asi anạng ọnạng kw'ọfhọ oPhilistiya nwa, kw'm'ọbạra ọrạbha Israẹl k'ẹsẹkha njama o? Bạng ọkpa-twạr oPhilistiya-khira wọ ma, kw'n'unukhu akpongnạng p'Ubinọkpaabyi kw'urukhu akpen o?”<verse eid="1SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Anạng mbọ abạra akpaakh-ẹ oche kw'abẹ n'akpaak, aben-ẹ bẹ, “Kkeri ọttọhk-khira pf'abẹ m'asi anạng ọnạng kw'ọfhọ ujunung nwa.”<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Masẹ Eliyab kw'ode nnwotte kwididen kw'Devid ọbhaang s'Devid n'ọkpaak idik ajunung mbọ abẹ, ettem ipyibh-ẹ otena abẹ, n'ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Asi yạn akwu ma? Anẹ wọ atte arạkhạmaan mbọ p'nạn asaabha ọbọhk anạng k'ibyi s'owor bẹ́, okkeri o? Nsong oche ma kw'n'age nkkang ọttạra oche kwa apyibhi akpira, akwu ma bẹ, akwu ase ekpong e.”<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Ma wọ Devid obạbhọ bẹ́, “Mbẹ, bạng udik gwọ njẹ o? Nạng adạkh udik mkpaakhẹ o?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Devid ubina ma, ofona k'ọnạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk, ọbạbh adạkhẹ udik ngwọ gwạnọ, ajunung mbọ abạra anạng-ẹ ibhina ch'wạra abẹ anạng-ẹ. <verse eid="1SA 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Wa anạng abhaang udik kw'Devid ọkpaakhẹ, abẹ afona ata akpaak Saul. Saul o, n'ọtọhmọ bẹ́, abẹ ayeri Devid anạng-ẹ.<verse eid="1SA 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Devid oben Saul bẹ́, “Tte ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ nạng-ẹ ojor ukwuru oPhilistiya-nạng nwa, amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ m'nta ọta, nta nnima abẹ.”<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Saul n'ubhin Devid bẹ́, “Ọma ẹfa kákhaam ch'marima oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ abẹ e, ọma atim ade nnwa-nnwa, ukwuru bẹ́, ẹma ọtạm k'idikobh chẹ ode urima-nạng e.”<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Okhenkha, Devid ubhina Saul bẹ́, “Attitte, amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ n'nkkeri arạkhạmaan p'otte kwaam. Okpe kw'ekke, ọbạra ode Ẹttọh chididen, kwidede ukwu bẹ́, udira ọrạkhạmaan wạnọ k'arạkhạmaan p'ntim, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />amma e, nạng nkhubh chẹ tạrr nvun chẹ ọttọhk, mbạra nnạbha ọrạkhạmaan nwọ k'akh-ẹ k'ẹmma. Okpe kw'achẹ ẹbhạkhẹ irima abamẹ, mbạra vạkha chẹ k'aphyạbha pẹ, mvun chẹ mfhọ. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />S'ase ọtọhmnạng kwọ ma, kk'ekke, ọttạra ẹttọh-dim mfha; mạnna wọ m'mbạra nsi ọkpa-twạr oPhilistiya-nạng nwa ode, ukwuru bẹ́, kk'akpongnạng p'Ubinọkpaabyi kw'urukhu akpen unukha oseng eden. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nwọ kw'ọrạbh-m k'mbọhk s'ekke, ọttạra k'mbọhk s'ẹttọh-dim, m'ọbạra ọrạbh-m k'mbọhk s'oPhilistiya-nạng nwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Ma wọ Saul obeni Devid bẹ́, “Sọhng, tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uninga abọ.”<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Ma wọ, Saul ọtạkha ekpong-kpo pyẹ ọdạbh Devid. Uge-ẹ iwuru wuram ch'abẹ atim atenkpa asi, ọttạra ikpo s'brons ukhubh-ẹ k'echo. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Devid ọtạkha ọkkangkkang-kkro kw'Saul ọdạbh kirin, masẹ oben bẹ́ ubina osenga, okhenkha kokke, ukwuru bẹ, pyẹ tạm nutima bạra. N'obeni Saul bẹ, “Amma ekpo mbyia mạnkke ntima nsenga e, ukwuru bẹ, pyẹ tạm nạntima bạra.” Osenga ma, ọwạra pyẹ.<verse eid="1SA 17:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Ma wọ ọtạk uchikwura kwẹ utima k'ọbọhk, ofona kha efhobh ọta otekha ata asen p'akwọng-ọkwọnga, oge k'ẹkpa ch'ọbhaak, ọtạkha ọbhạr-ẹta kwẹ utima k'ọbọhk osenga ofora oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ n'ofon ororo osenga ofora Devid k'ifor, ọttạra utim-ọkhọhnkpa kwẹ kw'ochẹ-ẹ eden. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />OPhilistiya-nạng nwọ ose bẹ́, Devid utim ode udikkobh kw'ujibhi ifor, ọbạra ujibh idikkobh, n'ose-ẹ ẹsạkha. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Oben Devid bẹ́, “Nkher-ọ ẹpfa sa, kw'natim nchi bẹ́, akw'arima abamẹ o?” Osenga ma, oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ utima ache p'ikha sẹ ọsaakhẹ Devid. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />OPhilistiya-nạng nwọ oben Devid bẹ́, “Twạkhọ gbaar-m kanse, m'mvạkhọ, ntạkha atennạng pọ nnạng ọnọhn f'ẹrạng ọttạra mkpaten!”<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Devid ubhina oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ bẹ, “Ọma atim ọkkangkkang-kkro, ọttạra uyuk, ọttạra ọkhọhn bẹ́, akwu arim-m abẹ, okhenka, amma ntim eche ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa phyibh, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'arim-mkpong p'Israẹl, kw'kk'ẹsẹkha anạnga. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Chemma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'ọtạkh-ọ oge-m k'mbọhk, m'mfhọ-ọ, mbạra mkpaar-ọ echo. Chemma, m'ntạkha abukhu p'arim-mkpong p'aPhilistiya nnạng ọnọhn f'ẹrạng, ọttạra mkpaten, ọfha iyagbin phyibh isonga bẹ́, Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl uning ka. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Anạng mba phyibh p'atobh ma, m'asonga bẹ́, ọkkangkkang-kkro ọttạra ọkhọhn sạng p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nutima ọkkaana anạng, ukwuru bẹ́, irima nja ede ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ẹma wọ m'ọtạkha bạnga oge mạna k'mbọhk.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Masẹ oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ ọtwạkhọ ọgbaara bẹ́, urima Devid abẹ, Devid uttima ẹbhạr otena m'akpong-chen, okhebh-ẹ khạkha. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Devid ọnọhma ọbọhk k'ẹkpa chẹ ọrạbha ẹta oge k'ọbhạr-ẹta kwẹ, ọtọhbh oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ ma ititikha-ttem <char style="it">bẹ́ jeer.</char> Ẹta njọ ẹnwẹ-ẹ k'ititikha-ttem ẹtaanga, otto ukhubha ititikha k'isisek.<verse eid="1SA 17:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Ma wọ Devid utim ọbhạr-ẹta mạnkkeni okhema oPhilistiya-junung nwọ; oseng s'nạn ọkkangkkang-kkro nútima, wa okhebha ma ọfhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="1SA 17:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Devid o, n'uttim ẹbhạr okhebh-ẹ k'ibyi s'otto, ọrạbha ọkkangkkang-kkro kw'oPhilistiya-junung nwọ k'ọpa kwẹ. Ma wọ utim ọkkangkkang-kkro nwọ ọkpaar-ẹ echo <char style="it">bẹ́ tteng.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Masẹ aPhilistiya n'ase bẹ́ otendim kwabẹ kk'upua, abẹ abhạkhẹ nnạm arạbh.<verse eid="1SA 17:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Ma wọ ajunung p'Israẹl ọttạra p'Juda awuru ẹmạng, afona ororo akhubh aPhilistiya mbọ tạrr akpira k'efhoncho ch'Gat, ọttạra k'mbaakhama s'Ẹkrọn. Abukhu pabẹ ayim k'ọkkaden udumudum kw'Sharayim, tạrr ukpira k'nden s'Gat ọttạra Ẹkrọn <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Masẹ anạng p'Israẹl akpa nnạm s'abẹ k'aPhilistiya akhubha, abẹ atim ẹkhaama ch'ẹsaabh-ọsaabhh ch'abẹ atạk k'ibybhingasẹ s'aPhilistiya, atima akwuna. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Devid utima echo ch'oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ ọbhạna k'Jẹrusalẹm, ọbạra ọtạkha ekpongkpo p'oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ ochok k'ukkira kwẹ.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Masẹ wa Saul ose s'Devid n'ofona bẹ́ ọta urima oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ abẹ, wa ọbạbhọ Abnẹr, kw'ode ochocho-nạng kw'arim-ekpong bẹ́, “Anẹ wọ ofhonu udikkobh-nwa nwọ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abner ubhin-ẹ bẹ, “O aro ọvaar, k'oche kw'arukhu akpen ma, amma otte kạ́nsong e.”<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Ọvaarnạng ọbẹ, “Sọhng ta aror songa ọnạng kw'ofhonu udikkobh-nwa nwọ.”<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Oche ngwọ kw'Devid ukwun ekpong ch'ọfhọ oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ <char style="it">bẹẹ,</char> Abnẹr ọvạkh-ẹ k'ọbọhk utim-ẹ okkena Saul, s'utim utim echo ch'oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ ma ọbọhk.<verse eid="1SA 17:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Ma wọ Saul ọbạbh Devid bẹ́, “Ọma ade nnwa kw'anẹ?” Devid ubhin bẹ, “Amma nde nnwa kw'ọtọhmnạng kwọ, kw'okpen Jẹsẹ kw'ubin Bẹtẹlẹhẹm.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Saul ọkhaam ottemma otena Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Masẹ wa Devid kk'idik ọkpaakha phyibh ọttạra Saul, Jonatan o, n'ọtạk Devid masẹ oyodikkobh-ttem kwẹ, Devid n'ọdaakh-ẹ oche kw'ifor sẹ idaakhẹ. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Tạma ma iwu njọ, Devid n'urukhu Saul abẹ, Saul dạk nóchera bẹ́ Devid ọbhạna k'otte k'ọchọhm. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Wa Jonatan ọtạk echekha ọttạra Devid ukwuru idạdaakha s'ọkhaam Devid abẹ. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Ma wọ Jonatan ọwạr ọnọhma-wuram kw'oge k'ifor, ọttạra ẹnya ẹdwạkh-ọdwạk, ọttạra ọkkangkkang-kkro kwẹ, ọttạra uyuk, ọttạra udikhikpa kwẹ ọnạng Devid.<verse eid="1SA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Wa Devid n'usi fidede f'Saul ọtọhm-ẹ k'eden ọkkachẹ, osenga ma, Saul usi-ẹ odecho kw'akpongnạng. Wa udik ngwọ orebhi anạng phyibh ettem, oseng k'atọhmnạng p'Saul.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Masẹ akpongnạng mbọ n'akwuna s'Devid kk'okkemkpa kw'aPhilistiya ọfha, ipanạng abin k'ifhon phyi-phyibh s'ining k'Israẹl, atima ọkkọhna ọttạra utubha, ọttạra mmạng s'ottennebh, ọttạra achakha, ọttạra agaang-gaang akhebha ọvaar Saul. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Masẹ abẹ n'atubh o, abẹ n'akkọhn aben bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">“Saul kk'nnọhna sẹ ọfha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 18:7">Devid ọbạra ọfhọ nnọhna ibhikh-asong sẹ.”<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Wa Saul ọdwạkh-ẹ ukwuru ẹmạng njọ ch'ipanạng akkọhnọ, ọbẹ́, “Abẹ kk'Devid atọhnga ọttạra nnọhna ibhikh-asong sẹ, abẹ akhenka atọhnga amma ọttạra nnọhna mạnkkeni. N'urikhi ẹvaar chaam ch'm'okkera ọtạkha!” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Tạma ma okpe ngwọ, Saul ọkhaama ottemma ottena Devid.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Masẹ iwu echobh ma, ọkpaakpa-tạma kw'ubin k'Ubinọkpaabyi inwa Saul k'ẹfa, ọtạma idik fhuru-fhuru kpạkpaak k'akhẹ k'ọchọhm. Ma okpe ngwọ, Devid n'ukhir ọgaang-gang kwẹ oche kw'n'ukhir kanạma. <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Wa Saul ọbhạrẹ ọkhọhn mvọ, oben k'ettem bẹ́, “M'nkhum Devid mmaana k'udimokpon.” Okhenkha, Devid ọnnaang ọkhọhn mvọ nden mfa.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Saul wa ọkhaam ojora f'Devid, ukwuru bẹ wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Saul ọbọhk uttia, okhenka uninga Devid abẹ. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Ma wọ Saul ukhubhu Devid k'akhẹ k'ọchọhm, n'usi-ẹ odecho kw'akpongnạng p'ayongu nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh jobh. Wa Devid n'utima akpongnạng mbọ eden, abẹ ata mkpong akwuna. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Ọttọhk fidede f'uwa Devid usi n'ujibh-ujibh ọnạng-ẹ, ukwuru s'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uning abẹ. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Masẹ wa Saul ose bẹ́ fidede f'Devid usi n'ujibh-ujibh ọnạng-ẹ, wa Saul ọkhaam ojora f'Devid. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Okhenkha, wa Devid ọdaakhẹ anạng p'Israẹl ọttạra aJuda phyibh idik, ukwuru s'uwa n'utima akpongnạng ọtta mkpong ukwuna.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Ma wọ, Saul obeni Devid bẹ́, “Kkeri Mẹrab kw'ode ocheden-nwa k'apanạngva paam ma. Amma m'ntạkh-ẹ nnạng-ọ k'ọbada. Udik ubungukwẹ kw'm'asi ode bẹ́, m'ade urim-ekpong kwaam kw'ọbạr ettem, abạra arima mkpong s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.” Saul wa ọkkẹ k'ettem chẹ bẹ́, “Ọbọhk kwaam mạ́ntima mfhẹ-ẹ. Tte aPhilistiya asi ngwọ!”<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Oche ngwọ gwọ Devid ubhin Saul bẹ́, “Amma nde anẹ, ẹchọhmfhạr ch'otte kwaam oseng efonamma ch'otte kwaam ede mbạng k'Israẹl, kw'm'nsenga akwẹ nde ọnyẹ kw'ọvaarnạng o?” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Ma o, okpe kw'n'ukpir bẹ́ abẹ atạkha Mẹrab kw'ode nnwa kw'Saul anạng Devid k'ọbada o, abẹ n'atạkh-ẹ anạng oJipnạng kw'okpen Adriyẹl kw'ubin Mẹhola, k'ọbada.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Wa ọkwanạng-nwa kw'Saul kw'okpen Mikal, ọkhaam Devid abẹ ididaakha. Masẹ Saul ọbhaang kwẹ, ettem erebh-ẹ. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Saul ukwu ọkkẹ bẹ́, “Amma m'nnạng-ẹ Mikal bẹ, ọtạkh-ẹ k'ọbada, ọfha nsenga ma nno ọmma nchokh-ẹ, k'oche kw'aPhilistiya m'asenga ma, avạkh-ẹ.” Saul oben Devid bẹ́, “Mantọhmma, kk'ọbhaang ọdwạkh-ọdwạk akhaama bẹ́, ade ọnyẹ kwaam.”<verse eid="1SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Ma wọ Saul obeni atọhmnạng pẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga asọng ata akpaak Devid bẹ́, ‘Kker e, akhaangka adaak ọvaar Saul ọttạra atọhmnạng pẹ idik mororo; khenka chera bẹ́, m'ade ọnyẹ kw'Saul.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Wa abẹ ata akpaak Devid oche kw'Saul kk'bẹ ọtọhna bẹ́ abẹ akpaakh-ẹ. Okhenkha, Devid ọpọhna bẹ́, “Abạnga akkẹ bẹ, ode ọvava-dik bẹ́, ọnạng ode ọnyẹ kw'ọvaarnạng? Ukpukpora masẹ akhaam, anẹ wọ osong-m?”<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Okpe kw'atọhmnạng p'Saul akpaakh-ẹ oche kw'Devid kk'bẹ ọkpaakha, <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Saul ọpọhna bẹ́, “Aben Devid bẹ́, ‘Ọvaarnạng imina-rạkha ẹdwạkh-ọdwạk nórora e, oyonga mkpatwạr arạbh asen s'aPhilistiya, ọfha utima utwuk idik s'awawunanạng pẹ kk-ẹ asia.’ ” Nttọhna s'Saul ide bẹ́, Devid m'osenga ma otto k'mbọhk s'aPhilistiya abẹ afhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="1SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Masẹ atọhmnạng p'Saul atạk idik nnọ akpaak Devid o, ettem erebh-ẹ sạsạkhẹ sạng bẹ́ ẹma n'abạra ode ọnyẹ kw'ọvaarnạng. Brasẹ okpe n'ukpir kw'Saul uge-ẹ, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Devid ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ abina ata afhọ aPhilistiya arạbh jobh, utima mkpatwạr sabẹ phyibh okkena ọvaarnạng, ọfha osenga ma ode ọnyẹ kw'ọvaarnạng. Ma wọ Saul ọtạk nnwa kwẹ Mikal ọnạng Devid k'ọbada.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Masẹ Saul ukwu utin bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uning Devid abẹ, ọttạra bẹ́ Devid ọdaakhẹ nnwa kwẹ Mikal, ọdaak, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Saul o, Devid n'udiẹ-ẹ ojor-ojora, n'uwunu Devid k'akpen pẹ phyibh.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Wa adecho p'akpongnạng p'aPhilistiya afon ororo ata ekpong, okhenka, okpe kwidede kw'abẹ ata, Devid n'ọkhaama ọyọhbh ọtạm ọyọhnga attọhmnạng p'Saul, Devid osenga ma uyin eche.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Saul okhong bẹ́, ọfhọ Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Wa Saul obeni nnwa kwẹ Jonatan, ọttạra atọhmnạng p'ẹma Saul phyibh bẹ́, abẹ afhọ Devid. Okenkha, wa Jonatan usi Devid eyodikkobh-ttem chẹ, <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Jonatan n'ọtwạrọ Devid itọhng, ọbẹ́, “Otte kwaam Saul n'oror eden ch'm'ọfhọ-ọ e. Tik ifor sọ o, uphyini k'ekpebha rạbh taror ibyi attubha. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Amma ọttạra otte kwaam m'nyin k'iyaan anta ambe k'ibyi s'attubh, ọfha mkpaakh-ẹ udik ukwuru ọma, ọfha mmaanga ukhira kw'm'ubhina, ọfha nkwu mkpaakh-ọ.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Wa Jonatan ọkpaakhẹ ijibha ch'Devid kk'usia, ọnạng otte Saul, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọma ọvaarnạng, ọtọhmnạng kwọ Devid ipyibha kási, ukwuru bẹ́ ẹma khọ ipyibha tạm núsia, ayongu ma, ọma kk'iru sididen atạkha k'idik s'kk'usia. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Ẹma wa ocher obo k'okpe kw'ọfhọ oPhilistiya-nạng nwọ. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ Israẹl phyibh ẹkkaana ch'atim achen pọ ase, ettem ẹbạra erebh-ọ. Ma oseng yạn kw'm'asi ọnạng masẹ Devid kw'mbọhk iwur-uwur ipyibha, kw'nabạra afhẹ-ẹ k'ajaakha o?”<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Wa Saul ocher udik kw'Jonatan ọkpaakhẹ, ọtạkha echekha oben bẹ́, “Nchekhi k'eche ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'urukhu akpen bẹ́, abẹ Devid máfhọ.”<verse eid="1SA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Ma wọ Jonatan oyeri Devid ọkpaakh-ẹ nttọhna s'ẹma ọttạra otte <char style="it">bẹ́ phyibh,</char> bạra n'utim-ẹ ọkpa nnạm k'Saul, Devid ọbạra uruk ọttạra Saul oche kw'uwa urukhu.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Wa ekpong etto dạkhẹ, Devid ọta urima aPhilistiya abẹ, ọfhọ bẹ k'ọsaabh tạrr abẹ arạbh arikh-ẹ.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Okhenkha, masẹ Saul uning ẹyạr k'akhẹ k'ọchọhm, ọkhọhn apfẹ k'ọbọhk, wa iguguma-tạma s'ibin k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi inwẹ-ẹ. Okpe kw'Devid n'ukhir ọgaang-gang, <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Saul okhong bẹ́, ukhum-ẹ ọkhọhn ọmaana k'udimokpon, okhenka, Devid ọrạbhọ ọnnaanga. Ma irungu njọ, Devid ọrạbhọ ọnnaanga, ọkkaana akpen pẹ.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Wa Saul ọtọhmọ ajunung bẹ́, abẹ ata abaabha ọchọhm kw'Devid k'irungu, ọfha abẹ afhẹ-ẹ k'ekpebha. Okhenkha, wa Mikal kw'ode ikwanạng kw'Devid, ọtwạr udim Devid itọhng, ọbẹ́, “De nạn nárora bẹ́, ape ma irungu ch'chemma, nemi eden rạbh akkaana akpen pọ, deja, uphyini abẹ m'afhọ-ọfhọ e.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Ma wọ Mikal utim ufhum-ma ọkkaana Devid ọrạbh ọsạkha, ọnnaanga. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Mikal o, n'ọtạk ọkpatanwa ururu k'ibhikha, ọtạkha ẹnọhmakpa ububha wẹ, ọbạra ọtạkha wẹ ọnạna echo k'avuphyạbha.<verse eid="1SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Masẹ Saul ọtọhmọ ajunung mbọ bẹ́, abẹ ata avạkha Devid, Mikal n'otekhi, bẹ bẹ́, “Ọmmẹ-ẹ ọmma e.”<verse eid="1SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Ma wọ Saul ọtọhmọ ajunung mbọ bẹ́, abẹ akpa nnạm k'Devid, oben bẹ bẹ́, “Adir-ẹ ma ibhikha njọ chẹ akken-m mfhẹ-ẹ.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Okhenkha, masẹ atọhmnạng ajunung mbọ n'anwa k'ọchọhm kw'Devid, kkeri ọkpatanwa kha ibhikha, kw'abẹ anạn echo k'avuphyạbha.<verse eid="1SA 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Wa Saul n'ọbạbhọ Mikal bẹ́, “Asi yạn abọhr-m abạra asi ọwawunanạng kwaam ọrạbh o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Mikal ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ẹma oben-m bẹ́, ‘Tte-m ọbọhk nnạbh, deja, m'mfh-ọfhọ e.’ ’’<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Masẹ Devid kk'ọrạbha ọnnaanga, ọta okhebha Samwẹl k'Rama, ọtạkha udik kwidede kw'Saul kk'ẹ usia ọkpaakh-ẹ. Ma wọ ẹma ọttạra Samwẹl asengi afona k'Naiyọt ata aruk ka. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Wa ẹkkaabha ikpir Saul bẹ́, “Devid uning k'Naiyọt k'ukhubha kw'Rama e.” <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Ma wọ Saul ọtọhmọ ajunung bẹ́, abẹ ata avạkha Devid akken-ẹ. Okhenkha, masẹ abẹ ase ikhaana s'asi-ẹyaakha n'asi ẹyaakha o, ọttạra Samwẹl kw'obe masẹ utim-eden kwabẹ, Iguguma s'Ubinọkpaabyi ẹsạkha ẹnwa ajunung mbọ p'Saul, abẹ attạra akpaak ettem ch'Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Wa Saul ọbhaang udik ngwọ, ọbạra ọtọhm ajunung adwạkh-ọdwạk p'asaabhẹ ayọhnga mbọ p'ocheden ọtọhm, ayok mbọ abạra asi-ẹyaakha. Ma o, Saul ọbạra ọtọhm ikhaana s'ittong ittaan, abẹma mbọ abạra asi-ẹyaakha oche kw'ayok asi. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />K'ekpongannạm-kpe, ẹma oyeni n'ubin k'akhẹ ifor ofona k'Rama, k'isipe chididen ch'ining k'Seku. Ọbạbh bẹ́, “Samwẹl ọttạra Devid aning mạn yeri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:22">Abẹ aben bẹ́, “Abẹ aning k'Naiyọt k'ẹkhạma ch'Rama e.”<verse eid="1SA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Ma o, Saul oseng ofona k'Naiyọt k'Rama. Okhenkha, Iguguma s'Ubinọkpaabyi ẹsạk ẹnwa dạkhẹ ẹma Saul, ọtạma ma n'osenga usi ẹyaakha tạrr ukpira k'Naiyọt. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Wa ọwạr ọnọhma-wuram kwẹ, ọbạra usi ẹyaakha ma ititikha s'Samwẹl. N'uning ẹkpakpa-eje ma irungu njọ tạrr ukpira k'ẹya. Ẹgwọ usi anạng n'abạbh bẹ́, “Saul ọgba ọttạra k'ikhaana s'asi-ẹyaakha o?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Devid ọttạra Jonatan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Ma wọ Devid ọrạbhọ k'Naiyọt k'ẹkhạma ch'Rama, ọta okhebha Jonatan ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Amma oyeni nsi mbạng o? Njẹ bạng udik o? Mpini atte kwọ yạn kw'n'okhonga bẹ́ ọfhọ-m o?”<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Jonatan ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Mesese! Ọma mápe! Kkeri e, vạnọ-vạnọ kóde f'otte kwaam m'usi, ọsạkh-ọsạkha ọbạr-ọbạr, kw'nạn khaam kạnọ́kpaak. M'usi yạn udubh-m ngwa o? Oche ngwọ núdia!”<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Okhenkha, Devid ọtạk echekha oben bẹ́, “K'udik ọkka, atte osong ma bẹ́, amma ndaakh-ọ idik mororo. Ẹma kk'obena k'ettem bẹ́, ‘Jonatan udik ngwa mósonga, deja, ettem kẹ mérebh.’ Okhenkha, oche ngwọ kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi urukhu akpen, ọttạra oche kw'ọma abạra aruk akpen, amma n'nning k'ngekha s'obo ọttạra akpen.”<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Jonatan obeni Devid bẹ́, “Fidede f'abeni bẹ́ nsi, m'nsusi nnạng-ọ.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Ma wọ Devid n'obeni Jonatan bẹ́, “Jima bẹ́ uphyini wọ ode erobhawu ch'ophye ọbhakwẹ, kw'wạra ọbaan bẹ́, nchi uchiattọhk ọttạra ọvaarnạng, okhenka, tte nta nttubha k'owonu tạrr ukpira uphyini k'ẹchọhkha. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />De atte ọbạbhọ-ọ bẹ́, amma mo, tekh-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Wạra Devid ọtạk ẹfa bẹ́, ntte-ẹ ọbọhk ọta k'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm kw'ode ofhon kwẹ, ukwuru sabẹ n'afọhnọ ẹja ch'cho k'efona chẹ.’ <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />De obeni bẹ́, ‘Ọbaan ma,’ songa bẹ́ udik kóde. Okhenkha, de ettem ipyibh-ẹ, songa k'udik-ọkka bẹ́, ọkhạmọ ipyibha otena abamẹ. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Ọma si-m ijibha masẹ ọtọhmnạng kwọ, ator k'echekha ch'kk'atạkha amma abẹ k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ode iponga khaam ipyibha, tima ọbọhk kwọ fhọ-m kadẹ! Oseng yạn kw'n'atte-m ọbọhk anạng atte bẹ́ ọfhọ o?”<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Jonatan ọbẹ́, “Mạnna núdia! Ode wạra mmaang yebhi-yebhi bẹ́ otte kwaam n'ọkhạmọ bẹ́ ọfhọ-ọ, wạra khọ m'mkpaakh o?”<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Devid n'ọbạbhọ Jonatan bẹ́, “Ma m'nsi yạn nsonga de atte ubhin-ọ k'idwạdwạkhọ?”<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Jonatan obeni Devid bẹ́, “Kwu amfona k'owonu.” Ma wọ abẹ atwạnọ afona k'owonu.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Ma o, Jonatan oben Devid bẹ́, “Amma nchekhi k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl bẹ́, k'iwu ifa k'ititikha, amma ọttạra otte kwaam m'amkpaak idik. De ẹma ọkhaam ẹkka ẹkkachẹ otena abọ, m'nsi-usi asonga. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Okhenkha, ode otte kwaam ọkhạmọ bẹ́ usi-ọ ọttọhk, tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạng aama Jonatan irem, tte ọnạng-m ọttạra-ọttạra, de nạn khọ nạ́nsia asonga, mbạra nkkaan-ọ afona k'idira. Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uninga abọ oche kw'kk'otte kwaam abẹ uninga. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Okhenkha, khọhkh-m ididaakha khira s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi s'nạn itwuna ikhaam, ator k'oche kw'm'nnuk akpen mkpira, ọfha abẹ nạng-m afhọ. <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />Ọma idạdaakha sọ kàkpaara k'ẹchọhmfhạr chaam, tạrr oseng k'okpe kw'kwạna Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'awawunanạng p'ọma Devid udima phyibh ma ọyagbin.”<verse eid="1SA 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Ma wọ Jonatan ọtạk echekha ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr ch'Devid, ọbẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi awawunanạng p'Devid atọhkha mpyibha sabẹ.” <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Wa Jonatan oseng ididaakha asẹ usi Devid ọtạkha dạkhẹ echekha chẹ, ukwuru bẹ́, Devid ọdaakh-ẹ masẹ ifor sẹ oyeni.<verse eid="1SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Wa Jonatan obeni Devid bẹ́, “Uphyini wọ ode erobhawu ch'ophye ọbhakwẹ. Anạng m'asong-osonga bẹ́ káde, s'ọnạng nạn ẹyạr k'ogbera kwọ mùninga. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />de uphyini osengi, k'ẹchọhkha, sọhng ma ibyi nnọ s'uwa attubh okpe kw'ọmma-phyaangẹ nwa ọtạm, ttubha ma ẹta ch'Ẹzẹl, atik. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Amma m'ntta ayuk attaan k'ukhubha gwạnọ kw'ẹta njọ, aben bẹ́, n'mben bẹ́, ntta ọttọhk. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Ma wọ m'ntọhm udikkobh-nwa mben-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Sọhng ta aror ayuk mbọ.’ De abhaang s'mben-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Kkeri pyẹ k'ukhubha kwọ, tạkha pyẹ kwu,’ kw'uyini bẹ́, mbeni bẹ́ ọmoyeni akwu, ukwuru bẹ́, k'udik ọkka, k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi urukhu akpen, kwu khiri kk'annaanga, ojora kòde. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Okhenkha, de mbeni udikkobh-nwa nwọ bẹ́, ‘Kker e, ayuk mbọ aning ayongu ma ibyi sabẹ e,’ kw'uyini bẹ́, oyonga m'abina afona, ukwuru bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọ usia bẹ́ arạbh annaanga. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />K'echekha ch'amma ọttạra ọma kk'antạkha, jima bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ ode mạna nttẹnsẹ tạrr ipimmanitor.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Ma wọ Devid uttubh k'owonu. Masẹ erobha ch'ophye ọbhakwẹ ikpir, ọvaar Saul ọta uninga ẹyạr bẹ́, uchi ọttọhk. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Wa ọvaarnạng uning ẹyạr oche kw'ẹmmaana ede, okkeri Jonatan ititikha, Abnẹr ọbạra uninga ọbaanga ẹma Saul, okhenka, wa ọnạng kw'uning k'ogbera kw'Devid kóde. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Saul udik gwạnọ-gwạnọ nọ́kpaakha ma iwu njọ, s'ọkkẹ bẹ́, “Nạnudusi udik kk'uttia okhebha Devid kw'usi-ẹ ọkkẹ bẹ́, ẹma núwura k'oche kw'wạra m'ọgba ọttạra usi erobha nja, k'udik ọkka, Devid núwura k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Masẹ iwu echobh ma ch'ettong iwu ifa s'ophye kw'erobha njọ, Devid nọ́bra ukwa bẹ́ uninga ẹyạr k'ogbera kwẹ. Ma wọ Saul n'ọbạbhọ nnwa kwẹ Jonatan bẹ́, “Ode yạn kwa nnwa kw'Jẹsẹ nạn ẹyạr ma núninga bẹ́, ọttạra mạna uchi uchiattọhk o? Chạnachẹ núkwa, chemma nọ́bra ukwa.”<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Jonatan ubhina Saul bẹ́, “K'udik ọkka, Devid ọtạk ẹfa ophyem-m bẹ́ ntte-ẹ ọbọhk ọta k'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Oben-m bẹ́, ‘Totokhạn tte-m ọbọhk mfona, ukwuru bẹ́, efona chamạna m'ẹfọhnọ ẹja k'ofhon e. Nnwotte kwaam ọtọhmọ bẹ́, nta e. De kk'ọphyaam ntạkha k'ititikha sọ, tte nta nse ivotte paam.’ Ẹgwọ usi ẹma Devid nạn ma ode bẹ́, uchi uchiattọhk k'okpokkạro kw'ọma ọvaarnạng e.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Wa Saul ọdwạkh-ẹ mororo otena Jonatan, n'oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọma nnwa kw'ọsaasa ọbạra ọkpọkhe e cho kwanạng kw'aning ma! Ọma akkẹ bẹ́, kạ́nsong bẹ́ kk'ẹgbagba akhaama ọttạra nnwa kw'Jẹsẹ? Mkpạr ide sọ ibạra ide s'akka kw'ọmaan-ọ. <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Oche ngwọ kw'nnwa kw'Jẹsẹ m'uruk akpen ma ọyagbin, ọma oyeni ọttạra ẹvaar chọ arạnga máttima a. De asong udik, ror eden tim-ẹ kken-m, khiri ọbaan k'obo!”<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Jonatan ọbhạkhẹ ọbạbh Saul bẹ́, “Ukwuru yạn kw'n'ọbaan k'obo o? Sẹ ọjẹ bạng udik o?” <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Wa Saul ọbhạrẹ ọkhọhn pfẹ bẹ́, ọfhọ Jonatan. Ma wọ Jonatan n'osong bẹ́, otte kwẹ ọkhạmọ bẹ́ ọfhọ Devid.<verse eid="1SA 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Jonatan onnemeden ubina <char style="it">bẹ́ bik</char>, ottemkạm awẹ. Ottong iwu ifa s'ophye, Jonatan ọttọhk núchia, ukwuru s'ettem ipyibh-ẹ k'ọkpạrsia-dik kw'otte usi ọnạng Devid.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />K'ekpebhachẹ, wa Jonatan utim udikkobh wạnọ utima ofona k'ibyi s'Devid uttubh. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Oben udikkobh nwọ bẹ́, “Ttima ẹbhạr ata aror ayuk mbọ p'ntta.” Masẹ udikkobh nwọ n'ọrạbh ofona o, Jonatan ọtta uyuk oche kwa awẹ m'otto oyongu nnwa nwọ. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Masẹ udikkobh nwọ ukpir ma ibyi s'uyuk kw'Jonatan otto, Jonatan oyer-ẹ k'ẹrạng-k'ẹrạng oben bẹ́, “Awẹ otto kha ororo k'akh-ọ k'ititikha e!” <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Ma wọ Jonatan ọbạra ọkwọhrọ ẹmạng, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Dwukh-udwukha! Sọhng ẹbhạr-ẹbhạrẹ! K'eden kábe o!” Ma wọ udikkobh nwọ udwung uyuk nwọ ọkpa nnạm okkena otte kwẹ kw'ode Jonatan. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Udikkobh nwọ udik gwạnọ-gwạnọ kósong otena ma idik nnọ, oyonga Jonatan ọttạra Devid kw'uwa asong nttọhna sabẹ asi. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Wa Jonatan ọtạk ekpong-kpo pyẹ ọnạng udikkobh nwọ, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tima ekpo mbyọ kpa nnạm k'ofhon.”<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Masẹ udikkobh nwọ kk'ofona, Devid uyin k'ibyi s'uttubh, osenga k'ẹrạkh-ẹrạkha kw'ẹta njọ ch'uttubh ọta okhebha Jonatan, ọrạkha uttima ititikha k'isisek nden nttaan usima Jonatan. Abẹ abaakha ayok, abẹ agạma, okhenka, Devid ọgạm ọyọhnga Jonatan.<verse eid="1SA 20:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Jonatan oben Devid bẹ́, “Sọhng e, tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uninga abọ k'idira. Masẹ kk'eyok-chekhi nja ansia, ‘Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ode mạna nttẹnsẹ, ọttạra k'iva p'iva pọ, ọttạra k'iva p'iva paam tạrr ipimmanitor.’ ” Ma wọ Devid ubin ofona, Jonatan ọbạra ọkpa nnạm k'ofhon.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Devid ọrạbhọ okhebha Ahimẹlẹk k'ofhon kw'Nọb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Wa Devid ọrạbhọ ofona k'ofh kw'Nọb ọta okhebha Ahimẹlẹk kw'ode ọfọhnẹja. Masẹ Ahimẹlẹk ọttạm Devid abẹ, ọtạma fhạfhạnọ, ọbạbh bẹ́, “Ode yạn kw'aseng mạnkeni? Bạng udik gwọ usi ọnạng nạn abọ nọ́twạna?”<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Devid ubhina Ahimẹlẹk kw'ode ọfhọhnẹja bẹ́, “Ọvaar Saul ọtwạr-m itọhng oben-m bẹ́, ‘Tte ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ nạngẹ ọtọhm f'ntọhmọ ọttạra ntọhna s'nnạng-ọ osong o.’ Kk'akpongnạng paam mbena bẹ́, abẹ akhebh-m k'ibyi mạnna rạnẹ khạkha. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Mantọhmma, Bạng ọttọhk vọ akhaam k'ọbọhk? Nạng-m abrẹd asen, oyongu ma, fidede f'akhaam, nạng-m.”<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Okhenkha, ọfọhnẹja nwọ ubhina Devid bẹ́, “Brẹd kw'ottem uninga k'akhaam k'ọbọhk kóde. Okhenkha, wạra ode bẹ́, ajunung mbọ ipanạng abẹ náyima, amma ntim brẹd kw'awurada mạma e.”<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Devid ọpọhna ọfọhnẹja bẹ́, “K'udik ọkka, amạna ipanạng abẹ nányima, oche ngwọ gwọ n'ode okpe kwidede kw'anyini k'iyaan. Yeyema nạn ọtọhm f'awurada nánta sisi, ajunung avạkha ijunung-for sabẹ, bạra wạra chemma kw'ọkhaankẹ ode iwu ch'awurada o!” <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Ma wọ ọfọhnẹja n'ọnạng-ẹ brẹd nwọ kw'awurada, ukwuru s'ọdwạkh-ọdwạk nạ́n ode, oyonga nwọ kw'okpokkạro kw'awurada kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, abẹ atạkha kw'utim ọkhạm-ọkhạm atera ma iwu njọ jạnẹ.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Wa ọkhaam ọtọhmnạng wạnọ kw'Saul kw'uning ma iwu njọ, kw'abẹ avạk achok, ukwuru ọtọhm f'ọbaan bẹ́, usi k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ẹma nwọ wa okpen Doẹg, kw'ubin Edom, ọbạra ode ochonạng kw'anạng p'n'akkeri nten s'Saul.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Devid ọbạbhọ Ahimẹlẹk bẹ́, “Ọma ọkhọhn ọbạra ode ọkkangkkang-kkro kákhaam mama o? Amma ọkkangkkang-kkro kwaam, ọbạra ode ojoma-ttọhk vạnọ-vạnọ nạ́ntima nkwu ma e, uwuru s'ọvaarnạng ọtọhm-m ọtọhm f'idwudwukha.”<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Ọfọhnẹja nwọ ọpọhna bẹ́, “Ọkkangkkang-kkro kw'uning ma ode nwọma kw'Golayat kw'ubin Philistiya, kw'uwa afhọ k'ipekhuma s'Ẹla. Abẹ afhạrọ wẹ k'ivạra achok k'ẹphọd k'nnạm-nnạm. De abeni bẹ́ atạkha wẹ, atạkha, ọkkangkkang-kkro ọdwạkh-ọdwạk ma kóde oyonga nwọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">Devid ọbẹ́, “Ọdwạkh-ọdwạk kw'ode masẹ nwọ kóde, nạng-m wẹ.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Devid ọrạbhọ ofona k'ofhon kwGat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Ma iwu njọ, Devid ọrạbhọ k'Saul okhebha Akish kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Gat. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Okhenkha, atọhmnạng p'Akish abạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Devid kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'isek s'Israẹl sạng ma? Ẹma sạng ode nwọ kw'abẹ n'akkọhn akpaanga k'mbin aben bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 21:11">‘Saul kk'nnọhna sẹ ọfha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 21:11">Devid kk'nnọhna ibhik-asong sẹ ọfha o’?”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Wa Devid ọtạk udik ngwọ oge k'ettem, Akish kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Gat n'ojora Devid oseng eden. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Ma wọ n'usi nkkari ma abẹ ititikha bẹ́, n'utubh eten. Ma abẹ ititikha, n'usi idik masẹ utubhuten-nạng, n'ọkkẹr ekpo k'ammakhubh, ọbạra otte attabọng ọbọhk efhobh-ẹ ẹsạkha k'agba-phyạbha.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akish n'obeni atọhmnạng pẹ bẹ́, “Akkeri ujunung nwọ! Usi itubhuten e! Abạnga atim-ẹ akwu mbạng o? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Masẹ amma nworu atubhuten, ẹgwọ kw'abạnga n'atim oyok nwa akken-m bẹ́, ukwu usi idindingi chẹ k'akhaam k'ititikha o? Ọbaan ma bẹ́ ọnạng khira nwaa ukwu k'akhaam k'ọchọhm o?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Devid uning k'Adulam ọttạra k'Mizpah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Wa Devid ubin urik Gat, ọrạbh ọta uttubha k'ẹtakpamma ch'Adulam. Masẹ ivotte pẹ ọttạra ẹchọmfhạr ch'otte phyibh abhaang kwẹ, abẹ afona akhebh-ẹ kha. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Anạng mbọ phyibh p'uwa aning k'ọmmaphyaangẹ, ọttạra p'atim ayok ifhoru, ọttạra p'aning k'ottempyibh akwu abaabh-ẹ age ngekha, ẹma n'ode bẹ odennạng. Wa anạng p'akpir ẹnọhna anạng amma abẹ.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Devid ubina ma ofona k'Mizpa k'ẹkhạma ch'Moab, ọta oben ọvaarnạng kw'Moab bẹ́, “Totokhạn, tte otte kwaam ọttạra ọkka kwaam ọbọhk abẹ akwu aninga abọ, ttạr nsonga ọttọhk f'Ubinọkpaabyi m'usi onạng-m.” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Ma o, Devid ochokhu ọkka ọttạra otte ma ọvaarnạng kw'Moab. Wa abẹ aning ma ọttạra ọvaarnạng ma okpe ngwọ phyibh kw'Devid uttubh k'ibyittubhasẹ.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Okhenkha, Gad kw'ode usi-ẹyaakha kw'Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Devid bẹ́, “Dạkhẹ ma ibyittubhasẹ nnọ káttubha. Sọhng k'isek s'Juda.” Ma wọ Devid ubin ofona k'ọkpattem kw'Hẹrẹt.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saul ọfhọ afọhnẹja p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'Nob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Ma o, Saul ukwu ọbhaanga bẹ́, abẹ kk'Devid ọttạra ajunung p'aning abẹ asia. Wa Saul uning ẹyạr k'isekhisek kw'ichi ch'tamarisk, k'okpecho kw'Gibea, ọkhọn apfẹ kha ọbọhk, ọttạra atọhmnạng pẹ p'abaabh-ẹ age ngekha. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Saul oben bẹ bẹ́, “Ajunung p'Bẹnjamin o, akhọm-m itọhng-ẹ! Ma, nnwa kw'Jẹsẹ s'm'ọnạng abạngama phyibh iwonu s'agrep ọttạra s'achidwuk k'ukhira-k'ukhira o? Ma, s'm'usi abạngama phyibh adecho p'arim-ekpong p'nnọhna ibhikh-asong, ọttạra adecho p'arạbh k'asen k'asen o? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Ẹgwọ usi abạngama phyibh asi nttọhna-pyibha aten-m o? Owor ọnạng kw'ọkpaakh-m bẹ́, nnwa kwaam kk'echekha ọtạkha nnwa kw'Jẹsẹ abẹ. Ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'ọjọkh-m kòde, ọnạng kw'ọtekh-m bẹ́, nnwa kwaam kk'ọtọhmnạng kwaam ọchọma bẹ́, obe k'eden utikh-m, k'oche kw'usi chemma, kòde.”<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Osenga ma, Doẹg kw'ubin Edom, kw'uwa obe ma ọttạra atọhmnạng p'Saul, oben bẹ́, “Amma nse nnwa kw'Jẹsẹ s'ukwu okkebha Ahimẹlẹk kw'ode nnwa kw'Ahitub k'Nọb. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimẹlẹk ọdwạn Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udik otena Devid, ọnạng Devid uchiattọhk ọttạra ọkkangkkang-kkro kw'Golayat kw'ubin Philistiya.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Ma wọ, ọvaar Saul ọtọhmọ abẹ ayeri Ahimẹlẹk, kw'ode ọfọhnẹja, kw'ọbạra ode nnwa kw'Ahitub, ọttạra afọhnẹja p'ẹchọhmfhạr ch'otte phyi-phyibh k'Nọb. Wa abẹma phyibh acher eyera ch'ọvaarnạng. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Saul oben bẹ́, “Ọma nnwa kw'Ahitub, khọhmọ itọhng.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">Ubhina bẹ́, “Iyaa, aro kwaam.”<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Saul oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ukwuru yạn kw'ọma ọttạra nnwa kw'Jẹsẹ n'akhạm ipyibha atena abamẹ o? N'anạng-ẹ uchiattọhk ọttạra ọkkangkkang-kkro, abạra adwạn Ubinọkpaabyi k'akhẹ-ẹ echo, osenga ma n'uwunu-m, ọbạra utubha k'eden utikh-m oche kw'usi chemma.”<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ahimẹlẹk ubhina ọvaar Saul bẹ́, “K'atọhmnạng pọ phyibh, anẹ wọ ọsạk echo masẹ Devid, kw'ode ọnyẹ kw'ọma ọvaarnạng, kw'ọbạra ode ocho-nạng kw'anạng p'n'atikh-ọ, kw'abẹ n'anạng ikpukpobha sididen k'ẹchọhmfhạr ch'ọma ọvaarnạng o? <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Echedenwu sạng ma ch'ndwạn k'Ubinọkpaabyi k'echo ch'Devid e! Oche ngwọ núdia! Tte ọvaarnạng nạngẹ amma ọtọhmnạng kwẹ udik ọbọhm, ọbạra ọnạng kwidede k'ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ jọ, ukwuru bẹ́, ọtọhmnạng kwọ udik gwạnọ-gwạnọ kw'oten ma idik nna phyi-phyibh kósong.”<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Okhenkha, ọvaarnạng oben bẹ́, “Ahimẹlẹk o, m'ape, ọma ọttạra ẹnạmma ch'atte kwọ kubungu, itwuna kède.”<verse eid="1SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Ma wọ ọvaarnạng ọnạngẹ akpongnạng pẹ p'nakker-ẹ ẹfa bẹ́, “Abhạkhẹ nnạm afhọ afọhnẹja p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ukwuru bẹ́, abẹma kk'adạkhẹ Devid abe abẹ atuma. Abẹ asong ma bẹ n'ọrạbh-ọrạbh, okhenka, abẹ khaam nátekha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:17">Okhenkha, attọhmnạng p'ọvaarnạng wa abẹ ifor nádia bẹ́, ayaan ọbọhk afhọ afọhnẹja p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="1SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Ma wọ ọvaar Saul n'ọnạngẹ Doẹg ẹfa bẹ́, “Ọma bhạkhẹ fhọ afọhnẹja mbọ.” Ma o, Doẹg kw'ubin Edom ọbhạkhẹ ọfhọ bẹ. Ma iwu njọ, ọfhọ afọhnẹja arạbh annebung ukuma asen p'age ẹphọd. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Wa ofon adạkhẹ k'Nọb, kw'ode ofhon kw'afọhn-nja, ọfhọ ajunung ọttạra ipanạng, ọttạra ibhagbọ, ọttạra ọgbọsẹkhẹ, ọbạra ọfhọ adamagbudu, ọttạra mmaam, ọttạra arạkhạmaan k'ọkkangkkang-kkro.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Okhenkha, wa Abiyata, ujunungnwa wạnọ kw'Ahimẹlẹk kw'ode nnwa kw'Ahitub, ọrạbhọ ọnnaanga, ọta okhebha Devid. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abiyata ọkpaak Devid oche kw'Saul kk'afọhnẹja p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọfha. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Ma wọ Devid obeni Abiyata bẹ́, “Masẹ wa Doẹg kw'ubin Edom uning mạma, nsongma bẹ́ k'udik ọkka m'ọkpaak Saul ọkpaak. Obo kw'ẹnạmma ch'ab'atte kubungu ubin k'akhaam e. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Ninga abamẹ, tte nạng-ọ ojor. Ẹma nwọ kw'n'oror-ọ bẹ́ ọfhọ, n'ọgba oror-m bẹ́ ọfhọ e. Ọma m'akhaama ẹnnaanga ọkhaama de aning abamẹ.<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Devid ọkkaan ofhon kw'Keyila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Iwu jạnẹ, abẹ akpaakhẹ Devid bẹ́, “Kker e, aPhilistiya n'arima ofhon kw'Keyila abẹ e, abẹ n'achi ibyi sa abẹ n'akhaan achimạma k'ekpong.” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Ma wọ Devid ọbạbhọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Nta nnima aPhilistiya mbọ abẹ o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Sọhng ata arimma aPhilistiya abẹ, ọfhạ akkaana aKeyila.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Okhenkha, ajunung p'Devid aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Oyeyema ma Juda, annuk k'ojora, de n'anfon k'Keyila bẹ́, anta annima akpongnạng p'Philistiya abẹ, akwẹ m'upyibh ọyọhnga ma e.”<verse eid="1SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Devid ọbạra ọdwạn Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbạra ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Sọhng k'Keyila, ukwuru bẹ́, m'ntạkha aPhilistiya nge-ọ k'ọbọhk.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Ma wọ Devid ọttạra ajunung pẹ afona k'Keyila ata arima aPhilistiya abẹ́, abẹ acha itirakpo pyabẹ. Wa Devid ọfhọ aPhilistiya k'ọsaabh, ọbạra ọkkaana aKeyila.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Ma okpe ngwọ, wa Abiyata kw'ode nnwa kw'Ahimẹlẹk, kk'ẹphọd utima k'ọbọhk ọrạbh ọta okhebha Devid k'Keyila.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul ukhubhu Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Wa anạng akpaakhẹ Saul bẹ́, Devid kk'ofona k'Keyila, Saul n'obeni bẹ́, “Ubinokpabyi kk'ẹ ọtạkha oge-m k'mbọhk. Devid kk'ẹma oyeni mgbakkọhbhọ ugia s'ọnwa, k'ofhon kw'ọkhaam abaakhamma ọttạra abaakha.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Ma wọ Saul obeni akpongnạng pẹ phyibh bẹ́, abẹ ado ifor afona k'Keyila, ata abaabha Devid ọttạra anạng pẹ age ngekha.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Masẹ Devid osong bẹ́, Saul n'ọttọhnọ bẹ́, usi-ẹ ipyibha, oben Abiyata kw'ode ọfohn-ẹja bẹ́, “Tima ẹphọd nwọ kwu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Devid ose njọhm oben bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl, k'udik ọkka, amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ kk'mmaanga bẹ́, Saul n'ọttọhnọ bẹ́ ukwu k'Keyila, ukwu udimi ofhon ngwama ukwuru amma. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Ma, anạng p'Keyila m'atạkh-m anạng-ẹ yeri? Kọhngkhẹ, Saul m'ukwu ma Keyila oche kw'mmaang o? O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl, totokhạn si ẹyaakha nạng amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́, “M'ukwu ukwu.”<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Devid ọbạbh adạkhẹ bẹ́, “Ma, anạng p'Keyila m'atạkh-m ọttạra anạng paam anạng Saul yeri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “Abẹ m'asi ochengwọ.”<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Ma wọ, Devid ọttạra anạng pẹ p'akpir anạng ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh, abin arik Keyila n'asenga k'ibyi k'ibyi. Masẹ abẹ akpaakhẹ Saul bẹ́, Devid kk'ọrạbha urik Keyila, wa Saul dạkhẹ k'Keyila nọ́ta.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Wa Devid uttubh k'ibyittubhasẹ k'uminkpa, k'akpecho p'ibyi s'owór s'Ziph. Iwu chidede, Saul n'oror Devid ẹmmeje-ẹmmeje, okhenka, Ubinọkpaabyi Devid ọbohk núttia ọnạng Saul.<verse eid="1SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Masẹ Devid uning k'Horẹsh k'uminkpa k'Ziph, n'ọbhaang bẹ́ Saul kk'ukwa bẹ́, ukwu ọfhẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Ma wọ, Jonathan kw'ode nnwa kw'Saul, ofon okhebha Devid k'Horẹsh, ugi-ẹ nttem bẹ́, ọbạr ettem, ọbạra ophye nnạm k'Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tte nạng-ọ ojor. Otte kwaam Saul kọ ọbọhk mútwu e. Ẹma oyeni osong ma bẹ́, ọma wọ m'ade ọvaarnạng kw'Israẹl, amma nde ottong anạng afa kwọ.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Abẹma anạng afa atạkha echekha ma ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Jonatan oseng ọbhạna, Devid uninga ma Horẹsh.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Wa anạng p'Ziph afon akhebha Saul k'Gibea aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kker e, Devid uttubh k'ibyittubhasẹ samạna k'Horẹsh e, k'okpecho kw'Hakila, k'ukhubha kw'ẹrạkh-ẹrạkha k'Jeshimọn. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />O ọvaarnạng, sạkha kwu okpe idede kw'ọdaakh-ọ bẹ akwu, n'ode udik kwa amạnamba oyeni m'anvạkh-ẹ ange ọma ọvaarnạng k'ọbọhk.<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Saul ọpọhna bẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi odo bạnga k'ijibha ch'abạnga akhaam abamẹ <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Asọhng ata ado kwẹ adwạn. Abaana ibyi s'n'ọta, ọttạra ọnạng kw'kk-ẹ usia ma. Abẹ akpaakh-m bẹ ode ọnạng kw'odongu-odongu mororo. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Adwạn asonga ibyi phyibh s'n'uttubha, ọfha abạnga akpa nnạm akwu akpaakh-m oche kw'akwẹ ode. Ma wọ, amma m'ntwạn bạnga abẹ amfona ma. De uttubh ma ibyi nnọ, amma m'vạkh-ẹ k'ibyi sidede s'uttubh ma ikhaana s'nnạmma s'aJuda.<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Ma wọ, anạng mbọ achi Saul eden afona k'Ziph. Wa Devid ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ aning k'uminkpa k'Maọn k'Araba, k'ẹrạkh-ẹrạkha kw'Jeshimọn. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Saul ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ atạm-ẹ ruror. Masẹ Devid ọbhaang kwẹ, n'ofon ọta uninga k'ẹtakpa ch'ining k'uminkpa k'Maọn. Okpe kw'Saul ọbhaang bẹ́, Devid uttubh k'Maọn, ukhubh-ẹ ofona kha.<verse eid="1SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Saul n'osenga k'ukhubha gwạnọ kw'okpecho, Devid ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ asenga k'ukhubha ngwọkha, n'adwukha bẹ́, abẹ arạbh annaanga Saul. Masẹ Saul ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ kk'Devid ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ afora k'oche kw'abẹ m'avạkha bẹ, <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />wa ọkpaakh-ẹkkaabha okhebh Saul oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kwu ẹbhạr-ẹbhạrẹ khiri aPhilistiya n'nka achi ofon k'ekpong e!” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Ma wọ, Saul ukkum Devid khu-khubh, n'ofon bẹ́ ọta urima aPhilistiya abẹ. Ẹgwọ usi abẹ ayeri ibyi nnọ Ẹtakpa ch'Ẹrạbh-ẹnnaanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">k'eHiburu, abẹ ayeri ibyi nnọ Sela Hammahlekoth, kw'uyini Ẹtakpa ch'Ẹrạbh-ẹnnaanga.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Devid n'ubin ma uvura ọta uttubha k'Ẹn-Gẹdi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Devid otte Saul ọbọhk uruk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Masẹ Saul ọkpa nnạm k'aPhilistiya khukhubh, abẹ akpaakh-ẹ bẹ́, “Devid uttubh k'uminkpa k'Ẹn-Gẹdi.” <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Wa Saul otek ajunung nnohna nsenọfa ukuma arạbh jobh, k'Israẹl phyibh, utima bẹ ọta oror Devid ọttạra anạng pẹ, ọbaanga Ntakpa s'Mvu s'Ẹkpa.<verse eid="1SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Masẹ Saul ukpir k'avu-pa k'ọkkaden, ukwu ose ẹtakpamma, wa ọyaak ma bẹ́, ọjẹ ẹsamma. Devid ọttạra ajunung pẹ attubh ma ẹtakpamma njọ ẹtaanga. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Ajunung p'Devid aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Chemma wọ ode iwu njọ ch'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkpaakh-ọ bẹ́, ‘Amma m'ntạkha ọwawunanạng kwọ nge-ọ k'ọbọhk, ọfha ạsi-ẹ oche kw'ọdaakh-ọ.’ ” Ma wọ, Devid ubin, ọbẹk, ọnạng kẹ núsia, ọta ọkpaara ivạrama-kpa ch'ọnọhma-wuram kw'Saul.<verse eid="1SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Ayongu ma, wa ettem ẹphyaangẹ Devid ẹmma, ukwuru ivạrama-kpa ch'ọnọhma-wuram kw'Saul ch'kk'ọkpaara. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />N'obeni ajunung pẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi móchera bẹ́, nsi udik dema ngwa nnạng aro kwaam, kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ana obyenga k'echo, brasẹ n'ukpir s'm'ntwu-ẹ ọbọhk, ukwuru bẹ́, ẹma ode nwọ kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ana obyenga k'echo.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Wa Devid utim itọhnga nnọ ọkpa ajunung pẹ eden, nọ́bra ochera bẹ́, abẹ arima Saul abẹ. Saul o, n'ubin ma ẹtakpamma ofona kwẹ akwẹ.<verse eid="1SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Ma wọ, Devid uyini k'ẹtakpamma oyeri Saul bẹ́, “Aro ọvaar kwaam o!” Masẹ Saul ọbhạkhẹ nnạm, Devid ọrạkha utwunga echo k'isek k'ikpukpobha. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Obeni Saul bẹ́, “Ode yạn kw'n'ạkhọhmọ itọhng okpe kw'anạng n'aben bẹ́, ‘Devid n'ọkhạmọ bẹ́, usi-ọ ipyibha e?’ <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Chemma, ọma oyeni kk'achen pọ atima ase oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utti-ọ ọbọhk ọnạng-m k'ẹtakpamma. Anạng bạnọ achọhm-m bẹ́, mfhọ-ọ, okhenka, kk'ọbọhk nttia, nkwu mben bẹ́, ‘Amma aro kwaam ọbọhk mạ́ntwu, ukwuru bẹ́, ẹma ode nwọ kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ana obyenga k'echo.’ <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Kker e, aro kwaam, kkeri ivạrama-kpa ch'ọnọhma-wuram kwọ k'akhaam k'ọbọhk. Mkpaar chẹ k'ammakpa p'ọnọhma-wuram kwọ, okhenka, kọ nạ́mfha. Tte akwẹ ọttaan-ọ, abạra atin bẹ́, amma ipina, ọbạra ode ochokpọhkhọ kạ́nkhaam abọ. Ama khọ nạ́mpina, okhenka, ọma n'aror-m bẹ́, atạkha akpen paam. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi aponga paam ọma abẹ. Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utwuk mpyibha s'khaam asia. Okhenkha, amma kọ ọbọhk kwaam mạ́ntwu. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />K'oche kw'ẹtạma ebeni, anạng p'n'asi ibyibyia-dik bọ n'asi ibyibyia, ma o, amma kọ ọbọhk mạ́ntwu.<verse eid="1SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />“Ọvaarnạng kw'Israẹl oseng anẹ abẹ uyin k'iyaan o? N'akhubh anẹ o? Ẹpfa-bukhu jọ sa? Ma, ẹtạtaana jọ yeri? <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ode ọkpaar-aponga kwamạna, tte ọbạra ọnạng ẹyaakha ch'amma ọma abẹ. Tte ẹma usi iponga saam, tte ẹma ọbạra ọkkaana ọrạbh-m k'mbọhk sọ.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Masẹ Devid okker idik nnọ, Saul ọbạbh bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, Devid, ọma wọ n'akpaak mạma o?” Osenga ma, Saul ọgạma ẹmạng k'ẹrạng-k'ẹrạng. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Ọbạra oben Devid bẹ́, “Ọma wọ atoru ọtạm ayọhnga amma e. Kk'aam ijibha asia, okhenka, amma kk'ọ igbaan nsia. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Ijibha ch'kk'asia anạng-m, ẹjọ ch'atekh-m ma. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtạkh-m ugi-ọ k'mbọhk, okhenka, kaam náfha. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Bạng ọnạng wọ m'ose ọwawunanạng kwẹ, utti-ẹ ọbọhk ofona k'idira o? Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtaam-ọ mororo k'ijibha ch'asi anạng-m chemma. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Amma nsong ma k'udik ọkka bẹ́, kwạna m'ade ọvaarnọng ode, ọttạra bẹ́ kwạna ẹkhạma ch'Israẹl m'ittima arạnga uttima k'okpe kw'ẹvaar chọ. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Chekhi k'eche ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nạng-m bẹ́, ọma iva p'iva paam mádimi, eche ch'ẹchọhmfhạr ch'otte kwaam mábạra apfura.”<verse eid="1SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Ma wọ, Devid ochekhi ọnạng Saul. Ma o, Saul ọbhạna, okhenka, Devid ọttạra ajunung pẹ akpa nnạm k'ibyittubhasẹ sabẹ.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Obo kw'Samwẹl.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Samwẹl o ope, anạng p'Israẹl phyibh atobha, abẹ agạm-ẹ. Abẹ ata annọhng-ẹ k'Rama kw'ode ofhon kwẹ.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1SA 25:1">Devid ọttạra Abigẹl</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Ma wọ, Devid ubin ofona k'ibyi s'owor k'Paran. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Wa ọkhaam ujunung wạnọ k'Maọn, kw'ọkhaam ẹkhaama k'Kaamẹl, kw'ujibh-ẹ mororo. Ẹma wa ọkhaam arạkhạmaan nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh jobh, ọbạra ọkhaama avukpokha nnọhna nsenọfa ukuma arạbh jobh, p'uwa n'uphyiri aphyạbha k'Kaamẹl. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Ujunung nwọ okpen Nabal, ikwa okpena Abigẹl. Wa ikwanạng nwọ ọkhaam ẹsonga ọttạra ujibh iminava, okhenka, udim kwẹ kw'ode ọKalẹb-nạng, ọkhaam ẹmmaana ch'ẹkkamkpạra, ọbạra usi ẹrạma.<verse eid="1SA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Masẹ Devid uning k'ibyi s'owor ọbhaanga bẹ́, Nabal nạngkha uphyiri arạkhạmaan pẹ aphyạbha, <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Devid ukwu ọtọhm adikkobh jọbh oben bẹ bẹ́, “Asọhng k'Kaamẹl ata asima Nabal anạng-m. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Aben-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Ruk akpen p'adumudum! Tte ifor ikpọhkhọ-ọ ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr chọ-ọ! Tte ifor ikpọhkhọ fidede f'ode fọ.<verse eid="1SA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />“ ‘Mmaang bẹ́, okpe gwọ ma, kw'arạkhạmaan-phyạbha phyiphyiri. Masẹ wa akkeri-arạkhạmaan pọ aning mạna abẹ, wa bẹ igbaan nánsia. K'okpe ngwọ phyibh kw'abẹ aning k'Kaamẹl, ọttọhk vạnọ-vạnọ fabẹ f'udimi kóde. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Bạbh atọhmnạng pọ oyeni, abẹ m'akpaakh-ọ ọkpaak. Ma o, si ọphyaam nạng adikkobh paam s'ode bẹ ankwu k'erobhawu. Totokhạn nạng atọhmnạng pọ ọttạra amma nnwa kwọ Devid, fidede f'm'akkokke anạng bẹ.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Okpe kw'anạng p'Devid akpir o, abẹ atạkha ẹkkaabha ch'Devid akpaak Nabal. Abẹ aninga atik.<verse eid="1SA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Nabal ọpọhna ajunung p'Devid bẹ́, “Devid oyeni, ode anẹ o? Nnwa kw'Jẹsẹ oyeni, ode bạng ọnạng yeri? Ibikhi nna, atọhmnạng sabhaada n'abhaangẹ k'abaro p'abẹ k'mbọhk. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Ukwuru yạn kw'm'ntạkha brẹd kwaam ọttạra asi paam, ọttạra eten ch'mfhọ bẹ nnạng anạng p'n'aphyiri arạkhạmaan-phyạbha, nnạng anạng p'nạn ibyi nsong sabẹ atto akwu?”<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Anạng p'Devid akpa nnạm abhạna. Masẹ abẹ akpir, abẹ atạkha itọhnga nnọ phyibh akpaak Devid. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Devid n'obeni anạng pẹ bẹ́, “Adạbh akkangkkang-kro pabạnga!” Ma wọ, abẹ adạbhẹ akkangkkang-kro pabẹ, ẹma Devid ọbạra ọdạbh kwẹ. Wa anạng ẹnọhna bọ atwạnọ Devid abẹ, okhenka, ọtạk anạng nạbh jobh ochok bẹ́ abẹ aninga ạkkeri ekpongkpo.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Ọtọhmnạng wạnọ kw'Nabal ọkpaakhẹ Abigẹl kw'ode ikwanạng kw'Nabal bẹ́, “Devid ọtọhmọ akpaakh-nkkaabha p'abin k'ibyi s'owor bẹ́, abẹ akwu asima aro kwamạna e, okhenka, ẹma otera ọnạng bẹ ẹsẹkha. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />K'udik ọkka, wa anạng mbọ ajibhi mạna abẹ idik, abẹ mạna igbaan násia k'okpe ngwọ phyibh kw'anchi bẹ abẹ nnem, ọttọhk vạnọ-vạnọ famạna núdima. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Abẹ akkeri mạna k'ẹya ọttạra k'irungu k'okpe kw'n'ankkeri arạkhạmaan pamạna ambaanga bẹ. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />M'akkẹ ẹkka atena ma, ase oche kw'm'asi, ukwuru bẹ́, ibrukka n'abạra itto ikhebha aro kwamạna ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ phyibh e. Ẹma ọkpạr akkam osengeden, ntọhna s'ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ k'nọ́tạkha.”<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigẹl okpe núkhibha, ọtạkha abrẹd arạbh jobh, ọttạra atwuk-gbạre afa, ọttạra arạkhạmaan asen p'kk'ọbhaabha, ọttạra agbangbang-dim asen p'agwu-abhaabhapẹ, ọttạra akwa arạbh asen p'agrep p'agw-ugwu, ọttạra akwa arạbh jobh p'afig p'agwu-ugwu, ọtạkha pyẹ phyi-phyibh ọnạna k'ẹnyạnyaang. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Ma wọ n'obeni atọhmnạng pẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga achi-m eden afona, amma m'ntoru bạnga nnạm.” Okhenkha, wa udim kwẹ Nabal nótekha.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Masẹ n'ọyaar ẹnyạnyaang chẹ ọsạkha okpechọ, n'ose s'Devid ọttạra ajunung pẹ n'asạkha afor-ẹ, abẹ akwu attạma ayok abẹ. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Devid kk'obena bạra bẹ́, “K'udik ọkka, akwẹ ode ẹbọhk-dima ọnạng-m bẹ́, nkkeri ẹkhaama ch'ayi nwa k'uminkpa, ọfha ọttọhk pfẹ vạnọ-vạnọ nạngẹ udimi. Mantọhmma n'utim ipyibha utwukha ijibha chaam. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Tte Ubinọkpaabyi usi awawuna p'Devid ukhira kw'ọdaakh-ẹ, de ntte ujunung kwẹ wạnọ ọbọhk uruk akpen uphyini k'ekpebha.”<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Masẹ Abigẹl ose Devid, ọsạkha k'ẹnyạnyaang chẹ k'idwudwukha, ọrạkha uttima ititikha k'isek ma ititikha s'Devid. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Utti-ẹ ma ntwạkhọ oben bẹ́, “Aro kwaam o, tte iponga ipyibh amma mạnkken e. Totokhạn, tte amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ mkpaak-ọ udik, khọhmọ itọhng abhaanga udik kw'amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ n'mben bẹ́, mkpaakh-ọ. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Tte aro kwaam nạngẹ ọmmaana-pyibh kw'ujunung nwọ kw'abẹ ayeri Nabal ọsaan e. Usi idindingi otor k'eche chẹ, eche chẹ iyini idindingi, mạnna wọ idindingi n'etor-ẹ nnạm. Okhenkha, amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ, ajunung p'aro kwaam ọtọhmọ nánsia a.<verse eid="1SA 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />“Masẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọma aro kwaam eden ọkpa bẹ́, nạngẹ isẹ abyeng, ọttạra bẹ́, ọfha ọma nạngẹ udik kakhọ-ọ oyeni k'ifor nátera, oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi urukhu akpen, ọma abạra aruk akpen, tte awawuna-nạng pọ ọttạra anạng phyibh p'akhạm ipyibha atena ọma aro kwaam ade masẹ Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Ma wọ, tte aro kwaam ochera bẹ́, ọtạkha ẹnạnga nja ch'amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ kk'ntima nkwu ọnạng ajunung p'atwạnọ abẹ. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Totokhạn, bina nạng ipina ch'ọtọhmnạng kwọ, khiri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'usi ẹchọhmfhạr ch'aro kwaam ebe <char style="it">bẹ́, gwuk,</char> ukwuru s'n'urima mkpong s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Tte ọnạng nạngẹ ipina jạnẹ-jạnẹ ose kakhọ s'm'aruk akpen pọ. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Ọbạra ode bẹ́, ọnạng n'ukhubhọ bẹ́, ọfhọ-ọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwọ, wọ m'okkeri akpen p'aro kwaam, oche kw'ọnạng n'okkeri ọdạdaakha-ttọhk pfẹ. M'okhenka udimi akpen p'awawuna-nạng pọ masẹ ẹta ch'ọbhạr-ẹta. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Okpe kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'udik jibhada kw'ochekhi ọnạng aro kwaam usia phyibh ọnạng-ẹ, ọbạra usi-ẹ ọvaarnạng kw'Israẹl, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />ọfha nạngẹ ọma oyeni apyim atena k'ẹnạngfa, ọfha nạngẹ ọma oyeni abạra apyima bẹ́, aseng mfok atera udik. Okpe kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi odo aro kwaam ọttạra-ẹ ujibhada, jima amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ o.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Devid oben Abigẹl bẹ́, “Ẹtọhnga ede ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl, kw'kk'ọ ọtọhma okken-m chemma. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udi-ọ ukwuru ẹkka-jibhada nja chọ, ọttạra s'utim-ọ bạra akkaan-m k'ifhafha nna chemma, ọttạra s'nạn mbọhk saam oyeni nạ́ntima ntera udik. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Wạra nạn oche ngwọ núdia, k'udik-ọkka, oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl urukhu akpen, kw'ọbạra ọkpaam bẹ́, nạng-ọ ipyibha nsi, de wạra ode bẹ́, ẹbhạr-ẹbhạrẹ nákwua bẹ́, anse ayok, ujunung wạnọ-wạnọ kw'ode kw'Nabal kw'm'uruk akpen brasẹ iwu echobha kòde.”<verse eid="1SA 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Ma wọ Devid n'ọtạk ekpo p'Abigẹl utim okken-ẹ, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Sọhng abhạna k'idira. Amma kk'itọhnga sọ mmaanga, m'nsi oche kw'abeni.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Masẹ Abigẹl ọbhạn, ọta okhebha Nabal k'ọchọhm sa n'usi erobha masẹ ọvaarnạng, Nabal kk'ugwa ubuma s'ettem erebh-ẹ. Ma wọ Abigẹl kẹ udik nótekha ttạr iwu echobha. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />K'ekpebhachẹ, okpe kw'atwuk kk'Nabal attaana, ikwanạng kwẹ otekh-ẹ idik nnọ phyibh, ifor ipẹ-ẹ, ukhubhachi ọvạkh-ẹ, n'ọbhạkhẹ ọkpọhkhọ masẹ ẹta <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Ọttọhk masẹ iwu jobh iseng, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uvun Nabal, Nabal ope.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Masẹ Devid ọbhaang bẹ́, Nabal kk'upua, oben bẹ́, “Ẹtọhnga ede ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'kk'Nabal abẹ urima ọnạng-m ukwuru s'n'unnukh-m. Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọtọhmnạng kwẹ eden ọkpa bẹ́, nạngẹ ipyibha usi, ọbạra usi ipyibha ch'Nabal ẹkpa nnạm etor ẹma oyeni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Ma wọ Devid ọtọhmọ ẹkaabha bẹ́, abẹ ata ayeri Abigẹl eyok anạng-ẹ k'ọbada.<verse eid="1SA 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Atọhmnạng pẹ afona k'Kaamẹl ata aben Abigẹl bẹ́, “Devid kk'mạna ọtọhma bẹ́, ankwu antạkh-ọ ade ikwanạng kwẹ e.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Abigẹl utwunga uttima ititikha k'isek oben bẹ́, “Kkeri amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ ma e, amma kk'ifor ndia bẹ́, nsi ọtọhm nnạng-ọ, ọfha n'mbạra mkpobhu mfhok s'atọhmnạng p'aro kwaam e.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigẹl udwukh-udwukha uvura k'ẹnyạnyaang, utima aminava ncho nsen p'ade atọhmnạng pẹ, ọtwạn atọhmnạng p'Devid abẹ, ọta ọba Devid. <verse eid="1SA 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Wa Devid kk'Ahinoam kw'ubin Jẹzrẹl ọtakha bạra k'ọbada, abẹma anạng afa n'ade ipanạng pẹ. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Okhenkha, wa Saul kk'ọkwanạng-nwa kwẹ kw'ode Mikal, kw'ode ikwanạng kw'Devid, ọtạkha ọnạng Palti kw'ode ujunung-nwa kw'Laish, kw'uwa ubin Galim k'ọbada.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Devid ọbạra oyobh akpen p'Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Anạng p'Ziph ata akhebha Saul k'Gibea aben bẹ́, “Devid uttubh k'okpecho kw'Hakila kw'okkeri Jẹshimọn ititikha e.”<verse eid="1SA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Ma wọ, Saul ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ nnọhna arạbh asenọfa ukuma arạbh jobh p'otek k'Israẹl, abin asạkha k'ibyi s'anạng nạnárukha k'Ziph bẹ́, abẹ ata aror Devid. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Saul usi ibyibhingasẹ k'eden ọkhaan-ọkhaan kw'okpecho kw'Hakila, kw'okkeri Jẹshimọn ititikha, okhenka, wa Devid uning k'ibyi s'anạng nạnárukha. Masẹ n'ose bẹ́, Saul kk'ẹ nnạm otora ukpira ma, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />Devid n'ọtọhmọ abaan-ibyi bẹ́, abẹ ata aror asonga k'udik ọkka de Saul kk'ukpira ma ibyi nnọ.<verse eid="1SA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Wa Devid ubin ofona k'ibyibhingasẹ s'Saul, ose s'Saul ọttạra Abnẹr kw'ode nnwa kw'Nẹr, kw'ọbạra ode odecho kw'akpongnạng n'attaabha. Wa Saul uyim k'ottemkwẹ kw'akkemkpa pẹ, p'kk'abạra attaabha.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Devid n'ọbạbhọ Ahimẹlẹk kw'ubin Het, ọttạra Abishayi kw'ode nnwa kw'Zẹruya, kw'ọbạra ode nnwọkka kw'Joab bẹ́, “Anẹ m'antwạn anta k'ibyibhingasẹ s'Saul?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Abishayi oben bẹ́, “Amma m'ntwạn abọ.”<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Ma wọ Devid ọttạra Abishayi abin ma irungu afona k'ibyi s'akpongnạng p'Saul aning, akwu ase s'Saul n'ọttaabha k'ibyibhingasẹ, ọttạra ọkhọhn f'abẹ afho abaangẹ ka echo. Abnẹr ọttạra akpongnạng ayim abaabh-ẹ age ngekha.<verse eid="1SA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abishayi obeni Devid bẹ́, “Chemma, Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọwawuna-nạng kwọ ọtạkha oge k'mbọhk sọ. Wạra m'atte-m ọbọhk ntima ọkhọhn pfaam nkhum-ẹ eden jạnẹ mmaana ma isisek, khẹ nden mfa mạ́nkhum.”<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Okhenkha, Devid obeni Abishayi bẹ́, “Kẹ khádimi o! Anẹ m'okke ọnạng kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ana obyenga k'echo ọbọhk utwu, iponga ikkum-ẹ pyi-pyibh o?” <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Devid oben bẹ́, K'udik-ọkka, k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi urukhu akpen, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oyeni wọ m'uvun-ẹ ọfhọ, oyongu ma m'ope k'okpe kwẹ, oyongu adạkhẹ ma, m'ope k'ekpong. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nạngẹ ocher bẹ́, ntwu ọnạng kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ana obyenga k'echo ọbọhk. Ọma sạbhọ ọkhọhn, abạra adira ekkora ch'eber ẹbaang-ẹ ma echo, akwu amfona.”<verse eid="1SA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Ma wọ Devid ọsạbhọ ọkhọhn, ọbạra udira ekkora ch'eber ẹbaanga Saul ma echo abẹ afona. Ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'ose bẹ, kw'ọbạra osonga udik ngwọ, brasẹ n'ọphyạbh ọda, kòde. Wa abẹma phyibh n'attaabha ọda, ukwuru s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọjẹ bẹ ọda, abẹ attaabha amạm.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Ma wọ Devid ojek k'ukhubha ọta obe k'okpecho k'ẹrạng k'oden-mir, abẹ abe ayok abẹ eden-ibhir. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Devid oyeri akpongnạng p'Saul ọttạra Abnẹr kw'ode nnwa kw'Nẹr, ọbẹ́, “Abnẹr o, abạnga khaam ẹmạng máchera o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Abnẹr ubhina bẹ́, “Ọma anẹ wọ n'ayeri ọvaarnạng o?”<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Devid ọpọhna bẹ́, “Ọma ade ujunung, oche ngwọ sạng? Anẹ wọ ode masẹ akhọ k'Israẹl? Ode yạn kw'nạn aro kwọ, kw'ode ọvaarnạng nákke akker o? Ọnạng kk'ukwa bẹ́, udimi aro kwọ kw'ode ọvaarnạng e. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Udik kw'asi ma nújibha. k'Oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi urukhu akpen, ọma ọttạra ajunung pọ abaan k'obo, ukwuru bẹ́, abạnga aro kwabạnga kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ana obyenga k'echo nákkera. Abạnga akkeri abaabh-ọbaabha. Ọkhọhn ọttạra ekkora ch'ọvaarnạng p'wára ining ẹbaanga echo ch'ọvaarnạng kẹmbyạn o?” <verse eid="1SA 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Wa Saul utini ẹmạng ch'Devid, ukwu oben bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, ẹmạng chọ jọ mạma o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Devid ọpọhna bẹ́, “Uwe e, aro kwaam kw'ode ọvaarnạng, ẹmạng chaam jọ e. <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Ukwuru yạn kw'aro kwaam n'ukhubh amma ọtọhmnạng kwẹ o? Nsi mbạng o? Bạng udik gwọ njẹ o? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Ma o, tte aro kwaam kw'ode ọvaarnạng okhọhmọ itọhng k'ọkpaakha-dik kw'ọtọhmnạng kwẹ. De akwẹ ubin k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, awun-m, tte ẹma ochera ọtạkha ẹnạnga chaam. De ode bẹ́, akwẹ ubin k'ayokhanạng, tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọraakhẹ bẹ ẹmma! Abẹ kk'aam akhubha bẹ́, nạngẹ okhebh pfaam k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ntạk. Abẹ atera aben-m bẹ́, ‘Sọhng ata akpobha akha.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Ma o, abạnga káchera isẹ saam ichebhi k'isek s'anạng p'nạn Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi asong. Ọvaarnạng kw'Israẹl kk'ukwua bẹ́, ukwu oror ẹtạtaana masẹ ọnạng uyini ẹgbaji ch'inọhn k'okpecho.”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Ma wọ Saul ọpọhn bẹ́, “Amma kk'ipyibha nsia. Nwa kwaam Devid o, kpa nnạm. Ukwuru s'akpen paam abạr-ọ udik chemma, amma dạk kọ igbaan mạ́nsi i. K'udik ọkka, amma kk'idindingi ọttạra ipina chididen nsia e.”<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Devid ubhina bẹ́, “Kkeri ọkhọhn f'ọvaarnạng ma e. Tte okpongnạng kwọ wạnọ ojekha ukwu ọtakha. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'ọtaam ọnạng kwidede kw'akpen pẹ ator-otor, ọttạra kw'ophye nnạm k'akhẹ. Chemma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọ ọtakha oge-m k'mbọhk, okhenka, amma ọnạng kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ana obyenga k'echo ọbọhk mạ́ntwu. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />K'udik ọkka, masẹ akpen pọ abạr-m udik chemma, tte akpen paam ẹgba ebạr Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udik, tte ọbạra ọrạbh-m k'ọmmaphyaangẹ kwidede.”<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Ma wọ Saul obeni Devid bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, Devid, tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udi-ọ; ọma m'asi idik s'm'ibạr udik, ọttạra bẹ́, k'udik ọkka, m'abạra akhaama ekhema.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Ma o, Devid oseng ofona, Saul ọbạra ọkpa nnạm ọbhạna k'akhẹ k'ofhon.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Devid urukhu ọttạra aPhilistiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Ma wọ Devid ọkkẹ kha ettem chẹ, oben bẹ́, “Iwu jạnẹ Saul m'ọfhọ-m ọfhọ. Udik ubungukwẹ kw'm'nsi ode bẹ́, m'nnạbh mfona k'ẹkhạma ch'aPhilistiya. Ma wọ Saul m'ukum-m ruror k'ibyi sidede k'Israẹl, ma wọ m'mbạra nnaang-ẹ.”<verse eid="1SA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Ma-o, Devid ubina ọttạra anạng pẹ ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh, ofona k'ọvaar Akish kw'Gat, kw'ode nnwa kw'Maok. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Devid ọttạra ajunung pẹ, arukhu Akish abẹ k'Gat. Ujunung kwidede urukhu ma ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ. Ẹma Devid wa urukhu ma ọttạra ipanạng pẹ afa p'ade Ahinoam kw'ubin Jẹzrẹl, ọttạra Abigẹl kw'ubin Kaamẹl, kw'ode opokwa kw'Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Masẹ Saul ọbhaang bẹ́, Devid kk'ọrạbha ofona Gat, ukum-ẹ ruror.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Ma wọ Devid obeni Akish bẹ́, “De kk'ọphyaam nkhaama k'akhọ k'ititikha, tte abẹ anạng-m ibyi ma ofhon ngwa ọfha nnuk. Ukwuru yạn kw'amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ n'abạra nnuk k'ivaarbyi ọma abẹ o?”<verse eid="1SA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Ma o, ma iwu njọ, Akish n'ọnạngẹ Devid Ziklag, asẹ n'ide isek s'avaar p'Juda, tạma ma kpira ma. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Wa Devid urukhu cho gwạnọ ọmaana aphye annebung k'ẹkhạma ch'aPhilistiya.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Wa Devid ọttạra anạng pẹ ata arima aGeshur, ọttạra aGirz, ọttạra abAmalẹk abẹ. Anạng mbọ kk'atạma k'ẹtạma aruk ma isisek nnọ s'itạm k'Shur inyaamẹ ikpira k'Ijip. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Okpe kwidede kw'Devid ọta ekpong k'ibyi, ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ ọbọhk k'n'otte uruk akpen, ode ujunung ọbạra ode ikwanạng. M'okhenka ọtạkha arạkhạmaan, ọttạra adamagbudu, ọttạra nnyạnyaang, ọttạra akamẹl, ọttạra ọvạra, utima ukwuna okhebha Akish.<verse eid="1SA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Okpe kw'Akish ọbạbhọ bẹ́, “Bạng anạng bọ p'abạnga arim bẹ abẹ chemma?” Devid m'oben bẹ́, “Annim Nẹgẹv kw'Juda, ọttạra Nẹgẹv kw'Jẹramẹl, ọttạra Nẹgẹv kw'aKen abẹ.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Devid ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ ọbọhk núttia ọkpa nnạm k'Gat k'akpen, ode ujunung ọbạra ode ikwanạng, ukwuru s'ọkkẹ bẹ́, “Abẹ m'akke-okke ayaakhẹ idik samạna aben bẹ́, ‘Kkeri oche kw'Devid usi e.’ ” Usisi kw'Devid wọ ma, masẹ urukhu k'ẹkhạma ch'aPhilistiya. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Wa Akish ọkhaam echera k'Devid, ukwu ọkkẹ bẹ́, “Devid kk'anạng pẹ Israẹl idik ọgbẹra. Ma wọ, n'abạra ode ọtọhmnạng kwaam tạrr ipimmanitor.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Saul ọttạra ọbọhnganạng kw'Ẹndọr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Ma okpe ngwọ, aPhilistiya atobh akpongnạng pabẹ bẹ́, abẹ arima anạng p'Israẹl abẹ. Akish obeni Devid bẹ́, “Songa bẹ́, ọma ọttạra anạng pọ m'ator-m ekpong o.”<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Devid oben bẹ́, “Tte akwẹ ode oche ngwọ, napra wọ m'ase ọttọhk f'amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ m'nkke nsi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Akish ubhina bẹ́, “Ọbaan ma, amma bạra nsi-ọ ade okker-akpen-paam tạrr ipimmanitor.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Ma o, Samwẹl ukwu ope, abẹ annọhng-ẹ k'Rama kw'ode ofhon kwẹ, anạng p'Israẹl phyibh atima nkwuna sẹ. Wa Saul kk'abọhnganạng ọttạra anạng p'n'aye okkewạra ukhubha k'Israẹl.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />APhilistiya atobh, abẹ asi ibyibhingasẹ k'Shunẹm. Okhenkha, Saul ọbạra otobha anạng p'Israẹl phyibh, abẹ asi ibyibhingasẹ k'Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Okpe kw'Saul ose akpongnạng p'aPhilistiya, ojor-ẹ, opoma ọnwẹ-ẹ k'ettem. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Saul n'ọdwạnọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, okhenka, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi khẹ ẹpọhna nọ́nạnga, tạma k'idachen kpira k'ọsẹ bhạbhạrẹ, tạrr oseng k'asi-ẹyaakha. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Ma wọ Saul n'obẹni anạng p'n'asi ọtọhm k'isekhisek kwẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga aror-m ikwanạng kw'n'oye okkewạra, ọfha nta ndwạn-ẹ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Abẹ aben bẹ́, “Ikwanạng-khira nwọ uning k'Ẹndọr.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Ma wọ, Saul ofhon ẹnya chẹ, ọtạkha ẹdwạkh-ọdwạk oge ọfha abẹ nạngẹ atini. Ma irungu njọ, ẹma ọttạra ajunung afa atwạn afona k'okkewạra-kwanạng nwọ. Oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Dwạn upfhura-nạng nạng-m, abạra asi nwọ kw'nyeri eche uyin.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Okhenkha, ikwanạng nwọ ubhin-ẹ bẹ, “Ọma kk'asonga k'udik ọkka bẹ́, Saul kk'anạng p'n'aye okkewạra, ọttạra abọhnganạng p'ofhon ngwa ukhubha phyibh. Ukwuru yạn kw'abạnga n'aro ọmma achokh-m bẹ́, mpe o?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Ma wọ Saul ochekhi ọnạng-ẹ k'eche ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “K'udik ọkka, s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi urukhu akpen, ọnạng kw'm'usi-ọ ọttọhk ukwuru udik ngwa kòde.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Ma wọ ikwanạng nwọ n'ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Anẹ wọ kw'aroru bẹ́, nsi uyin o?” Ubhin-ẹ bẹ, “Si Samwẹl uyin.”<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Masẹ ikwanạng nwọ ose Samwẹl o, ọwạmọ k'ẹrạng oben Saul bẹ́, “Ukwuru yạn kw'abọhr-m o? Ọma ade Saul!”<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Ọvaarnạng oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tte nạng-ọ ojor. Ase mbạng?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">Ikwanạng nwọ ubhin Saul bẹ́, “Nse upfhura-nạng kw'uyini k'epekwur.”<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ, “Okher bạng ọttọhk?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Ikwanạng nwọ ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Okher ujunung kw'kk'ọtạma, kw'oge ọnọhma-wuram.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Ma wọ Saul n'osong bẹ́, Samwẹl wọ, osenga ma, ọrạkha uttima ititikha k'isisek.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samwẹl oben Saul bẹ́, “Ukwuru yạn kw'n'aphyaang-m ẹmma, abạra asi-m mphyạbha k'epekwur o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Saul ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Masẹ ase-m ma, nning k'ọyạyạkhẹ nwa kw'kk'ọbạra. APhilistiya n'arima abamẹ, ọttạra bẹ́, Ubinọkpaabyi kk'nnạm ọkpa ọvạr-m e. Dạk kaam ẹpọhna k'nọ́nạng k'adachen ọttạra k'asi-ẹyaakha. Ẹgwọ usi bạra nyer-ọ bẹ, atẹkh-m oche kw'm'nsi.”<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samwẹl oben bẹ́, “Ukwuru yạn kw'akwu adwạn-m o, Masẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'nnạm ọkpa ọvạr-ọ, ọbạra ode ọwawunanạng kwọ, ẹgwọ kw'n'akwu amma bạbạbh o? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'usia k'oche kw'uwa utim-m usi eyaakha bẹ́, m'usi. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ẹvaar ọtạkha k'akhọ-ọ k'mbọhk, ọnạng oyok ọbaanga kwọ, kw'ode Devid. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Ukwuru s'nạn asia oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhnọ bẹ́, asi, bẹ́, adimi anạng p'Amalẹk ọttạra itirakpo pyabẹ phyibh, akwẹma gwọ usi Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi-ọ oche ngwa chemma. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'ọtạkha ọma ọttạra anạng p'Israẹl oge k'mbọhk s'aPhilistiya. Ma wọ, k'iwu ch'uphyini, ọma ọttạra iva pọ m'aninga abamẹ k'ipfhura-fhon. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'ọbạra ọtạkha akpongnạng p'Israẹl oge k'mbọhk s'aPhilistiya.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Ma ibua-ibua, Saul otto osema ma isisek, ojora awẹ, ukwuru itọhnga s'Samwẹl ọkpaakhẹ. Ẹfa ẹsa-ẹ ukwuru bẹ́, ọttọhk nùchia tạma k'ekpebha kpira k'irungu.<verse eid="1SA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Okpe kw'ikwanạng nwọ n'ose bẹ́, Saul khẹ ojora, n'obeni bẹ́, “Kker e, ikwanạng kw'usi ọtọhm k'isekhisek kwọ kk'ọ okpobha e. Ncher obo nsi oche kw'aben-m bẹ́, nsi. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Totokhạn m'akhọmọ ọtọhmnạng kwọ itọhng, tte nnạng-ọ uchiattọhk achi, ọfha akhaama ẹfa aror eden chọ.”<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Saul ufhum, ọbẹ, “Ọttọhk mạ́nchi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:23">Okhenkha, atọhmnạng pẹ age ẹmma achin-ẹ, ukwu ochera. Ubina k'isisek uninga ẹyạr k'ibhikha.<verse eid="1SA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Ikwanạng nwọ ọtạkha ọbhaam-nwa-dim kw'ujibhi ifor kw'ọkpạn k'ochọhm, onnemeden ọfhọ. Ọtạkha abubuma p'wit usi brẹd kw'abẹ nạn ọttọhk f'm'usi awẹ ubir-ubir nágia. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Ma wọ, udir obera Saul ọttạra atọhmnạng pẹ, abẹ achi. Ma irunguwu njọ, abẹ abina abhạna.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s1">APhilistiya afhumu Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Wa aPhilistiya atobh akpongnạng pabẹ k'Aphẹk, anạng p'Israẹl abạra abhing k'efhobh ch'Jẹzrẹl. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Masẹ adecho p'aPhilistiya n'asenga k'ikhaana sabẹ arạbh k'asen k'asen, ọttạra k'nnọhna k'nnọhna, Devid ọttạra ajunung pẹ n'asenga k'nnạm-nnạm kw'Akish. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Adecho p'aPhilistiya abạbhọ bẹ́, “AHiburu mba n'asi mbạng ma o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Akish ubhina bẹ́, “Devid kw'ode odecho wạnọ kw'Saul kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Israẹl wọ ma e. Kk'abamẹ uninga oyongu cho gwạnọ, s'obobe uninga abamẹ tạrr ukpira mantọhmma, ipina tạm nọ́khaama.”<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Okhenkha, adecho p'akpongnạng p'aPhilistiya ọdwạkhọ bẹ otena Akish abẹ, abẹ aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ben ujunung nwọ ọkpa nnạm k'ofhon kw'kk'ẹ anạnga. Nọ́baana bẹ́, ọtwạn mạna abẹ ọta ekpong, deja m'ọbhạkhẹ urima mạna abẹ k'akpong-chen. M'osenga yạn usi ettem erebh aro kwẹ, de nạn achokpa p'ajunung pamạna nútima o? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Devid nwọ sạng ma kw'abẹ akkọhnọ k'ẹmạng aben bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 29:5">“ ‘Saul kk'nnọhna sẹ ọfha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 29:5">Devid kk'anạng nnọhna ibhikha-song sẹ ọfha.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Ma wọ Akish oyeri Devid oben-ẹ bẹ́, “S'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi urukhu akpen, kk'nsia bẹ́, ade oyok-ikhaana ọkkakwẹ, amma wạra ọdaakh-m bẹ́, antwạn ansi ọtọhm f'akpongnạng e. Tạma k'iwu ch'arạbhọ ator-m tạrr ukpira ma, ipina k'akhọ tạm nạ́nsia, okhenka ode bẹ́, adạbh-ofhon náchera bẹ́, ata ekpong e. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Kpa nnạm abhạna k'idira, udik k'asi kw'm'ọdwạkhọ adạbh-ofhon p'aPhilistiya o.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Ma wọ Devid n'ọbạbhọ bẹ́, “Nsi mbạng o? Bạng ipina jọ kk'asia k'amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ tạma k'iwu ch'uwa nnạbhọ ntor-ọ, tạrr ukpira ma o? Ukwuru yạn kw'nạn awawunanạng p'aro kwaam kw'ode ọvaarnạng abẹ m'nnima?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akish ubhina Devid bẹ́, “Amma nsong ma bẹ́, ipina k'ititikha saam kákhaam masẹ itọhmọ s'Ubinọkpaabyi s'nạn ipina ikhaam; udik ode bẹ́, adecho p'akpongnạng p'aPhilistiya abeni bẹ́, ‘Ẹma nọ́baana bẹ́, ọtwạn mạna abẹ ọta ekpong e.’ <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Ma wọ, uphyini k'ekpekpebha, tima atọhmnạng p'aro kwọ p'atwạnọ abọ, abhạna okpe kw'iwu k'ẹttaana.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Ma wọ Devid utim anạng pẹ ubina k'ekpekpebha ọkpa nnạm ọbhạna k'ẹkhạma ch'aPhilistiya, aPhilistiya abạra afona k'Jẹzrẹl.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Devid ofhọ anạng p'Amalẹk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Wa Devid ọttạra anạng pẹ atim iwu ittaan akpira Ziklag. Ma okpe ngwọ, anạng p'Amalẹk kk'Nẹgẹv ọttạra Ziklag achia k'ekpong. Abẹ kk'Ziklag abẹ arima tạrr abẹ akkạmọ kwẹ. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Abẹ abạra avạkha ipanạng ọttạra anạng p'aning ma phyibh, ọgbọsẹkhẹ ọttạra adennạng, abẹ atima bẹ phyibh afona, okhenka, abẹ atim bẹ ikhikhebhi afona.<verse eid="1SA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Masẹ Devid ọttạra ajunung pẹ akpir k'ofhon kw'Ziklag, abẹ n'asẹ bẹ́, abẹ kk'Ziklag akkạma phyibh, abẹ abạra avạkha ipanạng ọttạra iva pabẹ atima afona. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Ma wọ Devid ọttạra anạng pẹ agạm tạrr ẹfa ẹsa bẹ. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />N'ode sabẹ kk'ipanạng afa p'Devid pade Ahinoam kw'ubin Jẹzrẹl, ọttạra Abigẹl kw'ode opokwa kw'Nabal kw'ubin Kaamẹl avạkha atima afona. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Wa udik ngwọ ọphyaangẹ Devid ẹmma mororo, ukwuru s'uwa anạng pẹ n'aben bẹ́, atọbh-ẹ ata. Wa ọnạng kwidede n'okhaam ottem-pyibh ukwuru ipanạng ọttạra iva pabẹ. Okhenkha, Devid ọtạk ottembạr k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwẹ.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Ma wọ Devid n'obeni Abiyata kw'ode ọfọhnẹja, ọbạra ode nnwa kw'Ahimẹlẹk bẹ́, “Kken-m ẹphọd.” Abiyata ọtạkha ẹphọd okken-ẹ. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Ma wọ, Devid ọdwạn Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Aro kwaam, ma n'nkhubh ikhaana nnọ s'ichi ofhon o? S'm'nkke nkhạbha bẹ oro yeri?” Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọpọhna bẹ́, “Khubh bẹ, khiri m'akhạbha bẹ ọkhạbha, abạra arạbha anạng pọ k'abẹ k'mbọhk.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Ma wọ Devid ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh p'atwạnọ abẹ akpir k'ipekhuma s'Bẹsọr, k'ibyi sabẹ achokhu anạng bạnọ. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Wa ẹfa ẹsa anạng nạbh jobh tạrr abẹ dạkhẹ ipekhuma nnọ nákke ajekha. Okhenkha, Devid ọttạra ajunung pẹ ẹnọhna afon ororo akhubh anạng mbọ.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Wa abẹ ase oJipnạng wạnọ kw'uning k'owonu, abẹ avạkh-ẹ akkena Devid. Abẹ anạng-ẹ uchiattọhk uchi, abẹ abạra anạng-ẹ asi ogwo. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Abẹ abạra atạkha igbugbo sabẹ atim afig p'agwu-ugwu asi, ọttạra akwa afa p'igbugbo sabẹ atim agrep p'agwu-ugwu asi, anạng-ẹ, uchi, ọbạra ọkhaama ẹfa. Ẹma wa uchiattọhk vạnọ-vạnọ tạm núchia, asi bạnọ-bạnọ tạm núgwa k'iwu ittaan ọttạra nnunguwu nttaan.<verse eid="1SA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Wa Devid ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọma ade kw'anẹ? Abin mạn?” Ọnạng nwọ ọbẹ́, “Amma mbin Ijip, nde ubira kw'ọnạng kw'ubin Amalẹk. Aro kwaam ufhum-m ọbhạrẹ ma, s'ọmma-m k'iwu ittaan s'kk'isenga. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Amạna kk'Nẹgẹv kw'aKẹrẹt, ọttạra ukhubha kw'Juda, ọttạra Nẹgẹv kw'Kalẹb anchia k'ekpong, ambạra ankkạmọ Ziklag.”<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Devid ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Sạmạna atim-m eden nta nkhebha ikhaana s'akpongnạng mbọ p'achi ifhon nnọ k'ekpong?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Ọpọhna bẹ́, “Ọma chekhi ma ititikha s'Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, khaam máfhọ, khaam ọbọhk mábạra atte anạng aro kwaam. Amma m'ntim-ọ utima anta k'ibyi sabẹ aning.”<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Ma wọ oJipnạng nwọ utim Devid eden, abẹ ata akhebha abAmalẹk p'kk'anyaama abaabha ibyi sidede. Abẹ n'achi, abẹ agwo, n'asi erobha, ukwuru ekpo sabhaada py'abẹ kk'achia k'ekpong ch'abẹ arim aPhilistiya ọttạra aJuda abẹ. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Devid urima bẹ abẹ tạma ma ẹchọhkha njọ tạrr ukpira k'ẹchọhkha ch'iwu ẹdwạkh-ọdwạk. Wa ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'ọnnaang kóde, oyonga adikkobh ẹnọhna p'avur akamẹl arạbh afona. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Wa Devid ọkpa nnạm ọtạkha ọttọhk fidede, ọttạra ipanạng pẹ afa p'Amalẹk kk'atạkha. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Ọttọhk vạnọ-vạnọ f'uwa udimi kóde. Wa Devid utim ọttọhk fidede ọkpa nnạm, ọgbọsẹkhẹ ọttạra adennạng, adikkọbh ọttạra aminava, ọttạra fidede f'anạng mbọ kk'achia k'ekpong. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Wa Devid ọkpa nnạm ọtạkha itirakpo phyi-phyibh, akpongnạng pẹ ayaar atima achi-ẹ eden n'aben bẹ́, “Ma wọ ode ekpo p'Devid uchi k'ekpong e.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Wa Devid ọkpa nnạm ukwu okhebha anạng nạbh jobh mbọ p'wạra ẹfa kk'bẹ ẹsa, p'nạn abẹ nákke atwạn bạra abẹ atte bẹ ọbọhk k'ipekhuma s'Bẹsọr. Anạng mbọ ayin ka akwu akhebha Devid ọttạra anạng p'atwạnọ abẹ. Masẹ Devid ọttạra anạng pẹ aseng abaanga bẹ, Devid osima bẹ. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Okhenkha, abyibyanạng ọttạra akhọrnạng phyibh p'attạr k'ikhaana s'anạng p'atwạnọ Devid abẹ abeni bẹ́, “Ukwuru sabẹ nạn mạna abẹ nátwạna ata ekpong njọ, abẹ okhebh vạnọ-vạnọ ma ekpo py'anchi k'ekpong mákhaama. Tte ujunung kwidede okhenka ọtạkha ikwanạng kwẹ ọttạra iva pẹ ọsọhng ọbhạna.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Devid oben bẹ́, “Mma o, ivotte paam. Tte nạngẹ oche ngwọ ansi k'ekpo p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'mạna ọnạnga. Ẹma kk'mạna ọkpakpa ubhubha, ọbạra ọtạkha akpongnạng p'arim mạna abẹ oge mạna kk'mbọhk. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Anẹ wọ m'ọkhọhmọ bạnga itọhng k'udik ngwama o? Okhebh pf'anạng ọnạng kw'okkeri ekpongkpo m'ode obengana ọttạra pf'ọnạng kw'ọta ekpong. Ọnạng kwidede m'ọtạkha okhebh obengana.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Wa Devid ochokhu udik ngwọ masẹ inyina ọttạra nttọhna, ọnạng anạng p'Israẹl, tạma ma iwu njọ tạrr ukpira chemma.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Masẹ Devid ukpir k'Ziklag, ọtọhmọ okhebh f'ekpo byạnọ py'abẹ achi k'ekpong okkena adecho p'Juda, p'ade ayok-odikobh pẹ, oben bẹ́, “Ma wọ ode ẹnạnga chabạnga ch'ibin k'ekpo py'anchi k'awawunanạng p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi e.”<verse eid="1SA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Wa ọtọhmọ ẹnạnga njọ okkena anạng k'Bẹtẹl, ọttạra k'Ramọt Nẹgẹv, ọttạra k'Jatir, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />ọttạra k'Aroe, ọttạra k'Siphmọt, ọttạra k'Ẹstẹmoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />ọttạra k'Rakal, ọttạra k'ifhon s'aJẹramẹl ọttạra s'aKen, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />ọttạra k'Họma, ọttạra k'Bor-Ashan, ọttạra k'Atak, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />ọttạra k'Hẹbrọn, ọttạra anạng p'aning k'ibyi sidede s'Devid ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ kk'akpaanga akpira.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Obo kw'Saul ọttạra iva pẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Ma okpe ngwọ, aPhilistiya ata arima anạng p'Israẹl abẹ. Anạng p'Israẹl arạbh k'ititikha s'aPhilistiya. Wa anạng p'Israẹl sabhaada ape k'okpecho kw'Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Wa aPhilistiya akhubh Saul ọttạra iva pẹ ẹkhạm-ẹkhạma, abẹ afhọ iva p'Saul p'ade: Jonatan, ọttạra Abinadab, ọttạra Malki-Shua. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Ekpong njọ efon ororo ẹkhạm tạrr ekọbha Saul ege k'ngekha. Abẹ att-ẹ ayuk, abẹ asi ẹ ebhena ọkkachẹ.<verse eid="1SA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Ma o, Saul oben utim-ekpongkpo kwẹ bẹ́, “Twạr ọkkangkkang-kkro kwọ fhọm, deja akpatwạr nạng mba ma'kwu akhebh-m ma asim irem abạra afhọm. abạra atim-m asi ọkkọn-yukha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 31:4">Okhenkha, utim-ekpongkpo kwẹ udik ngwọ ojor-ẹ, khẹ nóchera ọfhọ. Osenga ma, Saul ọtạkha ọkkangkkang-kkro kwẹ oyeni, otto ukhum ọfhọ ifor sẹ. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Masẹ utim-ekpongkpo kwẹ ose bẹ́, Saul kk'upua, ẹma ọbạra otto ọkpẹkhẹ ọkkangkkang-kkro kwẹ oyeni, ope Saul abẹ. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Ma wọ Saul ọttạra iva pẹ attaan, ọttạra utim-ekpongkpo kwẹ, ọttạra ajunung pẹ phyibh, ape ma iwu njọ jạnẹ.<verse eid="1SA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Masẹ ajunung p'Israẹl p'arukhu k'ukhubha ngwọkha kw'ipekhuma, ọttạra ayok p'arukhu k'Jọrdan ukhubha, n'ase bẹ́, akpongnạng p'Israẹl kk'arạbha, ọttạra bẹ, Saul ọttạra iva pẹ kk'apua, abẹ abina arik ifhon sabẹ, arạbh afona, aPhilistiya akwu atạkha aruk.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Iwu echobh ma, masẹ aPhilistiya akwu bẹ́, akwu afhạngọ apfura mbọ, abẹ ase abukhu p'Saul ọttạra iva pẹ attaan p'atto ayima k'okpecho kw'Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Abẹ akpaara echo ch'Saul, abạra atạkha ekpongkpo pyẹ. Abẹ atọhm akpaakh-nkkaabha bẹ́, abẹ anạng ẹyaakha njọ k'ẹkhạma ch'aPhilistiya <char style="it">bẹ wạạm,</char> ọttạra k'ọkhapa kw'akha pabẹ, ọttạra k'anạng pabẹ. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Abẹ atạkha ekpongkpo py'Saul achok k'ọkhapa kw'akpatava p'Ashtọrẹt. Abẹ atạkha ubukhu kwẹ adạbh k'udimokpon kw'ofhon kw'Bẹt-Shan.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Masẹ anạng p'Jabẹsh-Gilead abhaang udik kw'aPhilistiya kk'Saul asia, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />akkemkpa pabẹ phyibh abina osenga ma irungu njọ afona k'Bẹt-Shan. Abẹ asạkha ubukhu kw'Saul ọttạra iva pẹ k'udimokpon kw'Bẹt-Shan, atima afona k'Jabẹsh ata akkạmọ. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Ma wọ abẹ n'atạk akhạbhọ pabẹ annọhnga k'irin ch'ichi ch'tamarisk k'Jabẹsh. Abẹ ayim okwo k'iwu isenọfa.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>